-- 1407: Carve the three non-description sections out of short_description into
--       per-course cms/block rows, leaving the course description card clean.
--
-- Goal: the "What's This Course About" card must contain ONLY the course
-- description. Partner accreditation, certification-exam venue and funding
-- copy are each removed from it and rendered as their own storefront card
-- by catalog/product/view.phtml.
--
-- Blocks created (identifier -> storefront card):
--   course_<SKU>_certification_exam -> "Certification Exam" card   (97 courses)
--   course_<SKU>_funding_and_grant  -> "Funding Options" card     (364 courses)
--
-- The PARTNER accreditation blurb is stripped from the description but gets
-- NO block: the card is rebuilt from the existing atc_partners checkboxes,
-- which every affected course already has set, and whose canonical copy is
-- cleaner than the inline text removed here (some of which had a duplicated
-- sentence). A per-course partner block would only reintroduce that drift.
--
-- 393 courses touched in total; each description is rewritten with those
-- sections removed.
--
-- Notes for future editors:
--  * The funding block REUSES the existing `funding_and_grant` identifier, which
--    view.phtml already reads for non-TGS courses. No WSQ conflict: SG WSQ
--    (TGS-) courses are badge/checkbox-driven and never read the block
--    (guarded by $_isSgWsqCourse), so the WSQ Funding card is unaffected.
--  * Block bodies are stored WITHOUT their original <h2> heading — each card
--    renders its own <h3> title, so keeping it would double the heading.
--  * Idempotent: blocks use INSERT ... WHERE NOT EXISTS on identifier; the
--    description UPDATEs are keyed to the exact pre-migration value, so a
--    re-run matches nothing and is a no-op.
--  * apply.php splits on ";" at end-of-line — every statement is ONE line.
--    Do not reformat.
--  * SG-only via @mms_instance: these SKUs/descriptions are the SG catalogue.
--    Partner sites (MY/GH) have their own descriptions and are untouched.
--  * Verified valid UTF-8 before commit (see feedback_migration_applyphp_utf8_outage).

SET @is_sg := IF(@mms_instance = 'SG', 1, 0);
SET @sd_attr := (SELECT attribute_id FROM eav_attribute WHERE attribute_code = 'short_description' AND entity_type_id = 4);

UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Venture into the world of mobile UI design with our specialized course on Building Mobile UI with Flutter. Beginning with a comprehensive setup of the Flutter SDK, participants will journey through the dynamic capabilities of Dart programming. This foundation enables learners to grasp the nuances of using widgets effectively, ultimately paving the way for crafting visually appealing and functionally robust mobile interfaces.</p> <p>Beyond the aesthetic components, this course emphasizes the importance of user experience, focusing on adding essential interactivity, routing, and navigation features. With each module designed to reinforce key concepts, participants emerge with a holistic understanding of Flutter-driven mobile UI design. Under expert guidance, embark on this transformative experience with Tertiary Courses and shape the future of mobile applications.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1235 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1044 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Elevate your project and content management capabilities with our comprehensive Notion Masterclass. This course provides an in-depth understanding of Notion''s functionalities, from foundational concepts to advanced techniques. You will learn to navigate and customize workspaces, create and manage pages and databases, and utilize Notion''s powerful collaboration tools. Our expert instructors will guide you through workspace management, content customization, database essentials, and integrations, ensuring you master every aspect of Notion for enhanced productivity and efficiency.</p> <p>By the end of this masterclass, you will be proficient in using Notion for managing projects and content, collaborating within workspaces, and leveraging advanced features like database templates, automations, and Notion AI. This course is ideal for professionals seeking to streamline their workflow</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 9 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1392 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Harness the full potential of PowerPoint with this essential training. Beginning with crafting impactful presentations, whether starting from scratch or utilizing templates, you will delve into integrating text, images, tables, and videos seamlessly. Learn the art of slide design with Slide Master, Theme, and Designer tools, ensuring your presentations always maintain a professional edge. SmartArt, a pivotal feature, aids in embedding diagrams, enhancing visual comprehension for your audience.</p> <p>Advance your presentation prowess with techniques that elevate user experience. Dive into formatting images, arranging objects, and optimizing slide transitions. The course also spotlights the potent Morph transition, which adds a dynamic flair to your decks. For those aiming to perfect their delivery, the addition of speaker notes and the use of Presenter Coach will be invaluable. Finally, with the Presenter View, seamlessly manage your slides during live presentations, ensuring a smooth and impactful delivery every time.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 12 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1596 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>This course, Effective Project Management with Generative AI, is designed to provide professionals with cutting-edge techniques to enhance every phase of project management using AI. You''ll begin by learning how to initiate and plan projects efficiently by developing project charters, engaging stakeholders, and setting comprehensive management plans for scope, cost, schedule, and risks. With GenAI tools, you''ll gain new insights into improving planning effectiveness and achieving superior project outcomes.</p> <p>During the execution and delivery stages, you''ll harness AI to manage teams, resources, and communications, ensuring quality and stakeholder satisfaction. You''ll also explore AI-driven methods to monitor risks, control project changes, and close projects with optimal results. By the end of the course, you''ll be equipped to manage even complex projects more effectively, with advanced skills in AI-based decision-making and real-time risk response.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 13 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1668 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Dive into the profound depths of MySQL, a globally renowned open-source relational database, with our essential training program. This course meticulously covers the art of writing pinpointed queries, the essence of creating and updating databases and tables, and effectively using MySQL''s array of built-in functions. Additionally, sharpen your skills in sorting and filtering data, updating tables with strategic triggers, and seamlessly working with subselects and views.</p> <p>In the digital age, database management and operations are pivotal. MySQL, with its robust features and scalability, stands out as a preferred choice for many developers. Our course is crafted to provide a wholesome understanding, introducing learners to the diverse aspects of MySQL, from basic operations to creating and harnessing stored functions. Step up your database management game and drive innovation with the expert guidance of Tertiary Courses.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 32 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1372 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Dive into the intricacies of Google Ads with our comprehensive Essential Training. This course offers a detailed look into the world of Google''s advertising platform, breaking down the complexities of Quality Score, the auction system, and much more. Whether you''re a novice aiming to set realistic expectations for your campaigns or a seasoned marketer aiming to polish your skills, this course caters to all.</p> <p>From the initial steps of creating an Ads account, researching potent keywords using the Keyword Planner tool, to the advanced techniques of setting up Google Analytics for conversion tracking and running a successful remarketing campaign, every topic is meticulously covered. Coupled with hands-on examples, this course ensures that you emerge with a holistic understanding and the confidence to drive successful Google Ads campaigns.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 31 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1405 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Unlock the comprehensive knowledge of Magento 2 with our in-depth training. The course encompasses vital aspects like store configurations, catalog setup, and advanced performance enhancement strategies, ensuring you gain a holistic understanding. Further, amplify your eCommerce prowess with Magento 2''s marketing, promotions, SEO, and the integration of cutting-edge themes and extensions.</p> <p>With a firm focus on real-world application, our curriculum is designed to make you proficient in harnessing Magento 2''s vast capabilities. Whether you''re looking to elevate your online store''s performance or want to delve into the nuances of Magento''s robust platform, this training offers all the tools and insights you need for eCommerce success.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 42 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1187 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Embark on a journey to online retail success with our meticulously crafted course, tailored to equip aspiring entrepreneurs with the necessary knowledge and skills to establish a successful online store. Whether you are eyeing the bustling marketplaces of Shopee and Lazada or envision a unique brand identity on Shopify, this course serves as a launchpad for your ecommerce venture. With a keen focus on the prominent online retail landscapes in Singapore and Malaysia, the course material is curated to offer actionable insights and a practical approach to overcoming the common challenges faced in the ecommerce realm.</p> <p>In just one day, immerse yourself in a comprehensive learning experience that covers the A to Z of online store setup. Delve into the nuances of marketplace dynamics, understand the key differentiators between various platforms, and get hands-on with the tools and technologies that power modern online retail. With a blend of theoretical knowledge and practical exercises, this course aims to empower participants to take the leap into the ecommerce world with confidence and expertise. Your gateway to mastering the online retail ecosystem and propelling your business towards sustainable success starts here.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 10 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1422 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Our DP-203 Microsoft Certified: Azure Data Engineer Associate Exam Prep course is meticulously designed to provide you with the knowledge and skills required to excel in the Azure data engineering domain. By enrolling in this course, you will gain in-depth insights into data engineering concepts, tools, and best practices, empowering you to implement effective data solutions on Azure.</p> <p>With a focus on real-world applications, this course will guide you through the essential aspects of Azure data engineering, including data storage, data processing, and data security. You will learn how to leverage Azure tools and services to build scalable and secure data engineering solutions, enhancing your ability to deliver value to your organization. Enroll today and take the first step towards becoming a Microsoft Certified Azure Data Engineer!</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1000 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2552 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Turn raw data into decisions with our hands-on Tableau Masterclass. Tableau is the industry-standard platform for visual analytics, and this masterclass takes you beyond building charts to crafting complete data narratives&mdash;starting with the essentials of designing compelling storyboards that lay the groundwork for effective data communication. Our expert-guided training ensures that participants not only understand but also skillfully apply various storytelling and visualization techniques to make their data speak volumes.</p> <p>Beyond mere theory, the masterclass accentuates on knowing your audience and crafting visual narratives that resonate. By integrating effective visuals, participants will learn to convey complex data points with clarity and impact. The program culminates with practical sessions, enabling attendees to distill complex datasets into clear, compelling, and actionable stories. Whether you''re presenting to stakeholders or aiming to influence business decisions, the Tableau Masterclass arms you with the tools to do it persuasively.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1013 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1470 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Discover the essentials of SharePoint, a vital tool for efficient document management and team collaboration. Our course is tailored to equip you with the skills to effectively navigate and utilize SharePoint''s features. You''ll learn to set up sites, manage documents, and integrate SharePoint into daily operations, enhancing overall team efficiency and productivity. This training is ideal for those looking to elevate their workplace collaboration skills, ensuring a more organized and streamlined business environment.</p> <p>Further, delve into advanced functionalities of SharePoint, including customizing layouts, automating workflows, and mastering document control. Our expert-led sessions provide hands-on experience, ensuring practical application in real-world scenarios. Whether you''re a beginner or an experienced user, this course will enhance your ability to leverage SharePoint for optimal teamwork and business management. Join us to become a proficient SharePoint user, boosting your team''s productivity and collaboration.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1014 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1541 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The integration of artificial intelligence (AI) in healthcare is transforming the industry. Stay ahead of the curve and gain a comprehensive understanding of AI applications, techniques, and ethics in healthcare with our online course. Led by healthcare professionals and AI experts, this course will equip you with the knowledge and skills to improve diagnosis, treatment, and patient care using cutting-edge techniques like machine learning, deep learning, natural language processing, and computer vision.</p> <p>You''ll also explore ethical considerations and regulatory frameworks related to AI in healthcare. Through hands-on projects and case studies, you''ll develop practical solutions to real-world healthcare challenges. This course is designed for professionals looking to advance their knowledge and skills in AI for healthcare. Join us now to unlock the future of healthcare.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1018 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1257 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Master the art of orchestrating multiple AI agents with AutoGen in this comprehensive course designed for professionals looking to harness the power of collaborative artificial intelligence. Learn how to build intelligent AI agents using AutoGen AgentChat, implement Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) to enhance agent capabilities with real-time data retrieval, and design sophisticated multi-agent workflows that automate complex tasks. This course provides hands-on experience in creating AI systems where multiple agents collaborate, communicate, and solve problems together, giving you a competitive edge in the rapidly evolving AI landscape.</p> <p>Gain practical skills in building RAG-powered agents that leverage external knowledge bases for more accurate and contextually relevant responses. Explore how to architect and deploy multi-agent AI workflows using AutoGen, enabling you to automate business processes, streamline decision-making, and build scalable AI solutions. Whether you are a developer, data scientist, or AI enthusiast, this course equips you with the tools and techniques to design, implement, and manage multi-agent AI systems that drive innovation and productivity in your organisation.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1035 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1388 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Step into the dynamic world of cloud computing with our AWS Certified Cloud Practitioner (CLF-C02) Exam Prep course. Designed to build a strong foundational understanding, this course guides you through the essential concepts and technicalities of the AWS platform. Whether you are a beginner aiming to start a career in cloud computing or a professional looking to enhance your skills, our course is meticulously crafted to cater to different learning levels. Through this comprehensive course, you''ll grasp the fundamentals of AWS Cloud architecture, cost management, and security protocols, paving the way for a promising career in the cloud domain.</p> <p>In a rapidly evolving tech landscape, it''s vital to stay abreast with the latest advancements. Our AWS Certified Cloud Practitioner Exam Prep equips you with the necessary skills and knowledge to excel in the AWS ecosystem. By the end of this course, you will have honed your abilities in identifying AWS Cloud services, understanding the AWS shared responsibility model, and appreciating the core deployment and operational principles. Leveraging practical insights and hands-on experience, this course is your gateway to a proficient understanding and a successful career in cloud technology. Make the most of this opportunity and unlock your potential with a certification that adds significant value to your professional trajectory.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1041 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1939 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Embark on a transformative journey into the foundational and advanced realms of Generative Adversarial Networks (GANs) with our meticulously curated training at Tertiary Courses. Starting with a robust understanding of the Basic GAN Framework, participants are gradually introduced to the intricacies and nuances of this groundbreaking AI technology.</p> <p>Delving deeper, the training unravels the layers behind DCGAN, WGAN, and the highly intriguing Conditional GAN. These advanced modules ensure participants grasp the holistic view of GANs, empowering them with the expertise to develop sophisticated AI models. This course is the key to unlocking the immense potential and creativity that GANs offer in the realm of artificial intelligence.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1043 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1326 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Step into the cutting-edge domain of Deep Reinforcement Learning (DRL) with our tailored program at Tertiary Courses. Beginning with the foundational concepts of Markov Decision Process (MDP) and Reinforcement Learning (RL), we ensure a profound understanding, setting the stage for more advanced subjects. With hands-on exercises, participants will grasp RL dynamics using prominent tools like OpenAI Gym and Stable Baselines, paving the way to practical application and comprehension.</p> <p>Venturing further, the course covers the intricacies of algorithms such as Q-Learning, DQN, Policy Gradient, A2C, A3C, and PPO. Custom Policy Networks on Stable Baselines enrich the learning experience, allowing participants to tweak and adapt as per specific requirements. Concluding with a brief insight into Model-based RL, this program encapsulates the broad spectrum of DRL, ensuring participants are well-equipped to handle real-world AI challenges.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1045 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1444 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Dive into the future of technology with our Digital Transformation with Metaverse and Web 3.0 course. This comprehensive training provides essential insights into the evolving digital landscapes shaped by Metaverse and Web 3.0 technologies. Participants will learn about the integration of digital and physical spaces, the role of blockchain in securing digital assets, and the revolutionary impact of decentralized platforms on businesses and personal interactions. The course is designed to equip professionals with the skills needed to navigate and lead in a digitally transformed world, emphasizing practical applications and strategic thinking.</p> <p>The curriculum goes beyond theory, with hands-on sessions that allow learners to experience the Metaverse environment and utilize Web 3.0 tools in real-time scenarios. By the end of this course, attendees will have a robust understanding of how these cutting-edge technologies can drive innovation, enhance customer engagement, and create new business opportunities. Whether you''re looking to advance in your current field or pivot to a tech-centric career, this course will provide the knowledge and tools to effectively harness the potential of digital transformation.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1047 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1778 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Embark on a successful IT career with our Comptia Server+ Exam Prep course. This comprehensive course covers all the essential topics needed to ace the exam and become proficient in server management. You will learn about server hardware, server administration, security, and more, ensuring you are well-equipped to handle the challenges of an IT professional in server management.</p> <p>Our expert instructors and well-structured curriculum will provide you with the knowledge and skills required to pass the Comptia Server+ exam. We focus on practical, real-world scenarios to ensure you are ready to apply what you''ve learned in your job. With our course, you will gain the confidence and expertise needed to excel in your IT career. So, enroll now and take the first step towards becoming a Comptia Server+ certified professional.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1049 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1405 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>This Machine Learning Specialization&nbsp; introduces you to the exciting, high-demand field of Machine Learning. Through a series of hand on practical exercises, you will gain applied experience in major areas of Machine Learning including Prediction, Classification, Clustering, Computer Vision and Deep Learning. You will learn to analyze data and&nbsp; build intelligent applications that can make predictions from data.</p> <p>This five days classroom facilitator Machine Learning Specialisation course will build your fundation in Python first, then follow by classical Machine Learning using Scikit Learn, follow by Deep Learning using Tensorflow 2.x framework.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1053 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 839 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Embark on a transformative journey into the realm of Raspberry Pi and Internet of Things (IoT) with our 4-Day Specialization Course. The program commences with grounding participants in Raspberry Pi basics, setting a robust foundation for the intricate lessons ahead. As the course progresses, attendees will delve into the art of data sensing using Raspberry Pi, harnessing the power of this versatile microcomputer to capture, analyze, and react to environmental factors, paving the way for smarter, more responsive IoT systems.</p> <p>The learning curve then ascends to IoT integration techniques specific to Raspberry Pi, introducing participants to the dynamic world of Node-Red – a pivotal platform for wiring together devices. The climax of this intensive course centers on the integration of Raspberry Pi with LoRa, a long-range communication platform, empowering attendees to craft expansive IoT networks with wider reach and reliability. By the course''s culmination, participants will emerge as well-versed Raspberry Pi IoT specialists, primed to lead in the continually evolving world of connected devices.</p> <p><span style="color: #ff0000;"><strong>Note that the Raspberry kit is used for the training. The course fee does not include the kit.</strong></span></p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1054 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1655 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Delve into the world of Continuous Integration and Continuous Deployment (CI/CD) with our comprehensive 5-day specialization in software development. The course commences with a robust understanding of the fundamentals of CI/CD, setting a strong foundation for what''s to come. Progress to hands-on experience building efficient CI/CD pipelines using Jenkins, ensuring streamlined and automated software delivery.</p> <p>Tertiary Courses proudly offers an immersive learning experience, guiding participants to harness the power of Selenium for effective CI/CD automation. Additionally, grasp the intricacies of integrating CI/CD with Gitlab, a crucial skill in today''s fast-paced software development environment. This course is tailored for those eager to achieve operational excellence, offering insights, techniques, and best practices that are vital in the contemporary development ecosystem.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1055 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1067 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Dive into the transformative world of elearning content with our Articulate Storyline 360 Masterclass. This masterclass encapsulates everything, from the very basics of elearning content to the intricate processes of inserting images, characters, external media, and even publishing handouts to Microsoft Word. Be it setting up your project preferences, adjusting slide properties, or exploring the potential of triggers and timings, this training has got you covered.</p> <p>Moreover, with our professionally curated curriculum, you''ll get hands-on experience in creating projects either from existing slides or from scratch. And to ensure that your content is inclusive, we also guide you on accessibility best practices. By the end, not only will you be adept at crafting interactive elearning modules, but you''ll also be proficient in assessing learner engagement through questions and publishing your course online.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1058 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1394 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Unlock the full potential of Adobe Captivate in your eLearning ventures with this essential training. Dive deep into creating robust, responsive projects while ensuring flexibility with the adept use of Fluid Boxes. Familiarize yourself with the essentials of previewing, building, and concluding projects seamlessly.</p> <p>Enhance your eLearning content with techniques on editing master slides, programming buttons, and selecting the optimal file format. With the addition of closed captions and voiceovers, make your content accessible and engaging. Furthermore, expand your horizons by exploring integration with other eLearning platforms, including the widely used SCORMs, ensuring a comprehensive grasp of today''s eLearning tools.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1059 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 902 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Robotic process automation (RPA) is revolutionizing business processes everywhere. Automation Anywhere is enterprise-grade RPA software that puts automation in the hands of your workers&mdash;without sacrificing reliability or security. This course introduces learners to the potential for automating repetitive tasks using Automation Anywhere. Review the components of Automation Anywhere architecture, and then discover how to create a bot step by step. You can study the three case studies included with the course to better understand how the automation process can be customized for your business.</p> </div>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1060 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1102 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The AI-901 Microsoft Azure AI Fundamentals course equips learners with the knowledge and foundational technical skills required to understand and build AI solutions on Microsoft Azure. Participants will explore core AI concepts and capabilities, the principles of responsible AI, how generative AI models work, and how to choose the right model, deployment options and configuration for a workload.</p> <p>Learners will gain hands-on expertise implementing AI solutions with Microsoft Foundry &mdash; creating effective prompts, deploying models, building lightweight chat and agent applications with the Foundry SDK, and adding text analysis, speech, computer vision, image generation and information extraction capabilities. By completing this course, participants will be prepared to work confidently with Azure AI services and Microsoft Foundry to deliver practical AI solutions.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1071 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1225 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Vibe Coding is revolutionising the way mobile applications are built, enabling developers and non-developers alike to create fully functional Android and iOS apps using AI-powered prompt engineering. This hands-on course introduces you to the world of Vibe Coding, where you will learn to leverage cutting-edge AI tools to generate UI components, manage application state, debug code, and rapidly prototype features &mdash; all through intuitive natural language prompts rather than traditional line-by-line coding.</p> <p>Throughout this course, you will progress from setting up your development environment and understanding mobile app frameworks to designing, building, and deploying complete mobile applications. You will gain practical experience in crafting effective prompts to generate and refine AI-produced code, mastering AI-assisted debugging and code refactoring techniques, and deploying your finished apps to both the Android and iOS platforms. Whether you are a business owner looking to build your own app, a marketer seeking technical fluency, or a developer aiming to accelerate your workflow, this course equips you with the skills to turn ideas into production-ready mobile apps at unprecedented speed.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1074 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1738 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Elevate your sales performance by adopting customer-centric selling techniques. This course provides a comprehensive approach to understanding client needs, building trust, and delivering solutions that drive results. By focusing on empathy, strategic communication, and value-driven selling, participants will learn how to create meaningful client interactions that lead to increased sales conversions and long-term customer loyalty.</p> <p>Participants will gain hands-on experience with techniques to identify key customer pain points, align products and services with client priorities, and close deals effectively. Whether you&rsquo;re a seasoned sales professional or new to the field, this course equips you with actionable tools to achieve your sales goals while fostering stronger client relationships.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1088 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1292 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The Robot Operating System (ROS) Specialization course is designed for robotics enthusiasts and professionals aiming to enhance their skills in advanced robotics software development. This specialization provides a deep dive into the fundamentals and advanced concepts of ROS (a.k.a ROS2), including efficient programming, simulation, and integration of autonomous systems. Participants will gain hands-on experience in utilizing ROS for real-world robotics applications, mastering techniques for building robust and intelligent robotic systems.</p> <p>Throughout the course, students engage with practical exercises and projects, ensuring a thorough understanding of ROS architecture, node management, and interfacing with hardware components. The curriculum also covers cutting-edge topics in robotics, such as sensor integration, navigation, and complex robotic movements, preparing learners for the demands of modern robotics challenges. Graduates of this specialization are well-equipped to innovate in the field of robotics, contributing to advancements in automation and AI.</p> <p><span style="font-size: 1.5em;">Certificate</span></p> <p>All participants will receive a Certificate of Completion from Tertiary Courses after achieved at least 75% attendance.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1091 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1791 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Empower your analytical skills with our comprehensive course on Data Analytics using Power Query and Power Pivot. This course is meticulously designed to equip you with the prowess of Power Query for data extraction and Power Pivot for data modelling. Learn to transform raw data into meaningful insights, streamline your decision-making process, and add value to your organization. With hands-on exercises and expert guidance, you''ll master the art of data analysis in no time.</p> <p>Our course is an ideal match for both beginners aiming to kickstart their journey in data analytics, and professionals keen on refining their analytical skills further. Covering a broad spectrum from basic data extraction to complex data modelling and visualization techniques, this course promises a deep-dive into the world of data analytics.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1097 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1339 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Embark on a journey to mastering the Google Cloud Platform with our Google Associate Cloud Engineer Certification Exam Prep course. This comprehensive course is meticulously designed to equip you with the knowledge and skills needed to excel in the Google Associate Cloud Engineer Certification Exam, ensuring you are well-prepared to tackle the challenges of the exam and achieve certification success.</p> <p>Our course covers all the essential topics and provides practical insights to help you understand the intricacies of the Google Cloud Platform. With expert instructors and a curriculum tailored to the exam''s requirements, you will gain a deep understanding of the platform, enhancing your cloud skills and opening up new career opportunities. Enroll now and take the first step towards becoming a certified Google Associate Cloud Engineer.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1098 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1505 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Dive into the enthralling realm of Quantum Computing with our comprehensive Quantum Computing Specialization. This course is meticulously designed to provide you with a deep understanding of quantum mechanics, quantum information theory, and the key principles of quantum computing. You will learn the intricacies of quantum algorithms, their implementation, and how they differ from classical algorithms, providing you with a critical edge in this rapidly advancing field.</p> <p>The course also covers practical aspects of quantum computing, including quantum software development and quantum technology''s application in solving complex real-world problems. Through hands-on exercises and expert guidance, you''ll acquire the skills necessary to contribute to the future of technology. Whether you''re a professional aiming to upgrade your skills or a student passionate about quantum technologies, this specialization is your gateway to becoming a part of the quantum revolution.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1101 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1614 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Step into the world of advanced network analysis with our 4-day Wireshark specialization course. This intensive program is designed to equip attendees with the skills to unravel the complexities of network behaviors, performance bottlenecks, and potential security vulnerabilities. The training lays emphasis on key areas such as identifying performance glitches arising from path latency, pinpointing devices that drop packets, and validating the optimal configuration of network hosts. It goes a step further to analyze intricate dependencies, optimize application behaviors, and offer insights into the functionalities of TCP/IP networks.</p> <p>In the modern digital environment, understanding the behavior and security of applications during various stages is paramount. This course hones in on techniques to verify application security during crucial junctures like login, launch, and data transfer. Participants will also learn to spot anomalies in network traffic, indicative of potentially compromised hosts, and develop proficiency in using graphical representations to report issues such as server performance slowdowns, packet losses, and network congestion. By the end of this immersive course, attendees will have transformed into network analysis mavens, adept at leveraging Wireshark for optimal network health and security.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1123 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1510 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>This course covers the content required for the&nbsp;<strong>Microsoft Office Specialist: Excel Associate MO-200</strong> certification exam,&nbsp;For more details on Microsoft Office Specialist: Excel Associate MO-200 , please refer <a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/certifications/mos-excel-2019/?tab=tab-learning-paths" title="Microsoft Office Specialist: Excel Associate (Office 2019)" target="_blank"><span style="text-decoration: underline;">here</span>.</a></p> <h2>Training Info</h2> <p>This is a synchronous e-learning course conducted by certified Microsoft trainers from&nbsp;<span style="text-decoration: underline;"><a href="https://www.synergetics-india.com/" title="Synergetics Information Technology Services India Pvt. Ltd." target="_blank">Synergetics Information Technology Services India Pvt. Ltd</a></span> (Microsoft Learning Partner)</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1128 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2169 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Our CompTIA PenTest+ Exam Prep Course is designed for cybersecurity professionals seeking to master penetration testing skills and earn the CompTIA PenTest+ certification. This comprehensive course covers all aspects of the PenTest+ exam objectives, including planning and scoping, information gathering, vulnerability identification, attacks and exploits, and reporting and communication. Through expert instruction and hands-on practice, participants will learn advanced techniques in ethical hacking and security testing, essential for identifying and addressing system vulnerabilities.</p> <p>The course also emphasizes the ethical considerations and compliance standards in penetration testing, ensuring participants are not only technically proficient but also professionally responsible. With a focus on real-world scenarios and practical applications, our training prepares you for success in the CompTIA PenTest+ exam and equips you with the skills to contribute significantly to your organization''s cybersecurity efforts.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1136 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1652 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Immerse in the intricate world of manufacturing design with our Fusion 360 - Design for Manufacturing Professional ACP Certification Prep. This meticulously curated course delves deep into Fusion 360''s advanced capabilities, aligning perfectly with modern design for manufacturing (DFM) principles. Participants will explore the software''s vast tools, from detailed 3D modeling to simulation capabilities, ensuring every design is optimized for manufacturing processes.</p> <p>Beyond theoretical understanding, our training emphasizes hands-on practicality, preparing aspirants for the challenges of the ACP certification and real-world application. By the course''s culmination, learners will not only be well-versed in Fusion 360''s myriad features but will also possess the strategic know-how to seamlessly integrate DFM principles into every project, ensuring efficient, and cost-effective manufacturing outcomes.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1137 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2322 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Elevate your understanding of Robotic Process Automation with our UIPath RPA Essential Training. This meticulously crafted course provides a deep dive into core UIPath operations, offering participants a robust foundation in Control Flow Scripting, and a comprehensive grasp of automating emails, web interactions, and file operations.</p> <p>Beyond the basics, the training delves into sophisticated realms of RPA, including proficient error handling techniques, leveraging the UIPath Orchestrator for centralized robot management, and exploring the potential of cognitive activities. Whether you are a novice or a professional seeking to upgrade your RPA skills, this course provides the expertise you need.</p> </div>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1150 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1149 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>In today''s fast-paced work environment, resilience has become a crucial aspect of employee wellbeing and organizational success. Our course, ''Building Resilience at Work: Employee Health &amp; Wellness Strategies'', is designed to equip participants with the skills and knowledge to foster a resilient workforce. The course covers a range of topics, from understanding the fundamentals of resilience to implementing practical wellness strategies tailored for the workplace. Participants will learn about stress management techniques, mental health awareness, and ways to create a supportive work culture that prioritizes employee health.</p> <p>The course also delves into the development of personal resilience skills, enabling individuals to cope with workplace challenges effectively. We emphasize hands-on activities and real-world scenarios, ensuring that attendees can apply the learned concepts in their professional settings. By the end of this course, participants will have a comprehensive understanding of how to cultivate a resilient and healthy work environment, leading to improved employee satisfaction, productivity, and overall organizational performance.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1158 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1350 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Unlock the secrets to passing the CompTIA Linux+ exam with our comprehensive exam prep course. Our expert instructors have meticulously crafted the course content to cover all the essential topics and provide you with the knowledge and skills needed to ace the exam. From understanding Linux installation and package management to mastering file systems and scripting, we''ve got you covered.</p> <p>With our course, you''ll gain access to valuable exam tips, practice questions, and real-world examples that will help you apply your knowledge in practical situations. Our step-by-step approach will guide you through the entire exam syllabus, ensuring that you''re fully prepared to tackle any question that comes your way. Enroll now and take the first step towards achieving your CompTIA Linux+ certification and advancing your IT career.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1162 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1406 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Discover the essential strategies and best practices in business continuity management through our ISO 22301 Business Continuity Management System course. This program is meticulously designed to equip you with a profound understanding of ISO 22301 standards, focusing on developing robust and resilient business continuity plans. You''ll learn how to conduct thorough risk assessments, manage crises effectively, and ensure organizational continuity in face of disruptions. Ideal for professionals aiming to enhance their expertise in risk management and crisis response, this course offers both theoretical knowledge and practical insights to implement effective continuity strategies within any organization.</p> <p>Delve deeper into the nuances of business continuity management with practical case studies and hands-on exercises. Our course emphasizes on critical components such as emergency response, recovery plans, and business impact analysis, ensuring you are well-prepared to handle unforeseen business challenges. By the end of this program, you''ll not only gain valuable certification in ISO 22301 but also acquire the skills to safeguard your organization against potential threats and maintain operational efficiency during crises. This course is perfect for individuals seeking to bolster their credentials and organizations aiming to implement resilient business continuity frameworks.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1163 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1571 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Laravel is an open-source PHP framework, which is robust and easy to understand. It follows a model-view-controller design pattern. Laravel reuses the existing components of different frameworks which helps in creating a web application. The web application thus designed is more structured and pragmatic.</p> <p>Laravel offers a rich set of functionalities which incorporates the basic features of PHP frameworks like CodeIgniter, Yii and other programming languages like Ruby on Rails. Laravel has a very rich set of features which will boost the speed of web development.</p> <p>If you are familiar with Core PHP and Advanced PHP, Laravel will make your task easier. It saves a lot time if you are planning to develop a website from scratch. Moreover, a website built in Laravel is secure and prevents several web attacks.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1170 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 996 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Unlock the potential of ethical business practices with our ISO 37001 Anti-Bribery Management System course. This comprehensive training is designed to equip professionals and organizations with the necessary tools and knowledge to implement and manage an effective anti-bribery management system. Our expert-led course delves into the critical aspects of ISO 37001, providing insights into risk assessment, control measures, and the legal framework surrounding anti-bribery practices. Whether you are looking to strengthen your organization''s compliance posture or enhance your professional skillset, this course offers practical solutions and strategies to combat corruption and foster a culture of integrity.</p> <p>In just one day, gain the proficiency to navigate the complexities of anti-bribery management in the modern business landscape. Our course highlights include an in-depth exploration of ISO 37001 standards, practical case studies, and interactive sessions to ensure a thorough understanding of anti-bribery mechanisms. Participants will leave with a solid foundation in the principles of ethical business conduct, equipped to drive change and promote transparency within their organizations. Perfect for individuals and teams in Singapore and Malaysia, our course is also available with HRD Corp funding, making it an accessible option for all aspiring to excel in compliance and ethical business practices.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1174 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1596 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Unlock the full potential of Microsoft 365 Copilot to supercharge your work productivity. This course offers an extensive overview of Microsoft 365 Copilot, comparing the features of free Copilot, paid Copilot Pro, and Copilot for Microsoft 365. Learn how to create and improve presentations in PowerPoint, utilize Copilot Pro for Microsoft Office, and master the free Copilot tools for content creation.</p> <p>Dive deep into the powerful functionalities of Copilot for Excel, including inserting columns with formulas, creating charts and pivot tables, and conducting comprehensive data analysis. Explore Copilot for Teams and Outlook, where you''ll get to grips with Microsoft 365 Chat, summarize meetings and chats, work with prompts, and draft and summarize emails efficiently. Additionally, gain expertise in using Microsoft Loop and Copilot Studio to generate content, manage projects, and even create your own chatbot.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1177 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1492 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Embark on a journey to becoming a Certified Information Systems Auditor with our comprehensive CISA Exam Prep course. This course is meticulously designed for IT professionals aiming to deepen their expertise in IT governance, risk management, and information systems control. Through our expert-led training, you''ll gain a thorough understanding of the CISA certification requirements and the latest industry practices. Enhance your skills in identifying IT risks and implementing effective controls, ensuring you are well-prepared to tackle the CISA exam with confidence.</p> <p>Our CISA Exam Prep course not only prepares you for the exam but also equips you with practical knowledge applicable in the real world. Delve into key areas such as cybersecurity, IT auditing, and information systems management. Our interactive course modules and hands-on exercises provide an immersive learning experience, ensuring you grasp complex concepts with ease. Whether you''re looking to advance in your current role or pivot to a career in IT auditing and cybersecurity, this course lays the foundation for your success in the dynamic field of information systems.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1186 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1774 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The Linear Programming Optimisation course presents a robust approach to understanding and solving complex business or personal problems. Attendees will be equipped with the skills to meticulously analyze problem situations and structure them for effective solution derivation. Leveraging the capabilities of the Linear Programming model, the course illuminates the nuances of representing multifaceted problems in a systematic manner.</p> <p>With a focus on hands-on applications, participants will be guided on how to adeptly solve these models using the renowned Excel Solver tool. But the learning journey doesn''t end with problem-solving. Emphasis is placed on interpreting and analysing the comprehensive Excel Solver Reports to draw meaningful insights. By the culmination of this course, attendees will be primed to make informed recommendations and decisions based on these Excel Reports, ensuring optimal outcomes for diverse problem scenarios.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1188 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1683 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Embark on a journey to success with our PL-600 Microsoft Power Platform Solution Architect Exam Prep course. This meticulously crafted course is tailored to provide you with an in-depth understanding of the Microsoft Power Platform, equipping you with the knowledge and skills required to excel in the PL-600 exam. Our expert instructors will guide you through the intricacies of designing and implementing solutions on the Microsoft Power Platform, ensuring you are well-prepared to tackle the challenges of the exam and emerge victorious.</p> <p>Our course is not just about passing the exam; it''s about empowering you with the tools and confidence needed to thrive in the world of Microsoft Power Platform Solution Architect. You will gain practical insights and learn from real-world scenarios, ensuring you are ready to apply your knowledge in practical situations. By the end of the course, you will have a comprehensive understanding of Microsoft Power Platform Solution Architect, and be fully prepared to take on the PL-600 exam with confidence. Enroll now and take the first step towards achieving your Microsoft Power Platform Solution Architect certification and advancing your career.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1190 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2460 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Unlock the full potential of Microsoft 365 Copilot and revolutionize workplace productivity. This comprehensive course introduces Copilot&rsquo;s capabilities, exploring how AI-driven automation and assistance can optimize daily tasks. Learn how to enhance efficiency, streamline processes, and drive better decision-making across various business functions. From executives to sales, IT, marketing, finance, HR, and operations, this course covers real-world use cases tailored to different roles, providing hands-on strategies to leverage Copilot&rsquo;s AI-powered tools effectively.</p> <p>Through interactive lessons and practical demonstrations, participants will gain insights into extending and optimizing Microsoft 365 Copilot to fit their unique business needs. Learn how to automate workflows, improve collaboration, and harness data-driven insights with AI-powered assistance. Whether you''re a business leader, sales professional, IT specialist, or HR manager, this course equips you with the knowledge and skills to maximize Microsoft 365 Copilot&rsquo;s potential and drive business success.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1194 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1661 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Embark on a rewarding journey into the world of data analytics with our 5-day Data Analytics with R Specialization course. This comprehensive training is designed to equip you with in-depth knowledge and practical skills in using R, a powerful programming language for statistical analysis and data visualization. The course begins with the basics of R programming, ensuring a solid foundation even for beginners. As you progress, you will explore advanced data manipulation techniques and delve into the intricacies of data analysis. Our expert instructors will guide you through real-world scenarios, helping you understand how to apply these skills in a practical setting.</p> <p>The second half of the course focuses on more complex aspects of data analytics, including predictive modeling and machine learning using R. You will learn to create compelling data visualizations, a crucial skill in interpreting and presenting data effectively. This course not only enhances your analytical capabilities but also prepares you to tackle real-world data challenges in various industries. Whether you''re a professional looking to upskill, a student interested in data science, or an enthusiast eager to dive into data analytics, this course will set you on the path to mastering data analytics with R in just five days, opening doors to numerous career opportunities in the ever-growing field of data science.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1196 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1577 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p><strong>Cybersecurity</strong> risk is increasing, driven by global connectivity and usage of cloud services to store sensitive data and personal information. Widespread poor configuration of cloud services paired with increasingly sophisticated cyber criminals means the risk that your organization suffers from a successful cyber attack or data breach is on the rise.</p> <p>Cyber threats can come from any level of your organization. You must educate your staff about simple social engineering scams like phishing and more sophisticated cybersecurity attacks like ransomware or other malware designed to steal intellectual property or personal data.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1197 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 824 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Step into the world of programming with our 5 Days Python Programming Specialization course. This course is crafted for those aspiring to master Python, one of the most versatile and in-demand programming languages in the tech industry. Over the course of five days, you will be immersed in an intensive learning experience, covering the fundamentals of Python, from basic syntax and control structures to complex functions and modules. Our curriculum is designed to build a solid foundation, whether you''re a beginner or looking to refine your skills.</p> <p>In this specialization, you will explore the practical applications of Python in various domains such as data analysis, web development, and automation. The course highlights include hands-on projects and real-world scenarios that will equip you with the skills needed to solve complex problems efficiently. By the end of this course, you will not only understand the core concepts of Python programming but also be able to apply them in creating robust and scalable applications. This is more than just a programming course; it''s a gateway to advancing your career in tech, preparing you to tackle challenges and seize opportunities in the fast-evolving digital landscape.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1200 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1403 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Our 5-Day Full Stack Specialization Course is designed to provide you with a comprehensive understanding of full-stack development. This course will equip you with the necessary skills and knowledge to build complete web and software applications from start to finish. You will learn about front-end and back-end development, database management, and other essential full-stack development tools and technologies.</p> <p>Through hands-on training and expert guidance, you will gain practical experience in applying full-stack development principles to real-world projects. Our course is tailored to meet the needs of both beginners and experienced developers, ensuring that you can progress at your own pace and build a solid foundation in full-stack development. Enroll now and take the first step towards becoming a full-stack developer!</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1201 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1009 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Embark on a comprehensive learning journey with our 4 Days Container Specialization course, tailored to equip professionals with the cutting-edge skills in container technologies. This intensive program delves into the essentials of containerization, a pivotal component in modern software development and deployment. Participants will acquire a deep understanding of container principles, orchestration, and how these technologies integrate within a DevOps environment.</p> <p>Throughout this course, learners will engage in a blend of theoretical knowledge and hands-on practical experience. We cover a range of topics including container architecture, deployment strategies, orchestration tools like Kubernetes and Docker, and best practices for managing containerized applications. This course is especially beneficial for IT professionals, software developers, and system administrators aiming to enhance their expertise in container technologies. With our expert-led training, participants will be well-prepared to implement efficient, scalable, and secure container solutions in their organizations, setting a solid foundation for career advancement in this rapidly evolving field.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1202 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1358 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>This course follows the typical workflow and features of the Autodesk&reg; Revit&reg; Architecture software, including sections on modeling and materials, families, documentation, views, and Revit project management.</p> <p>&nbsp;In the course, you''ll review advanced modeling architectural topics and work with walls, floors, roofs, ceilings, stairs, columns, and rooms. You''ll also gain an understanding of exam topics such as family categories and types, phases and design options, schedules, and worksharing. Brush up on selection sets, detail components, color schemes, levels and grids, and much more.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1204 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2222 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>This Civil 3D exam prep course follow the typical workflow and features of the Autodesk&reg; AutoCAD&reg; Civil 3D&reg;&nbsp; software, including sections on points, parcels, and surveying, surfaces and grading, alignments and profiles, corridors and sections, pipe networks, and plan production and data management.</p> <p>In the course, you''ll review advanced infrastructure topics. You&rsquo;ll work with points and point groups, parcels and parcel styles, and the surveying tools. You''ll also gain an understanding of exam topics such as TIN surfaces and volume surfaces, profile views, and both pipe and pressure networks. Brush up on feature lines, sites and grading models, corridors, note label styles, data shortcuts, and much more</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1213 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2021 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Venture into the cutting-edge world of Building Information Modeling (BIM) with our specialized course focusing on construction management and planning using Revit and Navisworks. This training offers participants an in-depth exploration of how BIM can revolutionize construction methods, from enhancing model accuracy using parts to leveraging 4D simulations for effective materials planning and management.</p> <p>Participants will grasp the intricacies of creating federated models within Navisworks, executing precise clash tests, generating comprehensive clash reports, and utilizing 4D simulations. Additionally, the program delves into the nuances of quantity takeoffs, close-out tasks, commissioning, and efficiently adding maintainable asset data to the BIM model. By course completion, professionals will be armed with a robust set of skills and knowledge, propelling them to the forefront of construction management and planning using BIM.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1218 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1696 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>In the dynamic world of professional efficiency, the "Applying 5S Techniques" course stands as a beacon for those aiming to transform their work environment. This comprehensive course delves into the heart of the 5S methodology, a cornerstone of lean management, offering participants a deep understanding of each element: Sort, Set in Order, Shine, Standardize, and Sustain. Through a blend of theory and practical applications, learners will acquire the skills needed to organize their workspace efficiently, streamline processes, and foster a continuous improvement culture.</p> <p>Embarking on this journey, participants will be equipped with the tools to not only enhance their productivity but also to instill a mindset of quality and efficiency in their teams. This course is tailored for professionals across various sectors, including manufacturing, office management, and service industries, who are keen to adopt a structured approach to workplace organization. Embrace the power of 5S Techniques to create a conducive, efficient, and safe working environment, paving the way for operational excellence and heightened organizational performance</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1223 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1325 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The Build Large Language Models (LLM) and Deep Learning Applications with Keras 3 course is an all-encompassing program for AI practitioners aiming to advance their skills in natural language processing and computer vision. Starting with an overview of Keras 3&rsquo;s versatile architecture, participants will dive into backend integrations with TensorFlow, PyTorch, and JAX, explore KerasHub for pretrained models, and leverage the latest features in KerasNLP and KerasCV. This robust foundation enables the development of sophisticated language and vision applications.</p> <p>This course covers essential deep learning techniques, from creating transformer-based LLMs and custom chatbots to fine-tuning models for real-world applications, including hyperparameter tuning and model parallelism. By the end, learners will be able to deploy multimodal applications that integrate both language and vision, effectively preparing them for high-impact roles in AI and machine learning.</p> <h2></h2>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1228 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1148 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Dive into the world of cybersecurity with our 5 Days Ethical Hacking Specialisation, a meticulously designed course to foster the next generation of ethical hackers. This program offers an immersive experience, ensuring that participants acquire critical skills in identifying vulnerabilities, securing networks, and defending against cyber threats. The curriculum is tailored to provide a comprehensive understanding of ethical hacking fundamentals, including the latest tools and techniques used in the industry. Whether you''re a beginner or looking to upgrade your existing skills, this course is structured to cater to varying levels of expertise.</p> <p>Throughout the duration of the course, learners will be engaged in practical, real-world scenarios, simulating the challenges faced by today&rsquo;s cybersecurity professionals. Emphasis is placed on hands-on learning, with opportunities to apply theoretical knowledge to practical exercises. The course culminates with a project that allows participants to demonstrate their newfound skills in a controlled environment. Upon completion, graduates of the program will be equipped with the expertise needed to tackle contemporary cyber threats and will be prepared to take on roles as competent, ethical hackers in the rapidly evolving digital landscape.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1240 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1482 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Delve deep into the heart of electronics with our 3 Days Arduino Specialization at Tertiary Courses. Arduino, recognized globally as an open-source electronics platform, boasts of an interface that&rsquo;s both user-friendly and potent, making it an ideal choice for enthusiasts and professionals keen on bridging the gap between the physical and digital worlds. At its core, Arduino boards are designed to interpret various inputs, be it from sensors, buttons, or even digital messages, and transform them into tangible outputs, such as initiating motor actions, illuminating LEDs, or broadcasting data online.</p> <p>This intensive 3-day course demystifies the realm of Arduino, offering participants a clear understanding of its hardware and software dynamics. The curriculum places an emphasis on how instructions are relayed to the board''s microcontroller, dictating the board''s behavior. By the end of the course, participants will be adept at harnessing the power of Arduino to create, innovate, and bring their digital visions to life. Whether you''re an electronics novice or a seasoned tinkerer, this course is tailored to imbue you with the foundational knowledge and hands-on experience essential for Arduino mastery.</p> <p><span style="color: #ff0000;"><strong>Note that the Arduino kit is used for the training. The course fee does not include the kit.</strong></span></p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1242 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1553 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Embark on a transformative journey with our 5-day Digital Marketing Specialization course. This intensive program is meticulously designed to equip you with a thorough understanding of the digital marketing landscape. From day one, you''ll dive into the essentials of online marketing strategies, learning how to effectively harness tools such as SEO, SEM, and content marketing to propel your business or career forward. Our expert-led sessions will help you develop a keen understanding of consumer behavior and digital analytics, enabling you to create impactful marketing campaigns that resonate with your target audience.</p> <p>As you progress, the course intensifies, offering hands-on experience in social media marketing, email marketing, and digital advertising. You''ll explore the latest trends and techniques in the digital world, ensuring that you stay ahead of the curve. Our focus is not just on theoretical knowledge, but on practical skills that you can immediately apply. Whether you''re aiming to boost your own business, planning to embark on a new career in digital marketing, or looking to update your skill set, this course is your gateway to becoming a proficient digital marketer in just five days.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1243 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1391 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Embark on a comprehensive journey through the WSQ Fundamentals of the Personal Data Protection Act (PDPA) course. This course meticulously covers the latest updates from the Personal Data Protection Act 2020. Delve into practical applications of PDPA, understand how to adeptly manage data breaches in your organization, and learn the pivotal role of a Data Protection Officer. The course provides extensive training and communication strategies to ensure staff compliance with the PDPA.</p> <p>Demonstrating a proficient use of PDPA assessment tools is a cornerstone of this course, equipping organizations with the necessary knowledge and skills to maintain a robust data protection framework. Whether providing training for Data Protection Officers or enhancing the overall data protection culture within your organization, this course is a valuable asset for ensuring compliance and managing the complex landscape of personal data protection.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1245 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 3457 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Embark on a transformative journey with our 5 Days Web Development Specialization course, meticulously designed to cater to both beginners and those looking to deepen their knowledge in the dynamic field of web development. This intensive course covers fundamental topics such as HTML5, CSS3, and JavaScript, ensuring a solid foundation in the core aspects of web development. Participants will learn to create responsive designs, understand server-client interaction, and gain hands-on experience with real-world projects.</p> <p>Our specialized program is crafted to empower learners with the latest industry-standard skills, preparing them for the rapidly evolving digital world. The course goes beyond just coding; it fosters critical thinking and problem-solving skills, equipping students with the ability to tackle various web development challenges. This holistic approach ensures not only skill acquisition but also the development of a robust understanding of web development practices, making our graduates highly competent and market-ready professionals. Join us at Tertiary Courses for this empowering journey and take the first step towards becoming an accomplished web developer.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1246 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1364 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Dive into the world of WordPress with our focused 3-day WordPress CMS Specialization course. This intensive program is designed to fast-track your skills in one of the most popular content management systems. Starting from the basics, the course covers every essential aspect of WordPress, making it suitable for beginners yet valuable for experienced users seeking to deepen their knowledge. You''ll learn how to set up a WordPress site, customize it with themes, and extend its functionality with plugins. The course emphasizes hands-on learning, ensuring that you gain practical experience in creating and managing a WordPress site effectively.</p> <p>As the course progresses, you''ll delve into advanced features of WordPress, including SEO optimization, security enhancements, and e-commerce integration. Our expert instructors will guide you through the process of creating an engaging and professional-looking website or blog, focusing on best practices for design, user experience, and content management. By the end of the course, you''ll have the skills and confidence to build and maintain a WordPress website that meets your personal or business needs, with the ability to optimize it for high performance and search engine visibility. Whether you aim to manage your own content, build websites for clients, or enhance your digital marketing toolkit, this course is your gateway to becoming proficient in WordPress CMS in just three days.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1198 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1618 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Unlock the untapped potential of LinkedIn for your business with our specialized course in Social Media Marketing with LinkedIn. This course covers essential tactics from creating compelling posts and leveraging LinkedIn Analytics to B2B lead generation and building a strong professional network. You''ll engage in hands-on exercises and study real-world examples, ensuring that you can implement what you''ve learned immediately.</p> <p>By the end of this course, you''ll have an in-depth understanding of how to utilize LinkedIn as a powerful marketing tool for both individual and business objectives. You''ll be equipped to optimize your LinkedIn profile, create and curate content that resonates with your target audience, and understand how to leverage LinkedIn Ads for maximum ROI. Whether you''re a business owner or a marketing professional, this course will arm you with the skills to make the most out of LinkedIn.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1256 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1073 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The Effective Negotiation Training course is meticulously designed to shed light on the often underappreciated art of negotiation. We dive deep into the psychological aspects, exploring why individuals often avoid negotiations, and highlight pivotal moments when negotiation becomes essential. Comprehensive modules will guide participants from the intricacies of planning their negotiation stance to the strategies behind formulating a persuasive opening offer.</p> <p>Building on this foundation, the course unfolds a range of negotiation tactics, offering learners insights into effective trading and the nuanced art of closing a deal. We emphasize discerning the right time to walk away, ensuring participants can make well-informed decisions that align with their best interests. Embark on a transformative journey and empower yourself with game-changing negotiation skills at Tertiary Courses.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1261 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1410 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>User experience (UX) and User Interface (UI) design is the process designers use to build interfaces on devices that provide meaningful and relevant experiences to users. This involves the design of the entire process of acquiring and integrating the product, including aspects of branding, design, usability and function. However, as the experience of technology is becoming increasingly complex, organisations are beginning to recognise the need to hire UX or UI designers to design user experience for their brands and products.</p> <p>UXPin is a product design platform used by the best designers on the planet. Let your team easily design, collaborate, and present from low-fidelity wireframes to fully-interactive prototypes</p> <p>This one day course will teach you how to use UXPin to design a prototpye and wireframe.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1268 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1294 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>This comprehensive course is designed for networking professionals aiming to master the CCNP Enterprise: Implementing Cisco Enterprise Advanced Routing and Services (350-401 ENCOR) Exam. Dive deep into advanced routing protocols, services, and solutions that are critical in enterprise networks. Our curriculum is tailored to cover all aspects of the 350-401 ENCOR exam, ensuring a thorough understanding of network design, implementation, and troubleshooting.</p> <p>Participants will engage in hands-on labs and real-world scenarios, enhancing their practical skills in implementing core enterprise network technologies. The course highlights include detailed study of Layer 2 and Layer 3 technologies, VPN services, infrastructure security and services, and automation and programmability. Upon completion, you''ll not only be prepared for the CCNP Enterprise exam but also equipped with the knowledge to implement and manage advanced Cisco networking solutions effectively.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1287 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1573 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Embark on a transformative journey with our 5 Days Excel Specialization course, meticulously designed for individuals aiming to elevate their data management and analysis skills. This intensive course offers a comprehensive curriculum, covering advanced Excel functionalities vital for today''s fast-paced business environment. Participants will gain proficiency in complex data analysis, visualization techniques, and automation processes, enabling them to manipulate large datasets efficiently and effectively.</p> <p>Dive deep into the realms of Excel with a focus on practical, real-world applications. Learn to leverage pivot tables for insightful data summaries, utilize advanced functions for intricate data manipulation, and explore macro programming for task automation. Our expert instructors, equipped with industry-relevant knowledge, guide you through interactive sessions and hands-on projects. This course is a stepping stone for professionals aspiring to become adept at using Excel as a powerful tool for decision-making and productivity enhancement. Join us and transform your data skills in just five days.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1288 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1294 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Powershell for Beginners offers a structured approach to understanding and harnessing the capabilities of Powershell. Participants will become proficient in fundamental Powershell commands, grasp the nuances of its syntax, and gain hands-on experience in scripting for powerful automation tasks.</p> <p>This immersive program ensures a seamless transition for newcomers to become adept at Powershell. By equipping learners with essential skills, they''ll be positioned to tackle complex scripting challenges, enhancing their efficiency in IT tasks and system administration.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1291 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 743 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p><span>Delve deep into the functionalities of Microsoft OneDrive, a pivotal component of Microsoft 365''s teamwork solutions. This comprehensive training provides insights into effectively managing and configuring OneDrive for both personal and business applications, ensuring smooth storage, syncing, and sharing of vital files. Coupled with the interconnected capabilities of Microsoft Teams, a leading global communication platform, this course ensures participants are equipped to maximize the efficiency of their teamwork efforts. Harness the power of cloud storage and streamline collaboration with our expert-led Microsoft OneDrive Training.</span></p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1294 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 822 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p><span>Unlock the power of Excel in the domain of trading and investment with this comprehensive training. Delve into foundational and advanced strategies including the Moving Average Crossover, Volume Weight Average Pricing (VWAP), and the Relative Strength Indicator (RSI). Complement these with a deep understanding of key metrics like Expected Return, Beta, and Volatility, setting the stage for informed and data-driven financial decisions. <br /><br />Furthermore, this course illuminates the intricacies of the Capital Asset Pricing Model, a cornerstone in modern financial theory. Whether you''re a budding trader or an investment professional, the integration of Excel with these critical strategies ensures a robust approach to the financial markets, optimizing your potential for success.</span></p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1298 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 969 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p><span>Immerse yourself in the versatile world of Microsoft Excel, starting with an exploration of its user-friendly interface. Grasp the nuances of managing worksheets, rows, columns, and data for efficient data processing. As you delve deeper, you''ll get acquainted with the power of formulas, IF functions for data analysis, and Lookup &amp; Reference functions to extract crucial data swiftly. <br><br>The training also empowers participants with hands-on experience in harnessing the potential of aggregate functions such as COUNTIF, AVERAGEIF, and SUMIF. Additionally, charting is made simple with a step-by-step guide to creating various chart types, including specialized ones like Treemap, Sunburst, and Histogram. Learn to format and adapt these charts to present data effectively with our expert-led Basic Excel Training.</span></p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1304 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1325 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Immerse yourself in the transformative world of Building Information Modeling (BIM) with our specialized Revit training. This course encapsulates the essence of BIM, emphasizing its role in revolutionizing architectural, engineering, and construction projects. As the construction industry gravitates towards data-rich designs, mastering BIM with Revit becomes an indispensable skill, enabling professionals to streamline their workflow, optimize collaboration, and deliver robust models.</p> <p>The course meticulously covers the foundational aspects of BIM, enlightening participants about its definition and significance in contemporary design practices. Dive deep into BIM modeling best practices, understand the intricacies of choosing the right tools for respective categories, and get acquainted with naming and code conventions. Moreover, the program underscores the importance of defining the level of development, ensuring a cohesive and refined modeling experience. By the end of this training, attendees will be well-equipped to harness the full potential of BIM using Revit, setting new standards in their respective domains.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1306 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1796 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The DP-602T00 Implement a Data Warehouse with Microsoft Fabric course provides a comprehensive understanding of end-to-end data analytics and management. Learn the fundamentals of Microsoft Fabric data warehouses, data loading strategies, SQL querying techniques, and data security implementations. Through hands-on exercises, explore how to transform, prepare, and analyze data for business insights while securing your data with advanced access controls such as row-level and column-level security.</p> <p>This course covers essential topics including monitoring warehouse performance, optimizing query execution, and ensuring data governance. You will gain expertise in data transformation using T-SQL, Dataflow Gen2, and data pipelines. By the end of the course, you will be equipped with the skills to implement, manage, and secure data warehouses in Microsoft Fabric, making you a valuable asset in data engineering and analytics teams.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1312 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1112 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p><span style="color: #ff0000;">This course is not yet approved for WSQ funding</span></p> <p>Embark on a comprehensive journey through the WSQ Fundamentals of the Personal Data Protection Act (PDPA) course. This course meticulously covers the latest updates from the Personal Data Protection Act 2020. Delve into practical applications of PDPA, understand how to adeptly manage data breaches in your organization, and learn the pivotal role of a Data Protection Officer. The course provides extensive training and communication strategies to ensure staff compliance with the PDPA.</p> <p>Demonstrating a proficient use of PDPA assessment tools is a cornerstone of this course, equipping organizations with the necessary knowledge and skills to maintain a robust data protection framework. Whether providing training for Data Protection Officers or enhancing the overall data protection culture within your organization, this course is a valuable asset for ensuring compliance and managing the complex landscape of personal data protection.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1313 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1203 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p><strong>Google Analytics 4 (GA 4) </strong> is the first major revision in years to the de facto standard in Google Analytics. It provides the means to track, analyse, and report on the visitors to your site and app—who they are and what they do. This course will teach the basics of Google Analysis 4 .</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1318 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 847 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>This AWS Certified Machine Learning Engineer Associate Exam Prep course equips you with the skills and knowledge required to excel in machine learning using AWS cloud services. You''ll learn key concepts such as data engineering, exploratory data analysis, model training and deployment, and performance optimization on AWS. The course covers AWS tools like SageMaker, Lambda, and other critical AI and ML services to prepare you thoroughly for the certification exam.</p> <p>Participants will gain hands-on experience with real-world projects that simulate practical applications of machine learning on AWS. This course is ideal for IT professionals, data scientists, and developers seeking to enhance their machine learning capabilities and advance their careers in AI and cloud computing.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1330 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1329 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>This AWS Certified Data Engineer Associate Exam Prep course is designed to provide in-depth knowledge and hands-on experience in managing data solutions on the AWS platform. The course covers critical concepts such as data storage, data processing, and data visualization using AWS services like Redshift, S3, Kinesis, and more. Participants will learn to design and implement data solutions that optimize performance, scalability, and cost-efficiency.</p> <p>Throughout the course, you will engage with real-world scenarios and practical exercises that will prepare you for the AWS Certified Data Engineer Associate exam. Gain the skills needed to deploy and maintain AWS data infrastructure, perform data migrations, and build data pipelines. This course is ideal for IT professionals, data analysts, and developers looking to advance their careers in cloud data engineering.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1331 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1047 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Unlock the full potential of cloud-based accounting with our QuickBooks Online Plus Training at Tertiary Courses. Designed for both beginners and seasoned accountants, this course takes you through the intricate features of the renowned software. Learn the nuances of setting up accounts, managing customers and vendors, and delve deep into products, services, and billable expenses. Whether it''s time tracking, handling refunds, or automating transactions, this training ensures you''re adept in every facet of QuickBooks Online.</p> <p>Efficiently manage your financial tasks, from paying bills, creating invoices to setting up online banking accounts, and generating insightful reports. With expert guidance on sales tax and the automation of recurring transactions, you''ll be well-equipped to streamline your financial processes, saving both time and effort. Immerse in this transformative training, ensuring that your financial management, whether for personal or business purposes, reaches new heights of precision and efficiency.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 134 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1555 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Embark on a transformative journey into the realm of accounting, meticulously crafted for Non-Finance Managers. This course demystifies the core concepts of accounting, from understanding the intricacies of balance sheets and income statements to accurately determining product costs. With our expert guidance, you''ll grasp the nuances of performing break-even analyses and gain a deeper understanding of average and marginal tax rates.</p> <p>Further, the curriculum sheds light on the vast spectrum of tax deductions and credits, empowering participants with the knowledge to make informed decisions. Whether you''re looking to enhance your managerial capabilities or simply wish to gain a solid foundation in accounting, this course promises a comprehensive learning experience. Join us and elevate your professional competencies in the world of finance.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 135 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1383 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Our Full C# Programming Training is designed to provide you with a comprehensive understanding of C# programming, equipping you with the skills and knowledge necessary to become a proficient software developer. Through hands-on experience and guidance from expert instructors, you will learn the fundamental concepts and techniques of C# programming, empowering you to create robust and efficient software applications.</p> <p>With our Full C# Programming Training, you will gain the confidence and expertise needed to tackle complex programming challenges and develop innovative solutions. Whether you are a beginner looking to start your journey in software development or an experienced developer seeking to enhance your skills, our training course will help you achieve your goals and unlock your full potential as a C# programmer. Don''t miss this opportunity to elevate your coding skills and advance your career in the exciting field of software development.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1354 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1540 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Discover the core concepts of Microsoft Power Platform with our comprehensive PL-900 Exam Prep Guide. Whether you''re just starting or looking to deepen your understanding, our course covers the vital topics ensuring you grasp the intricacies and are well-prepared for the PL-900 certification.</p> <p>Our training, designed by industry professionals, emphasizes the foundational elements of Power Platform. Dive into modules covering data analysis, app creation, and automation while gaining practical insights to tackle the PL-900 exam effectively. With a focus on real-world applications, learners will emerge both test-ready and equipped for the challenges of the professional environment.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1358 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2391 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>In a business landscape increasingly focused on sustainability and corporate responsibility, mastering the ISO 14001:2015 Environment Management System stands as a significant asset. Our comprehensive course equips you with the necessary skills to implement, manage, and improve an environmental management system in line with the globally recognized ISO 14001:2015 standard. Whether you are an environment manager seeking to enhance your expertise or a business aiming to amplify its sustainability initiatives, this course is your pathway to achieving excellence in environmental stewardship.</p> <p>Immerse yourself in a learning experience that is not only rich in content but also grounded in practical applications that mirror real-world scenarios. This course is meticulously designed to foster a deep understanding of the environmental impacts of business operations, enabling you to formulate strategies that align with global sustainability standards. As a participant, you will be equipped to drive forward environmental policies and practices that not only comply with legal requirements but also promote corporate responsibility and community goodwill. Elevate your career and contribute to a greener future with a profound understanding of the ISO 14001:2015 Environment Management System.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1367 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1899 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Put an AI coworker on your team in this hands-on Claude Cowork Masterclass. Claude Cowork is Anthropic&rsquo;s agentic AI workspace that works directly with your files and folders &mdash; organising documents, drafting reports, building spreadsheets and presentations, and completing multi-step tasks from a single plain-English brief, with no coding required. In this masterclass, you will set up Cowork, connect it to your working folders, and learn to delegate real work to Claude while you stay in control of quality and accuracy.</p> <p>Through practical projects, participants will use Cowork to organise messy folders, produce documents and management reports, process and analyse data, and run research and summarisation tasks end to end. You will learn to brief Claude effectively, run and review multi-step tasks, connect additional tools and integrations, and apply approvals, guardrails and secure practices when working with business data. By the end of the masterclass, you will be able to make Claude Cowork your everyday AI coworker and hand off hours of routine work every week.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1382 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1489 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Elevate your professional journey with Tertiary Courses'' PL-500 Microsoft Power Automate RPA Developer Associate Exam Prep. Specifically tailored for the forward-thinking developers, this course unveils the intricacies of the Microsoft Power Platform, enabling you to spot opportunities, create robust connections, and conduct meticulous feasibility scans.</p> <p>Venture deeper into the world of Power Apps and master the art of integrating data and functions across varied programs with top-tier API-level integration. Harness the power of real-time testing in Power Automate, ensuring flawless interoperability between diverse applications. And when challenges arise? You''ll be armed with proven techniques to tackle technical glitches and adeptly modify Power Platform middleware. Rise as a sought-after Power Automate RPA Developer with our unparalleled training experience.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1384 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2656 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Embark on a journey to master the world of Microsoft 365 core services with our MS-600 Building Applications and Solutions with Microsoft 365 Core Services course. This comprehensive training is meticulously designed to provide you with the essential knowledge and skills needed to excel in the MS-600 certification exam, setting you apart in the competitive field of Microsoft 365 development. Our expert instructors will guide you through the intricacies of building applications and solutions with Microsoft 365 core services, ensuring that you are well-prepared to tackle the exam with confidence.</p> <p>Our course is structured to offer you a hands-on learning experience, allowing you to apply the concepts learned in real-world scenarios. You will gain a deep understanding of Microsoft 365 core services, including SharePoint, OneDrive, Teams, and more, and how to leverage them to create efficient and scalable applications and solutions. By the end of the course, you will be fully equipped to take on the MS-600 certification exam and take your Microsoft 365 development career to new heights. Enroll now and unlock the power of Microsoft 365 core services.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1388 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2443 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The DP-300 Azure Database Administrator Associate course is meticulously designed to elevate your skills and understanding of Azure SQL Database and SQL Server in Azure virtual machines. This course will guide you through the intricacies of designing Azure SQL Database for cloud-native applications, exploring Azure SQL Database Managed Instance, and understanding Microsoft Intelligent Data Platform roles.</p> <p>With a comprehensive curriculum that covers both theoretical and practical aspects of Azure database administration, you will gain the knowledge and confidence needed to excel in your career. Our expert instructors, coupled with hands-on exercises and real-world examples, will ensure that you leave with a strong grasp of the course material and the ability to apply it in practical situations.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1389 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2544 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Embark on a journey to success with our AWS Certified DevOps Engineer Exam Prep course. This meticulously designed course provides you with the essential knowledge and skills needed to excel in the AWS Certified DevOps Engineer exam. Our expert instructors will guide you through the complexities of AWS DevOps, ensuring you are well-prepared and confident to tackle the exam.</p> <p>Our course is structured to maximize your learning experience, covering all the necessary topics and providing practical tips to enhance your performance. With our comprehensive study materials and expert guidance, you will be equipped with the tools needed to succeed and advance your career. Enroll now and take the first step towards becoming a certified AWS DevOps Engineer.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1391 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1337 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Our AWS Certified SysOps Administrator Exam Prep Course is meticulously designed to provide you with the knowledge, skills, and confidence needed to ace the AWS Certified SysOps Administrator Exam. This comprehensive course covers all the essential topics and best practices to ensure you are fully prepared for the exam. Our expert instructors will guide you through the intricacies of AWS SysOps, providing you with practical insights and tips to maximize your exam performance.</p> <p>In this course, you will gain a deep understanding of the AWS SysOps Administrator domain, including key concepts, methodologies, and tools. We will walk you through real-world scenarios and case studies to help you apply your knowledge in practical situations. Our course is structured to provide a balanced mix of theory and hands-on practice, ensuring you are well-equipped to tackle the challenges of the AWS Certified SysOps Administrator Exam. Enroll now and take the first step towards becoming a certified AWS SysOps Administrator!</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1392 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1444 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Our AWS Developer Associate (DVA-C01) Exam Prep Course is meticulously designed to provide you with the knowledge, skills, and confidence needed to ace the AWS Developer Associate Exam. This comprehensive course covers all the essential topics and best practices to ensure you are fully prepared for the exam. Our expert instructors will guide you through the intricacies of AWS Developer, providing you with practical insights and tips to maximize your exam performance.</p> <p>In this course, you will gain a deep understanding of the AWS Developer domain, including key concepts, methodologies, and tools. We will walk you through real-world scenarios and case studies to help you apply your knowledge in practical situations. Our course is structured to provide a balanced mix of theory and hands-on practice, ensuring you are well-equipped to tackle the challenges of the AWS Developer Associate Exam. Enroll now and take the first step towards becoming a certified AWS Developer Associate!</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1393 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1165 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Embark on a transformative journey of technical prowess with our Certified Kubernetes Administrator (CKA) Exam Prep course. This meticulously designed course aims at equipping learners with the requisite knowledge and practical skills essential for mastering Kubernetes orchestration. Delving into the core functionalities and advanced features of Kubernetes, this course lays a solid foundation for managing and scaling containerized applications with ease and precision. The comprehensive curriculum encapsulates the essential Kubernetes concepts, security best practices, networking policies, and various other pivotal aspects, aligning with the course highlights to provide a well-rounded learning experience.</p> <p>Transitioning to the realms of professional expertise, this course facilitates a thorough understanding of Kubernetes orchestration, empowering learners to manage complex Kubernetes clusters proficiently. Through a blend of theoretical insights and hands-on exercises, learners will gain a profound understanding of deploying, managing, and scaling applications in a Kubernetes environment. Additionally, the course prepares learners for the Certified Kubernetes Administrator exam, providing them with the confidence and knowledge required to excel. The rigorous training and practical exposure provided through this course are instrumental in not only preparing learners for the CKA exam but also in fostering a robust understanding of Kubernetes orchestration, thus paving the way for a successful and fulfilling career in the burgeoning field of container orchestration and Kubernetes administration.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1394 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 3178 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The AWS Certified Solutions Architect Professional Training is designed for experienced cloud professionals aiming to enhance their expertise in AWS architecture. Through this course, participants will learn to architect complex cloud solutions, design multi-account AWS environments, and implement cost-optimization strategies. You''ll explore network connectivity strategies, security controls, and reliable, resilient architectures crucial for large-scale enterprises. The course also covers critical skills for accelerating workload migrations, modernizing systems, and ensuring business continuity.</p> <p>Whether you''re looking to refine your current cloud solutions or design new ones that meet specific business goals, this training will equip you with the knowledge to optimize AWS infrastructure for reliability, performance, and security. You will gain in-depth experience in improving operational excellence, addressing performance issues, and implementing cost-saving strategies. Perfect for seasoned cloud architects, this course will elevate your expertise in delivering cutting-edge cloud architectures on AWS.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 14 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1740 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<div> <p>Embark on a journey to success with our AZ-400 Designing and Implementing Microsoft DevOps Solutions Exam Prep course. This meticulously crafted course is tailored to provide you with an in-depth understanding of the Microsoft DevOps Solutions, equipping you with the knowledge and skills required to excel in the AZ-400 exam. Our expert instructors will guide you through the intricacies of designing and implementing DevOps practices using Microsoft technologies, ensuring you are well-prepared to tackle the challenges of the exam and emerge victorious.</p> <p>Our course is not just about passing the exam; it''s about empowering you with the tools and confidence needed to thrive in the world of Microsoft DevOps Solutions. You will gain practical insights and learn from real-world scenarios, ensuring you are ready to apply your knowledge in practical situations. By the end of the course, you will have a comprehensive understanding of Microsoft DevOps Solutions, and be fully prepared to take on the AZ-400 exam with confidence. Enroll now and take the first step towards achieving your Microsoft DevOps Solutions certification and advancing your career.</p> </div>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1402 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2874 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Embark on a journey to master the world of Microsoft 365 with our MS-900 Microsoft 365 Fundamentals Exam Prep course. This comprehensive training is meticulously designed to provide you with the essential knowledge and skills needed to excel in the MS-900 certification exam, setting you apart in the competitive field of cloud services and office solutions. Our expert instructors will guide you through the intricacies of Microsoft 365, ensuring that you are well-prepared to tackle the exam with confidence.</p> <p>Our course is structured to offer you a hands-on learning experience, allowing you to apply the concepts learned in real-world scenarios. You will gain a deep understanding of Microsoft 365 services, including Office 365, Windows 10, and Enterprise Mobility + Security, and how to leverage them to create efficient and scalable solutions for businesses and organizations. By the end of the course, you will be fully equipped to take on the MS-900 certification exam and take your career to new heights. Enroll now and unlock the power of Microsoft 365.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1403 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2334 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<div> <div>The Microsoft Azure Administrator exam focuses on common tasks and concepts that an administrator needs to understand to deploy and manage infrastructure in Microsoft Azure. This course focuses on skills and knowledge needed to manage Azure subscriptions; analyze resource utilization and consumption; manage resource groups; establish storage accounts; import/export data; configure Azure files; implement backup; create, configure, and automate VM deployment; manage VMs and VM backups; implement, manage, and connect virtual networks; create and configure Network Security Groups; manage Azure AD and its objects; and implement and manage hybrid identities. Passing the Microsoft Azure Administrator exam earns your Microsoft Certified: Azure Administrator Associate certification, demonstrating your skills in implementing, monitoring, and maintaining Microsoft Azure solutions, including major services related to compute, storage, network, and security.<br /><br />The goal of this course is to provide you with all the tools you need to prepare for the AZ-104: Microsoft Azure Administrator exam &mdash; including text explanations, video demos, lab activities, self-assessment questions, and a practice exam&mdash;to increase your chances of passing the exam on your first try.<br /><br /><strong>Course contains:</strong> <ul> <li>CertPREP lessons</li> <li>Practice test with Practice and Certification modes</li> <li>Lab suit</li> </ul> </div> </div>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1404 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2786 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Our AZ-305 Azure Solutions Architect Expert Exam Prep course is meticulously crafted to guide you through the complexities of the exam, providing you with the tools and knowledge necessary to excel. With comprehensive coverage of the exam''s core concepts, this course ensures a deep understanding of the essential components required for success as an Azure Solutions Architect.</p> <p>Dive deep into the intricacies of Microsoft Azure, as we explore its architectural components, various cloud services, and how to leverage these to design solutions that meet customer needs. Our expert instructors, backed by practical examples and real-world scenarios, will empower you to confidently tackle the exam and emerge as a certified Azure Solutions Architect Expert. With our course, you''re not just prepared for the exam; you''re equipped to thrive in the fast-paced world of cloud architecture.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1406 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2156 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Embark on a transformative journey with our AWS Certified Solutions Architect (SAA-C03) Exam Prep Course. This meticulously crafted course is your gateway to mastering the intricacies of AWS and excelling in the AWS Certified Solutions Architect exam. Our expert instructors will guide you through the essential concepts and best practices of AWS, ensuring you are thoroughly prepared to tackle the exam with utmost confidence.</p> <p>Dive deep into the world of cloud architecture as we cover a comprehensive range of topics, from designing resilient architectures to mastering the deployment of scalable and reliable applications on the AWS platform. Our hands-on approach and practical insights will empower you to develop the skills necessary to become a proficient AWS Solutions Architect. With our support, you will be well on your way to earning your AWS Certified Solutions Architect certification, unlocking new opportunities and propelling your career to new heights in the rapidly evolving field of cloud computing.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1407 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1592 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Master the essentials of Azure data services with our DP-900 Azure Data Fundamentals Exam Prep Course. This course equips learners with the fundamental knowledge required to identify and describe core data concepts and how they are implemented using Microsoft Azure data services.</p> <p>Our course provides comprehensive insights into the database concepts and the tools available on Azure. Whether you''re a beginner or looking to boost your Azure skills, this course offers a step-by-step guide to understanding and utilizing Azure''s data solutions. Leverage this knowledge to ace the DP-900 exam and expand your career prospects in the data domain.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1415 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2352 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>This course provides a deep dive into the transformative world of video production using Artificial Intelligence (AI) and Generative AI (GAI). It''s designed for individuals looking to leverage the latest AI technologies to create impactful and compelling video content. Throughout the course, attendees will explore how AI and GAI can streamline video production processes, enhance creativity, and deliver high-quality content.</p> <p>We cover various aspects of AI-powered video creation, including scriptwriting with AI tools, enhancing visual effects with GAI, and automating the editing process for efficiency. Participants will get hands-on experience with cutting-edge AI video tools, learning to blend technical skills with artistic vision. The course also touches on ethical considerations in AI media production, ensuring responsible and innovative content creation. By the end of this course, attendees will be proficient in harnessing the power of AI and GAI to transform their video production and storytelling</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1416 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1525 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The Certified Lean Six Sigma White Belt course is the perfect starting point for individuals eager to understand the principles of Lean and Six Sigma methodologies. Participants will explore the basics of quality management, process improvement, and operational efficiency, equipping them with tools to identify and eliminate inefficiencies in business processes. This foundational certification is ideal for professionals aiming to boost organizational performance and drive continuous improvement initiatives.</p> <p>This course combines theoretical insights with practical applications, ensuring attendees can immediately contribute to process optimization projects. With a focus on key Lean tools, Six Sigma concepts, and teamwork, participants gain a robust understanding of how to foster a culture of excellence within their organizations. Elevate your career with this globally recognized credential and unlock new opportunities in quality and operational management.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 142 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1542 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p><span>Microsoft Azure Fundamentals is your springboard into cloud computing. It covers the fundamental concepts of Azure, including service agreements, workloads, security, privacy, pricing, and support, all mapped to Microsoft''s key exam objectives. An Azure Fundamentals certification is proof of your knowledge of cloud services and how those services are provided with Microsoft Azure.</span><br /><br /><span>The goal of this course is to provide you with all the tools you need to prepare for the AZ-900 Microsoft Azure Fundamentals exam &mdash; including text explanations, video demos, lab activities, self-assessment questions, and a practice exam&mdash;to increase your chances of passing the exam on your first try.</span></p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1426 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2368 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>This course is designed to prepare students for the Microsoft Power BI Data Analyst (PL-300) certification exam. The course covers all the topics that are necessary to become a proficient Power BI data analyst, including data modeling, visualization, report creation, and dashboard design.</p> <p>The course begins with an introduction to Power BI and its various components. Students will learn about data sources, data modeling, and creating visuals in Power BI. The course also covers the process of creating reports, including adding visuals and formatting options.</p> <p>In addition to report creation, the course will cover advanced visualization techniques, including drill-throughs, bookmarks, and custom visuals. Students will also learn how to design dashboards and create KPIs using Power BI.</p> <p>Throughout the course, students will have access to hands-on labs and practical exercises to reinforce their learning. The labs will be based on real-world scenarios, allowing students to apply their knowledge to actual data analysis situations.</p> <p>By the end of the course, students will be prepared to take the Microsoft Power BI Data Analyst (PL-300) certification exam. The exam validates the skills needed to design and develop data models, reports, and dashboards in Power BI.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1433 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 3012 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Embark on an exciting journey into the world of cybersecurity with our SC-100 Microsoft Cybersecurity Architect Exam Prep course. This comprehensive course is designed to provide the expertise and knowledge required to excel in the SC-100 Microsoft Cybersecurity Architect exam. You''ll delve into key aspects of cybersecurity, including data security, cloud security, and network security within the Microsoft Azure environment.</p> <p>With this course, acquire hands-on experience in architecting advanced security solutions, preparing you to tackle real-world cybersecurity challenges. Our curriculum offers a complete understanding of the design, implementation, and management of advanced security protocols and systems within the Microsoft Azure ecosystem. Don''t miss this chance to elevate your cybersecurity career with a globally recognized certification.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1436 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2530 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Unlock the full potential of cloud database technology with our comprehensive Google Professional Cloud Database Engineer course. This program offers an in-depth journey through the intricacies of designing, building, and maintaining databases on the Google Cloud Platform (GCP). Aimed at database professionals looking to leverage Google Cloud&rsquo;s powerful database services, this course will prepare you for the official Google certification with a strong emphasis on practical skills for real-world applications. Participants will delve into key topics such as cloud database architectures, storage options, and the dynamics of managing scalable and reliable data solutions that support enterprise operations.</p> <p>Our expert-led training is focused not only on passing the exam but also on ensuring that you can apply your knowledge immediately, with insights on integrating GCP databases within the Shopee ecosystem. By the end of this course, you will be adept at implementing, configuring, and troubleshooting GCP&rsquo;s database services, and you&rsquo;ll be ready to step into a role that requires advanced knowledge of cloud-based database solutions. Whether you are a seasoned IT professional or an aspiring cloud specialist, this course is your stepping stone to becoming a sought-after Google Professional Cloud Database Engineer, capable of transforming business data strategies into scalable successes.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 150 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2079 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Embark on a path to becoming a Google Professional Cloud Network Engineer with our dedicated certification prep course. This training is strategically designed for network professionals aiming to deepen their understanding of cloud-based networking on Google Cloud Platform (GCP). You''ll explore the intricacies of designing, planning, and implementing secure and scalable network architectures using GCP services. Our curriculum delves into critical aspects like network security, hybrid cloud configurations, and optimizing network performance, equipping you with the skills required to effectively manage and troubleshoot GCP networks.</p> <p>As part of this course, you will engage in practical, hands-on learning experiences that bring theoretical concepts to life. Guided by seasoned instructors, you will navigate through the complexities of GCP''s networking features, from virtual private clouds (VPCs) to load balancing and network connectivity options. The course is not just focused on helping you pass the certification exam but also aims to enhance your practical networking skills that can be directly applied in your current or future roles. Whether you''re looking to validate your expertise with a Google Cloud certification or aspiring to take on more advanced network engineering responsibilities, this course offers the comprehensive training and resources you need to succeed. Enroll now and take a significant step forward in your cloud networking career.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 151 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2131 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>This Cisco Certified Network Professional (CCNP) for ENARSI Exam Preparation course is meticulously designed to empower participants with profound knowledge and practical skills in Cisco''s Layer 3 technologies and VPN configurations. Participants will dive deep into troubleshooting Layer 3 technologies, learning to manage administrative distances, routing protocols, and loop prevention mechanisms. The course also covers policy-based routing, VRF-Lite, and the intricacies of EIGRP, OSPF, and BGP.</p> <p>The second part of the course focuses on VPN Technologies and Infrastructure Security, offering insights into MPLS operations and Layer 3 VPNs, along with configuring and verifying DMVPN. Participants will gain competence in enhancing network security through IOS AAA, router security features, and IPv6 First Hop security. Furthermore, the course delves into Infrastructure Services, ensuring participants are adept in troubleshooting device management, SNMP, and network problems using various tools including Cisco DNA Center, emphasizing practical skills to optimize network performance and security.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1543 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1742 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Unleash your creative potential with our comprehensive Maya Essential Training course. This meticulously crafted program initiates you into the world of Maya, offering an extensive overview of the Maya interface. You will be systematically guided through the diverse realms of organizing Maya scenes, creating polygonal models, and editing meshes to carve out precise designs. As you progress, the course unfolds the myriad possibilities of applying textures and rendering in Maya to infuse realism into your models. Practical sessions on creating and applying texture maps further refine your skills, preparing you for complex projects.</p> <p>The latter part of the course illuminates the nuances of Mental Ray Rendering, a pivotal aspect of 3D design and rendering. With a balanced blend of theoretical insights and hands-on exercises, this Maya Essential Training equips you with the requisite knowledge and expertise to navigate through the Maya software effortlessly. Whether you are a beginner aiming to get a solid footing or a seasoned designer keen on updating your skillset, this course serves as a stepping stone to mastering the art of 3D design and rendering with Maya.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 161 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1606 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>This course provides an in-depth understanding of how to implement information protection and data loss prevention (DLP) using Microsoft Purview. Learn how to classify, secure, and govern data with sensitivity labels, encryption, and custom data protection policies. Explore Microsoft Purview&rsquo;s compliance solutions, including built-in and custom sensitive information types, document fingerprinting, and named entity recognition. Gain hands-on experience in configuring DLP policies, managing alerts, and utilizing analytics to identify data security risks.</p> <p>Through practical exercises, you will create and configure sensitivity labels, enforce DLP policies, and implement adaptive protection to prevent data breaches. This course is ideal for IT security professionals, compliance officers, and data governance specialists who want to strengthen enterprise data security. By the end of this training, you will be equipped to safeguard sensitive information, ensure regulatory compliance, and mitigate data loss risks with Microsoft Purview.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 164 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1225 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Dive into the realm of 3D design with our foundational Fusion 360 training. This course is tailor-made for those eager to explore the multifaceted dimensions of Fusion 360, offering a blend of insightful tutorials and hands-on experience. With the rapidly evolving design landscape, mastering tools like Fusion 360 is no longer a luxury but a necessity for those keen to stand out in the competitive world of design and modeling.</p> <p>From understanding the nuances of the Fusion 360 interface to sketching intricate designs, the course covers it all. Engage in real-time exercises on sketching triangles, struts, and delve deep into the art of geometric modeling. Explore the dynamic world of extruding, and unleash your creativity with organic sculpting techniques. Moreover, the program covers the strategies for effectively combining geometry, ensuring participants have a holistic understanding of the Fusion 360 platform. By the conclusion of this course, participants will possess a robust foundation in Fusion 360, ready to embark on more advanced design endeavors.</p> <p><span style="color: #ff0000; font-size: large;"><img alt="AutoDesk Authorised Training Center (ATC) in Singapore" src="https://www.tertiarycourses.com.sg/media/wysiwyg/autodesk-atc-singapore.jpg" style="vertical-align: middle;" title="AutoDesk Authorised Training Center (ATC) in Singapore" /></span></p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 167 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1879 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Step into the world of 3D design with Autodesk Inventor Essential Training, tailored to empower participants with comprehensive skills in digital modeling and design. From understanding the Inventor workflow and file types to mastering the intricacies of sketching, geometry manipulation, and assembly creation, this course ensures that attendees are thoroughly equipped to navigate the Autodesk Inventor platform with confidence and proficiency.</p> <p>Participants will embark on a journey that commences with the fundamentals, such as setting up projects and sketching. They''ll then delve deeper into advanced features, including creating feature patterns, sculpted objects, and more. By integrating parts into an assembly and positioning them using constraints, learners will understand the holistic approach to design. Additionally, the training underscores the importance of creating detailed drawing views and adding precise annotations, ensuring that the design process is both comprehensive and detail-oriented. By the end of this program, participants will have a solid grasp on Autodesk Inventor, positioning them at the forefront of 3D design expertise.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 168 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1987 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>In the ever-evolving field of industrial operations, ensuring safety in process plants is not just a regulatory requirement, but a vital skill. This course offers a comprehensive exploration of Workplace Safety and Health (WSH) practices tailored specifically for process plant environments. Participants will gain in-depth knowledge of safety protocols, risk management, and compliance standards, essential for maintaining a safe and efficient workplace.</p> <p>Delivered by industry experts, our course combines theoretical insights with practical applications, ensuring that you''re equipped with the skills needed to apply WSH principles effectively in real-world scenarios. Whether you''re a safety officer, plant operator, or a professional aiming to enhance your industry credentials, this course will empower you with the knowledge and skills to uphold and improve safety standards in any process plant setting.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 172 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1087 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Enter the dynamic realm of iOS app development through our foundational Swift programming course tailored for beginners. Understand the core concepts, starting from data and collection types, diving deep into the intricacies of functions and closures, and mastering the application of conditionals and loops, rounded off with a thorough understanding of enumerations.</p> <p>Swift is the modern language of choice for iOS and macOS app development, and getting the basics right is the key to building a strong foundation. Our course ensures a clear and structured introduction, equipping you with the knowledge and tools to embark on your app creation journey. Master the essentials of Swift and transform your ideas into innovative applications with Tertiary Courses today.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 173 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 945 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>This AZ-120 Microsoft Certified Azure for SAP Workloads Specialty course equips IT professionals with the skills to design, implement, and manage SAP solutions on Microsoft Azure. Participants will explore certified SAP configurations, integrate NetWeaver and S/4HANA with Azure infrastructure, and understand compute, storage, networking, and database requirements for robust SAP deployments. The course also provides a deep dive into Azure identity services, remote management, and governance tailored to SAP environments.</p> <p>In addition, learners will gain practical knowledge on deploying 2-tier and 3-tier SAP implementations, ensuring business continuity through high availability and disaster recovery strategies, and performing end-to-end migrations of SAP workloads including very large databases. The course also covers advanced monitoring, licensing considerations, and support options to maintain a healthy Azure SAP environment. Ideal for professionals preparing for the AZ-120 certification, this course delivers in-demand expertise critical for enterprise cloud transitions.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1745 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1944 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The AZ-140 Microsoft Certified Azure Virtual Desktop Specialty course provides IT professionals with the expertise to design, implement, and manage scalable virtual desktop environments on Microsoft Azure. Participants will learn to architect a secure and efficient Azure Virtual Desktop (AVD) infrastructure, covering user identity planning, host pool creation, session host configuration, and storage/network setup.</p> <p>Throughout the course, learners will dive into FSLogix management, access and security configurations, application deployment, and session host optimization to enhance user experiences. The training also equips learners with the skills to monitor performance, apply system updates, and plan for business continuity through backups and disaster recovery strategies. Ideal for professionals pursuing the AZ-140 certification, this course builds practical skills to support hybrid and remote work environments.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1747 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1114 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The AZ-800 Microsoft Certified Windows Server Hybrid Administrator Associate course prepares IT professionals to manage modern hybrid infrastructures that span on-premises and Azure environments. This comprehensive training covers deployment and administration of Active Directory, management of Windows Server workloads using tools like Azure Arc and Automanage, as well as securing hybrid infrastructures with advanced features such as BitLocker, change tracking, and adaptive application control.</p> <p>Participants will also gain in-depth knowledge on managing Hyper-V virtualization, containers, and file services; designing high availability solutions; and implementing disaster recovery using Azure Site Recovery and Backup. Migration strategies, networking configurations, and real-world troubleshooting scenarios are also covered. This course is ideal for system administrators aiming to become certified hybrid experts with the skills to operate in both cloud and on-premises environments.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1749 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1772 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The DP-600 Microsoft Certified Fabric Analytics Engineer Associate course is designed for data professionals seeking to develop deep expertise in end-to-end analytics using Microsoft Fabric. This course equips learners with practical knowledge on lakehouses, Delta Lake tables, dataflows, real-time intelligence, and Apache Spark integration within the Microsoft Fabric ecosystem. Learners will also explore Fabric&rsquo;s data warehouse capabilities including data loading, querying, monitoring, and securing analytics environments.</p> <p>Participants will gain hands-on experience working with scalable semantic models in Power BI, performance optimization, and enterprise-grade data governance using Microsoft Purview. The course also covers essential administration tasks and security best practices, ensuring participants are fully prepared to manage and deliver secure, high-performance analytics solutions. Perfect for those preparing for the DP-600 certification, this course empowers data engineers to lead the future of analytics on Microsoft Fabric.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1751 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1906 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The DP-700 Microsoft Certified Fabric Data Engineer Associate course equips data professionals with the knowledge and practical skills to design and implement scalable data solutions using Microsoft Fabric. Learners will explore data ingestion with Dataflows Gen2, orchestrate processes using Apache Spark, and work with real-time analytics using eventstreams and eventhouses. The course emphasizes lakehouse architecture, medallion design, and Delta Lake tables for building unified and efficient data platforms.</p> <p>Participants will also learn to implement enterprise-grade data warehouses in Microsoft Fabric, monitor and secure analytics environments, and manage real-time dashboards for dynamic reporting. With added focus on CI/CD practices, security, and administration, this course provides a complete foundation for professionals aiming to earn the DP-700 certification and thrive as modern data engineers in hybrid analytics environments.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1752 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2255 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The MB-230: Microsoft Certified Dynamics 365 Customer Service Functional Consultant Associate course equips professionals with the expertise to configure and optimize customer service experiences using Dynamics 365. Learn how to manage cases, queues, service-level agreements, and entitlements while improving productivity through tools like Copilot, the Customer Service Hub, and Omnichannel integrations.</p> <p>Participants will gain hands-on experience in deploying voice, chat, SMS, and social messaging channels to engage customers in real-time. The course also covers the creation and automation of surveys using Dynamics 365 Customer Voice, along with visual insights using Power BI. You''ll also learn to schedule services, analyze performance using Customer Service Insights, and connect IoT devices for proactive support with Connected Customer Service. Ideal for those pursuing MB-230 certification, this course prepares you to lead exceptional customer service transformations using Microsoft Dynamics 365.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1753 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1796 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The MB-240: Microsoft Certified Dynamics 365 Field Service Functional Consultant Associate course equips professionals with the expertise to deliver high-quality onsite services using Microsoft Dynamics 365 Field Service. Learn to manage work orders, configure service-level agreements, define agreements and inspections, and track customer assets across the service lifecycle. This course also covers core functionalities such as incident management and mobile application customization for field technicians.</p> <p>Participants will gain hands-on experience with Universal Resource Scheduling, optimizing resources with Resource Scheduling Optimization, and customizing the schedule board for real-time crew and facility scheduling. The course further explores the integration of Dynamics 365 Remote Assist to resolve issues on-site through live support. Ideal for those pursuing the MB-240 certification, this course prepares consultants to streamline field operations and deliver proactive, customer-focused service experiences through Dynamics 365.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1754 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1832 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The WSQ MB-280 Microsoft Certified Dynamics 365 Customer Experience Analyst Associate course equips learners with essential skills to manage and optimize customer data using Dataverse. Participants will learn to create and manage Dataverse environments, tables, and columns, and connect data within Power Apps canvas apps.</p> <p>Learners will also gain expertise in customizing the Power Apps command bar to enhance user interactions and optimize data visualization using Dataverse views. The course includes using Power Query for data loading, managing data with Microsoft Word and Excel templates, and integrating Azure and external tools for advanced data manipulation. By completing this course, participants will be well-prepared to analyze, manage, and optimize customer experience data effectively within Dynamics 365.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1755 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1604 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The AB-100 Microsoft Certified Agentic AI Business Solutions Architect course equips learners with the knowledge and skills required to design and deliver AI-powered, agentic-first business solutions on the Microsoft platform. Participants will explore planning AI strategies, designing single- and multi-agent solutions with Microsoft 365 Copilot, Copilot Studio and Microsoft Foundry, and grounding agents on trusted business data.</p> <p>Learners will gain expertise in designing agent extensibility with Model Context Protocol and Computer Use, orchestrating AI features across Dynamics 365 and Microsoft Power Platform, and deploying solutions with robust testing, application lifecycle management, monitoring and telemetry. Additionally, the course covers securing and governing agents, mitigating prompt manipulation, and applying responsible AI, data residency and compliance controls. By completing this course, participants will be prepared to architect scalable, secure and measurable agentic AI solutions using Microsoft technologies.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1756 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1388 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The MB-330 Microsoft Certified Dynamics 365 Supply Chain Management Functional Consultant Associate course equips professionals with comprehensive knowledge to design, implement, and optimize supply chain operations using Dynamics 365. Participants will learn how to manage inventory, configure warehouse systems, handle inbound/outbound logistics, and use bill of materials and product masters effectively. The course also dives into engineering change management, discrete manufacturing, capacity planning, and configurable products.</p> <p>Learners will gain hands-on experience in procurement processes, vendor collaboration, landed cost management, sales order processing, intercompany trade, and asset lifecycle management. The course covers everything from preventive maintenance to transportation planning, master planning, and demand-driven MRP. Designed for professionals aiming to become certified functional consultants, this course delivers essential expertise to lead digital transformation in global supply chain operations using Microsoft Dynamics 365.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1757 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1846 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The MB-335 Microsoft Certified Dynamics 365 Supply Chain Management Functional Consultant Expert course provides comprehensive training in configuring and managing supply chain processes in Dynamics 365. Participants will explore inventory and warehouse management, configure inbound and outbound operations, manage bills of materials (BOMs), and set up discrete and process manufacturing. The course also covers configuring lean manufacturing and implementing engineering change management to manage product versions and updates.</p> <p>Learners will gain expertise in asset management, procurement, and vendor collaboration by setting up functional locations, managing work orders, and using preventive and reactive maintenance. Additionally, the course includes mastering order-to-cash processes, intercompany trade, quality control, and master planning in Dynamics 365. By completing this course, participants will be well-prepared to manage, optimize, and enhance supply chain operations across organizations.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1758 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1786 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The AI-200 Microsoft Certified Azure AI Cloud Developer Associate course equips learners with the knowledge and skills required to build, deploy and operate AI cloud solutions on Azure with an emphasis on back-end services and components. Participants will explore developing containerized solutions with Azure Container Registry, Azure Container Apps and Azure Kubernetes Service, and building AI solutions on Azure data management services.</p> <p>Learners will gain hands-on expertise working with vector search across Azure Cosmos DB, Azure Database for PostgreSQL and Azure Managed Redis, implementing retrieval-augmented generation, and connecting event- and message-based services with Azure Service Bus, Event Grid and Functions. Additionally, the course covers securing solutions with Azure Key Vault and App Configuration, and monitoring with OpenTelemetry and KQL. By completing this course, participants will be prepared to develop secure, scalable AI cloud applications on Azure.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1759 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1334 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The AB-620 Microsoft Certified AI Agent Builder Associate course equips developers and advanced builders with the knowledge and skills required to design, build, extend and integrate custom AI agents for enterprise-grade solutions in Microsoft Copilot Studio. Participants will explore planning agent solutions, creating agent flows and topics, and configuring advanced responses with custom prompts, knowledge sources and adaptive cards.</p> <p>Learners will gain hands-on expertise integrating agents with enterprise knowledge sources, Model Context Protocol (MCP) tools, custom connectors and REST APIs, building multi-agent solutions with the Agent2Agent (A2A) protocol and Microsoft Foundry, and connecting to Azure AI Search and Microsoft Fabric. Additionally, the course covers testing and evaluating agents and applying application lifecycle management with Microsoft Power Platform Pipelines. By completing this course, participants will be prepared to build and ship integrated, production-ready AI agents in Copilot Studio.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1760 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1376 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The MB-800 Microsoft Certified Dynamics 365 Business Central Functional Consultant Associate course equips learners with the knowledge and skills required to configure, customize, and manage Dynamics 365 Business Central. Participants will explore the core capabilities of Business Central, including setting up general journal templates, processing journal entries, and working with general ledger allocations. The course also covers building and extending reports using report components, layouts, triggers, and multilingual functionality.</p> <p>Learners will gain hands-on experience developing apps and automation using Power Apps and Power Automate for Dynamics 365 Business Central. The course further covers configuring sales and purchasing processes, setting up cash management, managing charts of accounts, and performing bank reconciliations. By completing this course, participants will be prepared to function as Dynamics 365 Business Central consultants, effectively supporting business processes and optimizing system functionality.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1761 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1824 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The AI-300 Microsoft Certified Machine Learning Operations Engineer Associate course equips learners with the knowledge and skills required to set up and operate machine learning operations (MLOps) and generative AI operations (GenAIOps) on Azure. Participants will explore designing MLOps infrastructure with Azure Machine Learning, managing the model lifecycle, and building GenAIOps infrastructure with Microsoft Foundry, GitHub Actions and infrastructure as code.</p> <p>Learners will gain hands-on expertise training, registering, deploying and monitoring machine learning models, deploying foundation models, and implementing prompt versioning, evaluation, observability and cost optimization for generative AI applications and agents. Additionally, the course covers optimizing retrieval-augmented generation and advanced fine-tuning. By completing this course, participants will be prepared to deliver scalable, automated and well-monitored AI solutions on Azure.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1762 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1313 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The MB-920 Microsoft Dynamics 365 Fundamentals (ERP) course provides a comprehensive introduction to the core capabilities of Dynamics 365 finance and operations applications. Participants will learn about shared features, reporting, and integration capabilities within finance and operations apps. The course also covers the fundamentals of Dynamics 365 Finance, including general ledger functions, accounts payable and receivable, expense management, fixed asset management, and budgeting processes.</p> <p>Additionally, learners will gain insights into Dynamics 365 Supply Chain Management by exploring its core functionalities, including sales and procurement processes, inventory and warehousing management, and manufacturing operations. This course equips participants with a strong foundational knowledge of Microsoft Dynamics 365 ERP, enabling them to understand and support business processes across finance, operations, and supply chain domains effectively.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1764 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1745 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The AB-900 Microsoft 365 Copilot and Agent Administration Fundamentals course equips learners with the foundational knowledge required to administer Microsoft 365 Copilot and agents securely and effectively. Participants will explore the core features and objects of Microsoft 365 services across the admin centers, Zero Trust security principles, Microsoft Entra ID, conditional access and single sign-on.</p> <p>Learners will gain expertise in data protection and governance with Microsoft Purview &mdash; sensitivity labels, data loss prevention, Insider Risk Management and DSPM for AI &mdash; and in how Copilot accesses data and protects against oversharing risks. Additionally, the course covers basic administrative tasks for Copilot and agents, including license assignment, usage monitoring, prompt management, and agent creation and approval. By completing this course, participants will be prepared to administer Microsoft 365 Copilot and agents with confidence.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1768 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1321 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The GitHub Advanced Security Certification Prep course equips participants with the expertise to safeguard their GitHub repositories by mastering security best practices. Learn to configure Dependabot security updates, implement secret scanning, and set up code scanning to identify and mitigate security vulnerabilities. Gain hands-on experience in managing sensitive data and enforcing security policies within your GitHub environment.</p> <p>Dive deeper into identifying security vulnerabilities using CodeQL and conducting thorough code analysis with GitHub CodeQL. Enhance your skills in GitHub administration for advanced security protocols and ensure your organization''s repositories remain secure. This course is ideal for developers, DevOps engineers, and security professionals aiming to strengthen their GitHub security posture.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1769 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2104 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The GitHub Copilot Certification Prep course empowers developers to leverage AI with GitHub Copilot to boost coding productivity and efficiency. Learn the fundamentals of GitHub Copilot, responsible AI practices, and prompt engineering techniques. Explore advanced Copilot features and understand its applications across various environments, including IDEs, chat, and command-line interfaces. Gain insights into management and customization considerations to optimize Copilot usage.</p> <p>Discover practical developer use cases with GitHub Copilot by developing unit tests and integrating it with JavaScript and Python workflows. Learn about GitHub Copilot Business and Enterprise to enhance team collaboration and streamline coding practices. This course is ideal for software developers, AI enthusiasts, and IT professionals looking to maximize GitHub Copilot''s capabilities.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1770 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2145 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The GitHub Actions Certification Prep course provides in-depth knowledge to automate development workflows and enhance software delivery processes. Learn how to configure GitHub Actions to automate development tasks, create continuous integration (CI) workflows, and publish to GitHub Packages. Develop expertise in creating and publishing custom GitHub Actions to optimize your automation pipelines.</p> <p>Explore how to build and deploy applications to Azure using GitHub Actions while understanding enterprise management of workflows for security and efficiency. This course is designed for software developers, DevOps engineers, and IT professionals aiming to improve workflow automation and deployment processes with GitHub Actions.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1771 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2004 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The GitHub Administration Certification Prep course equips participants with the knowledge to efficiently manage and secure GitHub environments. Gain a solid foundation in GitHub administration, including understanding GitHub''s products and maintaining secure repositories through best practices. Learn to authenticate and authorize user identities, manage sensitive data, and enforce security policies effectively.</p> <p>Explore enterprise-level GitHub administration by managing GitHub Actions, supporting enterprise adoption, and publishing packages to GitHub Packages. This course is ideal for GitHub administrators, DevOps engineers, and IT professionals responsible for ensuring the security, scalability, and efficiency of GitHub environments in enterprise settings.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1772 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2040 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The Linux Foundation Certified IT Associate (LFCA) Certification Prep course is designed to help aspiring IT professionals build a solid foundation in essential technologies and practices. Master Linux fundamentals including file management, system and networking commands, while developing core system administration skills such as troubleshooting, performance optimization, and managing network configurations. Learn cloud computing basics including serverless architecture, availability, and budgeting, alongside practical security skills across data, network, and system layers.</p> <p>Dive into DevOps fundamentals with insights on containers, deployment environments, and Git workflows. Understand how to support developers through project management, software architecture, functional analysis, and open-source licensing. This comprehensive course prepares learners for the LFCA certification and a successful start in IT operations, development support, or cloud infrastructure roles.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1797 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1163 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Master the power of Agentic AI to revolutionize your digital marketing and advertising workflows. This comprehensive course equips you with the skills to build autonomous AI-driven marketing pipelines that handle everything from trend discovery and viral content research to multimedia content creation, campaign launches, and performance optimization. Learn how to design goal-driven marketing agents, automate social media posting across Facebook, Instagram, LinkedIn, and X, generate branded images and short-form videos, and orchestrate end-to-end campaign management using cutting-edge LLMs, APIs, and scheduling tools.</p> <p>Whether you are a digital marketer, business owner, or advertising professional, this course empowers you to scale your marketing efforts with intelligent automation. Discover how to connect to platform analytics APIs, perform sentiment analysis, monitor ad spend and ROI across Facebook Ads and Google Ads, and build fully autonomous optimization loops that continuously improve campaign performance. From extracting viral hooks and hashtags to generating A/B testing variations and automated dashboards, you will gain hands-on expertise in deploying Agentic AI systems that drive measurable results while maintaining brand voice, compliance, and AI guardrails.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1798 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1465 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The Certified Kubernetes Security Specialist (CKS) Prep course prepares IT professionals to secure container-based applications and Kubernetes platforms in production environments. Learn how to configure secure cluster setups using network policies, TLS for Ingress, CIS benchmarks, and node protection. Participants will also explore cluster and system hardening practices, such as RBAC, service account restrictions, API access control, and OS-level protections using tools like AppArmor and seccomp.</p> <p>Delve into microservice security by managing secrets, enforcing pod security standards, and using encryption techniques like Cilium for secure pod communication. Gain expertise in securing the software supply chain with trusted image registries, artifact validation, and static analysis tools. Finally, understand runtime security, threat detection, and incident investigation using Kubernetes audit logs and behavioral analytics. This course is ideal for Kubernetes administrators, DevOps engineers, and cloud security professionals pursuing the CKS certification.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1799 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1246 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Transform your workplace with AI-driven efficiency using Microsoft 365 Copilot. This course explores real-world use cases across various departments, helping professionals harness AI to streamline tasks, enhance decision-making, and boost team productivity. Learn how Copilot optimizes workflows in sales, marketing, IT, HR, finance, and operations, driving seamless collaboration and automation. Participants will gain hands-on experience in crafting effective prompts, summarizing information, and leveraging AI-powered content creation to maximize workplace efficiency.</p> <p>Designed for business leaders, department heads, and IT strategists, this course also covers adoption strategies for Microsoft 365 Copilot. Understand how to onboard employees, drive user enablement, and implement AI-powered solutions effectively. Whether you’re looking to optimize business operations or enhance AI adoption within your organization, this course provides the skills and strategies to make AI work for you.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 180 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1560 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p data-start="484" data-end="1035">The RISC-V Foundational Associate (RVFA) Prep course offers learners a deep dive into the open-source RISC-V Instruction Set Architecture (ISA), its ecosystem, and its practical applications in modern computing. Participants will explore the history of RISC-V, its core documentation, and how to contribute to the community. Gain strong foundational knowledge of the RV32I and RV64I instruction sets, modular extensions, privilege modes, and system-level features such as CSRs, interrupts, and memory management.</p> <p data-start="1040" data-end="1633">This course also develops hands-on skills in RISC-V assembly language&mdash;covering syntax, debugging, performance tuning, and high-level code conversion. Learn to program in C for RISC-V using toolchains, debuggers, and SDKs, while understanding stack operations and inline assembly. In addition, participants will explore operating system fundamentals, firmware basics, microcontroller vs application processor distinctions, and running RISC-V applications on general-purpose operating systems. Ideal for embedded systems developers, systems programmers, and computer engineering professionals.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1801 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1355 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The Hyperledger Fabric Certified Practitioner (HFCP) Prep course equips learners with the essential knowledge and skills to work confidently with enterprise-grade blockchain networks. Begin with the fundamentals of blockchain, including distributed ledgers, smart contracts, and consensus mechanisms, and gain a deep understanding of the Hyperledger Fabric model and its business applications.</p> <p>Learn how to design, deploy, and maintain Hyperledger Fabric networks, including managing peers, ordering services, and membership providers. Explore the full chaincode lifecycle, implementing smart contracts to read and modify ledger states, manage private data, and set endorsement policies. Develop client applications with the Gateway model, smart contract invocation, and offline signing techniques. This course is ideal for developers, architects, and IT professionals aiming for HFCP certification and enterprise blockchain roles.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1802 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1109 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The Pearson VUE Certified IT Specialist Java Prep course provides a strong foundation in Java programming for individuals aiming to gain certification and excel in entry-level development roles. Participants will learn the essentials of Java syntax, main method structure, variable scope, input/output operations, and documentation best practices. Develop the ability to manipulate primitive data types, strings, arrays, and array lists, along with skills in parsing, casting, and arithmetic operations.</p> <p>Dive into flow control techniques using branching and looping constructs and build robust object-oriented programs through proper class structure, data members, and methods. This course also emphasizes troubleshooting and debugging, teaching learners to handle syntax, logic, and runtime errors with confidence, including exception handling. Ideal for aspiring software developers and students preparing for the Java IT Specialist certification exam.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1809 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1131 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The Tableau Desktop Specialist Exam Prep course empowers participants to confidently navigate Tableau''s powerful data connection, analysis, and sharing capabilities. This comprehensive training covers essential skills, from creating and managing live connections and extracts to effectively preparing and connecting data from multiple sources. Master key data preparation techniques, including data modeling, joins, and relationships, and learn to optimize data fields and manage properties for effective analysis.</p> <p>Building on these foundations, the course guides you through creating impactful data visualizations, including bar charts, scatterplots, density maps, and advanced visual analytics. Participants also learn to develop interactive dashboards and configure visualizations for a polished, professional presentation. Gain expertise in sharing insights across platforms and formats, from workbooks to PowerPoint exports, while thoroughly preparing for Tableau''s certification. Take the next step in advancing your data skills with this targeted,</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 181 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1615 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The Pearson VUE Certified IT Specialist Databases Prep course equips learners with essential database design and management skills needed to pass the certification exam and excel in database-related roles. Learn to design tables, choose appropriate data types and keys, establish relationships, and normalize databases for efficiency. Understand data protection measures to ensure the integrity and security of information.</p> <p>Gain practical experience using SQL Data Definition Language (DDL) and Data Manipulation Language (DML) to create, modify, and manage tables, views, stored procedures, and functions. Learn how to retrieve, sort, filter, and aggregate data effectively. The course also emphasizes troubleshooting techniques for resolving common issues in query execution, making it ideal for aspiring database administrators, analysts, and IT professionals preparing for the Pearson VUE IT Specialist Databases certification.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1810 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1108 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The Pearson VUE Certified IT Specialist Software Development Prep course provides a comprehensive foundation for aspiring software developers preparing for industry certification. Learn core programming concepts including data types, computer storage, algorithms, flowcharts, and functional programming patterns. Gain experience in incorporating error handling and developing code that follows secure coding principles.</p> <p>Explore the full software development lifecycle (SDLC), application specifications, and version control systems. Build object-oriented solutions using classes, inheritance, and polymorphism, and construct basic web applications with proper hosting and architectural patterns. You''ll also design and normalize databases, write and optimize ANSI SQL queries, manage transactions, and understand both relational and NoSQL database types. This course is ideal for junior developers, software engineering students, and those pursuing IT Specialist Software Development certification.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1811 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1175 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The Pearson VUE Certified IT Specialist Python Prep course is designed to build essential Python programming skills and prepare learners for the IT Specialist Python certification exam. Participants will explore how Python handles data types, operator precedence, and data operations to write accurate and efficient expressions. Gain hands-on experience in controlling program flow using branching and looping structures and performing input/output operations through both the console and files.</p> <p>The course also covers the fundamentals of documenting code, writing functions, and building modular Python applications. Learners will develop the ability to troubleshoot and handle runtime errors using exceptions, as well as write unit tests to ensure code quality. Additionally, participants will solve real-world problems using built-in Python modules and tools. Ideal for beginners, students, and aspiring software developers who want to validate their Python programming skills through certification.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1812 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1179 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The Pearson VUE Certified IT Specialist JavaScript Prep course equips learners with the fundamental JavaScript programming skills required for certification and real-world web development. Participants will master core concepts including operators, variable declarations, functions, and data types. You''ll debug code that uses JavaScript best practices, arithmetic operations, exception handling, and Browser Object Model (BOM) interactions.</p> <p>Gain hands-on experience in DOM manipulation, event handling, and HTML form integration. Learn to construct dynamic webpages by modifying elements, handling user input, and validating forms. Develop and debug code that includes loops, decision structures, and built-in JavaScript functions. This course is ideal for aspiring web developers and students preparing for the Pearson VUE IT Specialist JavaScript certification.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1813 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1041 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The Pearson VUE Certified IT Specialist Cloud Computing Prep course is designed to provide foundational knowledge and practical skills for individuals preparing for cloud-related roles. Learn key cloud computing concepts and service models, and explore how to evaluate, plan, and implement cloud solutions based on business and technical requirements. Gain insights into building the right project team, defining key success criteria, and creating process flow diagrams for effective solution planning.</p> <p>Develop the skills to design, build, and deploy cloud applications using virtual machines, containerization, and integration strategies. Learn to manage development environments, conduct testing, and monitor solutions post-deployment. The course also covers governance best practices, including cost management, business continuity planning, and promoting compliance and security across cloud environments. Ideal for aspiring cloud specialists and IT professionals preparing for the Pearson VUE IT Specialist Cloud Computing certification.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1814 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1612 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The Pearson VUE Certified IT Specialist HTML5 Application Development Prep course equips learners with the front-end development skills needed to build interactive and responsive web applications. Explore the full lifecycle of HTML5 applications from development to debugging and testing. Gain hands-on experience creating graphics and animations using canvas and SVG elements, and apply CSS filters and transformations to enhance visual content.</p> <p>Learn how to build user-friendly web forms with proper markup and input validation, and create modern layouts using responsive design principles, CSS flexbox, and grid. Strengthen your JavaScript skills by creating custom classes, managing application state, handling events, and working with built-in JavaScript APIs. This course is ideal for aspiring web developers and digital professionals aiming for the Pearson VUE HTML5 certification.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1815 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1065 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The Pearson VUE Certified IT Specialist HTML and CSS Prep course is designed to provide a solid foundation in modern web development. Learn to construct well-formed HTML markup using metadata, semantic elements, and form controls, while building structured content and navigation with clean, readable code. Understand the use of multimedia elements to enhance webpages through the integration of images, audio, and video.</p> <p>Develop skills in CSS to format text, position content, style backgrounds and borders, and create simple responsive layouts using best practices. Participants will also explore the importance of accessibility and readability, learning how to apply accessibility principles and validate HTML/CSS for structural and functional integrity. Ideal for aspiring web developers, designers, and IT professionals pursuing the Pearson VUE HTML and CSS certification.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1816 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1054 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The Pearson VUE Certified IT Specialist Computational Thinking Prep course builds foundational problem-solving and logical reasoning skills critical for IT and software development careers. Learners will explore how data is stored and represented using bit patterns, manipulate data through arithmetic and logic operations, and discover the core principles of algorithms, including representation, iterative and recursive structures, and performance analysis.</p> <p>The course also introduces key concepts in programming languages, software engineering methodologies, modularity, and human-machine interaction. Participants will learn data abstraction using classes, objects, and customized data types, and gain a solid understanding of database systems including relational models, object-oriented databases, and data mining. Foundational AI concepts, such as perception and reasoning, along with theoretical computation models like Turing machines and complexity analysis, round out this comprehensive certification prep. Ideal for students, aspiring software engineers, and IT professionals seeking a strong conceptual base in computing.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1817 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1311 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The Pearson VUE Certified IT Specialist Device Configuration and Management Prep course equips learners with practical skills to configure, manage, and troubleshoot Windows devices in personal and enterprise environments. Learn to install Windows with default settings, configure user accounts and desktop environments, manage accessibility features, and ensure systems stay updated.</p> <p>Participants will also gain hands-on experience in managing applications, peripheral connections, cloud-based file access, backup and restore operations, and permission settings. The course also emphasizes essential security practices, including network firewalls, UAC, user authentication, and mobile device protection. Troubleshooting skills are a core focus, helping learners resolve issues related to operating systems, networks, devices, and peripherals. Ideal for aspiring IT technicians, support specialists, and students preparing for the IT Specialist Device Configuration and Management certification.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1818 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1172 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The Pearson VUE Certified IT Specialist Data Analytics Prep course provides a comprehensive introduction to key data analytics concepts and techniques, preparing learners for certification and real-world data roles. Explore the basics of data types, structures, and categories, and learn how to import, clean, organize, and aggregate data for analysis. Develop an understanding of data analysis types, metrics, and exploratory methods, including how to interpret and explain insights effectively.</p> <p>Gain hands-on skills in visualizing data through charts and graphs that highlight trends, relationships, comparisons, and distributions. Learn to communicate findings clearly and responsibly while understanding the role of AI in data analysis. The course also emphasizes ethical data practices, including privacy laws, bias detection, and responsible data handling. Ideal for aspiring data analysts, business intelligence professionals, and students pursuing the Pearson VUE Data Analytics certification.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1819 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1178 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Dive into the essentials of cybersecurity with the Pearson Vue Certified IT Specialist course, focusing on critical topics like defense in depth, operating system security, network device security, and secure computing. Learn to identify and mitigate security risks, enforce robust policies, and safeguard infrastructures from evolving threats.</p> <p>This course offers hands-on training in identifying security principles, managing user authentication, configuring secure network devices, and implementing protection for emails and browsers. From understanding attack types to mastering encryption techniques, participants will acquire the expertise needed to excel in high-demand IT security roles.</p> <p><strong>We are Pearson Vue Authorised Training Partner. </strong></p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 184 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1208 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Gain the essential skills to conduct internal audits based on ISO 14064:2018 standards and ensure accurate greenhouse gas (GHG) reporting and verification. This course provides in-depth understanding of GHG emissions across Scopes 1, 2, and 3, boundary-setting, and the integration of ISO 14064 with other environmental standards like ISO 14001. You&rsquo;ll explore principles of carbon accounting, documentation, and the international reporting framework aligned with today&rsquo;s sustainability requirements.</p> <p>Through hands-on guidance, participants will learn how to quantify emissions, assess lifecycle data, perform uncertainty analysis, and benchmark environmental performance using industry-standard tools. This course is ideal for professionals aiming to drive environmental performance, manage GHG inventories, and support corporate sustainability strategies through internal audits.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1859 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1424 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Unlock the boundless possibilities of automation within the Google Workspace through our specialized Automation with Google Apps Script Training. Kickstart your journey with a deep understanding of what Google Apps Script entails and explore its seamless integration across the suite, be it Sheets, Slides, Doc, Calendar, or Drive.</p> <p>Dive deeper into the nuances of crafting custom triggers, and empower your operations with the creation of automated email alerts, ensuring you stay abreast of every essential update. By the end of this comprehensive training, you''ll be proficient in automating tasks, enhancing workflow efficiency, and maximizing the potential of the Google Workspace environment.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 187 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1246 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The leading tool in database management, this course begins with the fundamentals like creating a new database, and setting up tables with varied data types. You''ll then transition into more advanced areas such as importing and entering data from diverse sources, establishing relationships and primary keys, and adding validation rules that ensure data integrity.</p> <p>As you progress, the training will guide you through the intricacies of sorting and filtering table data, constructing precise queries, and designing user-friendly forms. The curriculum also delves into generating informative reports, leveraging the power of macros for enhanced functionality, and seamlessly integrating with Excel and Outlook. By the course''s end, you''ll also gain valuable insights into maintaining an Access database, ensuring its longevity and efficiency. Whether you''re a beginner or a seasoned user, this course is crafted to elevate your database skills.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 189 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1132 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Prepare to excel in the AWS Certified AI Practitioner AIF-C01 exam with our comprehensive course. Covering essential AI concepts, machine learning fundamentals, and AWS-specific AI tools, this course ensures you gain the necessary skills to succeed. Our expert instructors provide in-depth training on AWS services such as Amazon SageMaker, Amazon Q Business, and Amazon Bedrock, focusing on practical applications and real-world scenarios.</p> <p>The course includes detailed modules on generative AI, responsible AI practices, and the development of machine learning solutions. You''ll explore AI use cases, learn how to implement AI models, and understand the principles of AI security and compliance. With hands-on labs, case studies, and mock exams, you''ll be well-prepared to achieve certification and advance your career in the AI and cloud computing fields.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 19 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1423 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Master the art of building serverless AI workflows with Amazon Bedrock in this hands-on course. Learn the fundamentals of foundation models, model families, and their capabilities while exploring the architecture and core components of generative AI applications. Gain insights into fine-tuning models and leveraging Amazon Bedrock&rsquo;s powerful features to create intelligent AI-driven solutions without complex coding.</p> <p>This course also guides you in developing AI agents that integrate seamlessly with CRM services, customer support repositories, and automation tools. Learn how to configure, optimize, and secure AI workflows in the AWS console while implementing guardrails and performing real-time calculations. Whether you''re a business professional, AI developer, or cloud architect, this course equips you with the skills to leverage Amazon Bedrock for AI-driven automation and innovation.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 196 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1394 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Discover the transformative potential of 3D Printing and Prototyping in our hands-on course tailored for both novices and professionals. Initiate your journey with an in-depth exploration of 3D Prototyping, understanding the nuances of bringing an idea into a palpable dimension. As the course progresses, you''ll be adeptly guided on how to seamlessly transit from mere ideation to a tangible prototype, integrating the potent capabilities of tools like Fusion 360.</p> <p>In addition, harness the power of state-of-the-art 3D scanning applications to meticulously create 3D models. Our course culminates with an immersive tutorial on converting these 3D models into impeccably printed prototypes, ensuring you are equipped with an end-to-end understanding of the 3D prototyping realm. With Tertiary Courses, you are not just learning; you''re sculpting the future, one prototype at a time.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 204 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1071 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>This course on Financial Ratio Analysis equips professionals with essential skills to evaluate an organization''s financial health. Participants will start with an introduction to financial ratio analysis, followed by a detailed review of financial statements. The course covers the calculation and interpretation of key ratios, including liquidity, solvency, profitability, and valuation ratios, providing a comprehensive understanding of an organization''s profitability.</p> <p>Building on this foundation, the course delves into advanced topics such as equity and credit analysis, forecasting net income and cash flows, and assessing the credit quality of debt investments. Through practical exercises, participants will learn to make financial adjustments to better evaluate company performance and investment potential, ensuring they leave with the confidence to apply these techniques in real-world scenarios.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 208 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1538 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>This course provides a comprehensive introduction to Agentic AI and its role in automating business processes. You will explore the differences between Agentic AI and Generative AI, understand LLM reasoning frameworks, and build AI agents using no-code platforms. Learn to develop LLM-powered avatar chatbots and implement AI-driven workflows to optimize operations.</p> <p>Advance your expertise by managing multi-agent AI systems and creating automated workflows with Retrieval Augmented Generation (RAG) and Copilot Agents. Gain hands-on experience in Agentic Process Automation (APA) and leverage AI for seamless business automation. By the end of the course, you will be equipped to design and deploy AI-powered solutions that streamline processes and boost productivity.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 209 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1257 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The Agent2Agent (A2A) Protocol Fundamentals course equips you with the skills to build interoperable AI agents that communicate seamlessly across frameworks and platforms. You will master the A2A standard &mdash; from understanding its client-server architecture, agent cards, and lifecycle management to building production-ready agents using Claude Haiku 4.5 on Vertex AI, Google Agent Development Kit with Gemini 3 Pro, and LangGraph with MCP server integration. This hands-on programme takes you from foundational concepts to advanced multi-agent workflows in a single comprehensive training.</p> <p>Go beyond single-agent systems and learn to chain agents sequentially using ADK, connect agents to Microsoft Agent Framework''s A2A client, and orchestrate multiple specialised agents dynamically with the BeeAI Framework''s Requirement Agent. You will cap off the course by deploying your A2A agents to BeeAI''s Agent Stack, an open-source infrastructure purpose-built for sharing and running A2A agents at scale. Whether you are an AI engineer, solutions architect, or developer looking to future-proof your agentic AI capabilities, this course delivers the practical, framework-spanning expertise the industry demands.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 210 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1392 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Discover the realm of web application development with our meticulously designed course aimed at beginners. This program explores the fundamentals of web development using ASP.NET Core, one of the most robust and high-performing frameworks. You''ll delve into the core principles of C#, HTML, and Razor Pages, which are integral to developing interactive and user-friendly web applications. As you progress through the course, you''ll gain hands-on experience, making you adept at the basics of web app development.</p> <p>Transitioning from theory to practice, this course provides a conducive learning environment that fosters a comprehensive understanding of web app development. Each module is structured to ensure a smooth learning curve, gradually introducing complex concepts while reinforcing the knowledge acquired in previous lessons. By the end of this engaging and interactive course, you will have built a solid foundation in web app development, and be well on your way to advancing to more complex projects and concepts.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 213 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1484 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Take your web development skills to the next level with the "Mastering Responsive Web Design &amp; Bootstrap Framework" course. This course offers a hands-on approach to creating sleek, mobile-friendly web interfaces that look and feel great on any device. Learn the core concepts of responsive web design and explore the versatile Bootstrap framework to streamline your design process. You''ll master the creation of interactive layouts, basic components, and content-rich user interfaces, ensuring an engaging experience for all users. Build flexible and dynamic single-page websites that prioritize usability and functionality.</p> <p>Throughout the course, you''ll gain the technical expertise to develop modern websites with interactive elements, animations, and responsive utilities. From designing graphical user interfaces (GUI) to working with Bootstrap utilities, you''ll have the confidence to create mobile-first, single-page web applications. By the end of this course, you''ll possess the skills and portfolio to land roles in front-end development, UX/UI design, and interactive web develop</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 214 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1596 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>This course provides a comprehensive guide to securing Azure services and workloads using Microsoft Defender for Cloud. Learn to implement regulatory compliance controls, configure network security groups, enable just-in-time virtual machine access, and secure Azure Key Vault with best practices. Gain hands-on experience in deploying Azure Monitor Agent, collecting security data, and enhancing cloud security with Microsoft&rsquo;s compliance benchmarks. Understand how to protect cloud resources, enforce security policies, and monitor virtual machines for potential threats.</p> <p>Through practical exercises, you will configure Defender for Cloud, create Log Analytics workspaces, and apply advanced security measures to safeguard Azure environments. This course is designed for cloud security professionals, IT administrators, and compliance officers looking to enhance their skills in securing Azure workloads. By the end of this training, you will be equipped to strengthen cloud security, improve regulatory compliance, and mitigate risks using Microsoft Defender for Cloud.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 217 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1267 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Our Effective Communication Training delves deep into the essentials of communication, providing participants with the knowledge and tools to communicate more effectively and confidently. From understanding the foundational principles of good communication and recognizing potential barriers, to exploring diverse communication styles, this course ensures a comprehensive learning experience.</p> <p>Enhance your ability to connect, persuade, and convey messages with clarity. Dive into the RESULT tool, a transformative approach to amplifying communication effectiveness, and sharpen your public speaking prowess. Whether you''re looking to elevate workplace conversations or captivate larger audiences, this training is your key to unlocking unparalleled communication excellence.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 22 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1417 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Master professional page layout from the ground up in this hands-on 1-day Adobe InDesign CC Masterclass. InDesign is the industry-standard layout and publishing tool, trusted across print, marketing and digital publishing for brochures, magazines, reports and more. Starting from layout requirements and the InDesign interface, you will progress through creating documents, managing pages, and working with text, graphics, color, frames and paths—building a complete layout workflow step by step.</p> <p>The masterclass then moves into the skills that turn drafts into polished publications: precise text formatting, paragraph and character styles for consistent design, building clean tables, and preparing your documents for professional print export. By the end of the course, you will be able to confidently design, refine and publish professional-quality layouts in InDesign CC.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 23 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1460 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>In today&rsquo;s competitive business landscape, strong service branding is essential for differentiation and long-term success. This course provides a deep dive into service branding strategies, covering key aspects such as brand positioning, communication strategies, and customer experience. Participants will explore real-world examples of service branding success and understand how branding initiatives impact business performance. Through structured frameworks, they will learn how to develop and implement effective service branding strategies that foster customer loyalty and enhance brand perception.</p> <p>By the end of the course, participants will be equipped with actionable insights to evaluate branding effectiveness and measure its impact on business growth. The course also provides methods to assess key branding metrics, ensuring organizations can refine and optimize their branding strategies for sustained competitive advantage. Whether you&rsquo;re a business owner, marketing professional, or brand strategist, this course will empower you to elevate your service brand and drive business success.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 233 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1687 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The DP-603T00 Implement a Real-Time Intelligence Solution with Microsoft Fabric course provides a deep dive into real-time data processing and analytics. Learn how to ingest, transform, store, and visualize live data using Microsoft Fabric. Explore real-time eventstreams, eventhouse integration, and advanced querying with KQL. Understand how to automate actions and optimize real-time dashboards to gain instant insights from streaming data.</p> <p>This course covers key components of Microsoft Fabric&rsquo;s Real-Time Intelligence, equipping you with the skills to create scalable, high-performance data solutions. By the end of the course, you will be proficient in managing eventstreams, utilizing materialized views, and implementing best practices for real-time dashboards, making you a valuable asset in data analytics and business intelligen</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 234 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1034 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Master the complexities of corporate law compliance and regulatory frameworks to drive business success. This comprehensive course provides in-depth insights into Singapore&rsquo;s legal system, global regulatory influences, and industry-specific compliance requirements. Through case studies and expert analysis, you will explore the impact of evolving legal landscapes on business operations, equipping you with strategic decision-making skills to navigate regulatory changes effectively.</p> <p>Designed for professionals and business leaders, this course covers risk assessment, compliance frameworks, change management strategies, and effective stakeholder communication. Learn how to align business strategies with legal requirements while ensuring seamless adaptation to regulatory shifts. Gain the knowledge and skills to mitigate legal risks and position your organization for long-term growth in an evolving legal environment.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 235 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1107 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Embark on a learning journey with our Basic Facebook Marketing &amp; Advertising Training at Tertiary Courses. This foundational course provides insights into the various ad types available on Facebook, guiding participants through the process of setting up an advertising account effectively. It focuses on practical aspects such as identifying and targeting the primary audience and choosing a suitable budget to run successful campaigns. Participants will acquire the skills to write compelling Facebook ads and techniques to boost page posts, directly impacting ad performance positively.</p> <p>This course is meticulously designed to cover the essentials of creating and scheduling reports and understanding Facebook&rsquo;s ad policies thoroughly. As participants delve deeper, they gain practical knowledge in improving ad performance by applying the learned strategies and complying with Facebook&rsquo;s standards. It is an ideal learning experience for individuals who are new to Facebook marketing and advertising, offering them the essential knowledge and skills to start their journey in leveraging Facebook&rsquo;s advertising platform for their business or personal brand.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 238 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1649 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Embark on a journey towards excellence in quality management with our ISO 9001:2015 Quality Management System course. This program is meticulously designed to provide you with an in-depth understanding of the principles and practices of ISO 9001:2015. Whether you''re looking to improve your organization''s quality management processes, aiming for ISO certification, or simply seeking to enhance your professional skills, this course is tailored to meet your needs. With a focus on practical applications and real-world examples, you will learn how to effectively implement and manage a Quality Management System that aligns with the ISO 9001:2015 standards.</p> <p>Our ISO 9001:2015 course is more than just a training program; it''s a transformative experience that empowers you to bring about tangible improvements in organizational quality. You''ll dive into key topics such as process approach, risk-based thinking, and continuous improvement, enabling you to apply these concepts directly to your professional environment. Upon completion, you''ll not only be well-prepared for ISO certification but also equipped with the skills to drive quality excellence in any organizational setting.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 239 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1750 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The Microsoft 365 Administrator course is designed to equip IT professionals with the expertise needed to manage and secure a Microsoft 365 environment effectively. Starting with configuring and managing the Microsoft 365 tenant, participants will delve into managing users, licenses, and custom domains, ensuring a seamless and customized Microsoft 365 experience. The course covers in-depth topics on configuring client connectivity, managing administrative roles for enhanced security, and deploying Microsoft 365 Apps for enterprise, providing learners with comprehensive knowledge on maintaining a healthy and efficient Microsoft 365 tenant.</p> <p>Advanced modules focus on implementing identity synchronization, exploring security metrics in Microsoft Defender XDR, and managing secure user access. Learners will be able to address emerging threats, manage endpoint security, and explore the Zero Trust security model. The course also covers implementing threat protection with Microsoft Defender XDR, including email protection, app protection, and endpoint protection, ensuring participants are well-equipped to update and manage Microsoft 365 security plans effectively.</p> <p>Additionally, the course delves into data governance and compliance within Microsoft 365, including the implementation of compliance measures, managing insider risk, and implementing Microsoft Purview Data Loss Prevention. Participants will learn to establish and communicate access control rules, monitor user access, and investigate breaches with sensitivity and precision. By the end of this course, attendees will have a solid foundation in facilitating Microsoft 365 security administration, planning protective installations, and applying security process and enhancement tool knowledge to safeguard their organization''s Microsoft 365 environment.</p> <p>Microsoft 365 Administrator Training</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 251 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 3145 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>AWS Certified Machine Learning Specialty MLS-C01 Exam Prep is designed to equip you with the necessary skills and knowledge to pass the MLS-C01 exam confidently. This course covers key topics such as data engineering, exploratory data analysis, modeling, machine learning implementation, and operations. Our expert instructors provide in-depth instruction and practical insights, ensuring you grasp complex concepts and apply them effectively.</p> <p>With a focus on real-world applications, our course includes hands-on labs, practice exams, and interactive learning modules. You will learn to use AWS machine learning services, such as SageMaker, to build, train, and deploy models. By the end of the course, you will be well-prepared to tackle the MLS-C01 exam and advance your career in the field of machine learning.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 279 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 991 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The Unix and Bash Script course offers in-depth training on the Unix OS and Bash scripting language, tailored for those keen on mastering Unix commands and automating tasks with Bash scripts. Covering essential topics like Unix file management, regular expressions, and Bash scripting fundamentals, it provides hands-on exercises for practical skill acquisition.</p> <p>Learners delve into advanced topics like pipelines and process management, along with Bash features such as loops and error handling. With real-world challenges, by course end, participants will be adept at using Unix and crafting Bash scripts for efficient system administration.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 29 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1180 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Embark on a captivating journey into the world of visual storytelling with our "Creating Visual Stories with Mobile Photography" course. This program is designed to unleash your creativity and empower you with the skills to capture the essence of moments using just your mobile phone. You will delve into the techniques of using your mobile camera to its fullest potential, understanding the nuances of lighting, composition, and perspective. The course emphasizes the art of storytelling, teaching you how to weave narratives through your photographs, turning everyday scenes into captivating visual stories. Whether you are a budding photographer or a seasoned enthusiast, this course will enhance your ability to see and capture the world in new, exciting ways.</p> <p>In this course, you''ll also explore the transformative power of photo editing, learning to enhance your images to better convey your intended story. The guidance provided will enable you to develop a keen eye for detail and a strong sense of visual aesthetics, crucial for effective visual communication. Our expert instructors will guide you through practical, hands-on projects where you can apply your newfound skills in real-world scenarios. By the end of the course, you will have not only honed your photographic talents but also acquired the ability to create compelling visual narratives that resonate with and captivate your audience. Join us to transform your mobile photography into a powerful tool for storytelling.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 30 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2038 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Unveil the transformative power of data visualization with our "Basic Tableau Training" course. As an increasingly essential tool in the contemporary data landscape, Tableau offers unparalleled capabilities to convert raw data into insightful visual narratives. Our meticulously designed course introduces participants to the foundational aspects of Tableau, including connecting to data sources, merging and joining data, and creating captivating visualizations.</p> <p>Dive deeper to explore more advanced features such as creating custom calculations, fields, crosstabs, and pivoting data. Learn to highlight critical data points and weave them into a coherent story. With hands-on sessions and real-world examples, participants will emerge with a solid grasp of Tableau''s capabilities. By course completion, you''ll be poised to harness the full potential of Tableau, transforming datasets into powerful visuals that captivate and inform.</p> </div>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 330 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1054 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>This course equips engineering professionals with comprehensive knowledge of Electrostatic Discharge (ESD) principles and control techniques. Participants will gain hands-on experience in identifying ESD risks, implementing protective measures, and adhering to international safety standards. Emphasizing both theoretical and practical aspects, this training ensures mastery in static charge mitigation, enabling participants to enhance workplace safety and product integrity.</p> <p>Designed for professionals in manufacturing, electronics, and other technical fields, the curriculum covers advanced ESD management tools and techniques. By the end of the course, attendees will be prepared to establish robust ESD controls, minimize operational disruptions, and contribute to the reliability and longevity of engineering systems.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 337 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1001 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The ITIL4 Foundation Exam Prep course is designed to provide a thorough understanding of the ITIL4 framework, a globally recognized standard in IT Service Management (ITSM). This course covers key concepts, practices, and terminologies associated with ITIL service management, including the ITIL service value system (SVS). Participants will explore the four dimensions of IT service management and understand how they contribute to effective ITSM practices. The course also delves into the ITIL guiding principles, providing a robust foundation for managing IT services.</p> <p>Practical and interactive, this course prepares participants for the ITIL4 Foundation exam. It focuses on the application of ITIL practices in the real world, ensuring that learners can implement the learnt principles in their IT roles. The course is ideal for IT professionals aiming to gain a solid grounding in ITIL principles, as well as those seeking to advance their career in IT service management. With expert instructors and comprehensive materials, participants will be well-equipped to ace the ITIL4 Foundation exam and apply ITIL methodologies in their organizations.</p> <h2>ITIL 4 Exam Voucher</h2> <p>The ITIL 4 Exam Voucher is included in this course fee.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 348 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1739 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Step into the future of AI development with this hands-on course on Vibe Coding for Multi-Agent AI Systems. You will master the foundations of modern AI agents, including modular agent skills, memory systems, and the Model Context Protocol (MCP), before progressing to structured vibe coding workflows and context engineering techniques that ensure reliable, production-ready agent behavior. This course bridges the gap between understanding individual AI agents and orchestrating powerful multi-agent collaboration, equipping you with the practical skills to design, build, and deploy sophisticated AI systems.</p> <p>Through project-driven modules, you will build complete multi-agent systems using both the OpenAI Agent SDK and the Gemini Agent SDK, gaining hands-on experience with structured outputs, API tool calling, supervisor routing, and sub-agent delegation. You will explore deep MCP integration, hierarchical agent design, and deploy your finished systems to Streamlit. Whether you are an AI enthusiast, developer, or business professional looking to harness the power of collaborative AI agents, this course delivers the cutting-edge knowledge and practical expertise you need to lead in the rapidly evolving multi-agent AI landscape.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 349 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1430 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Dive into the expansive realm of Apache Spark through our meticulously crafted training module, designed to offer both novices and experts a comprehensive understanding of this revolutionary data processing engine. Begin your learning journey with an in-depth overview of Apache Spark, understanding its significance in the fast-paced world of big data. Get acquainted with its integral components and delve into the capabilities of Databricks &ndash; a powerful platform enhancing the functionality of Spark. Master the art of interfacing with data, ensuring seamless data ingestion by importing files efficiently.</p> <p>Further, elevate your data science prowess as you explore the functionalities of Spark ML, an integral tool for implementing machine learning algorithms on vast datasets. Complement this with the mastery of Spark SQL, empowering you to efficiently query streaming data, providing real-time insights that drive business decisions. By the end of this course, you will be well-equipped with the skills and knowledge to harness the full potential of Apache Spark, positioning you at the forefront of big data and analytics.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 363 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1313 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>3ds Max is one of the current state of the art tools for architectural visualization, industrial design, animation filmmaking and game design. This beginner-level course helps you to start your career in 3D architectural visualization. You will learn in this course how to create compelling, attractive photo-realistic renders and animations of your building, interior, product or scene.</p> <p>You will learn the key concepts and explore the process involved in preparing, rendering and animating your 3D model. You will also learn how to light, texture and render using the standard tools inside 3ds Max. This course will help you start creating 3D models, work for architectural visualization firms or architect houses. You will also learn how to use the Internet as a platform to sell your 3D models.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 370 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1605 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The AWS Certified Security Specialty SCS-C02 Exam Prep course is designed to equip you with the knowledge and skills necessary to secure your AWS infrastructure effectively. This comprehensive course covers a wide range of topics, including incident response, logging and monitoring, infrastructure security, identity and access management, and data protection. You will gain hands-on experience with AWS security services and learn how to implement best practices for maintaining the security of your AWS environment.</p> <p>With our expert-led training, you will be well-prepared to tackle the AWS Certified Security Specialty SCS-C02 exam. Our course includes in-depth theoretical knowledge, practical labs, and real-world scenarios to ensure you understand how to apply security principles in a cloud environment. Whether you are an AWS professional looking to enhance your security skills or preparing for the certification exam, this course will provide you with the necessary tools and confidence to succeed.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 371 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1185 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Embark on a comprehensive journey into the world of Neo4j Graph Databases. Our training starts with the fundamentals, introducing you to what Neo4j is, its installation, and the intricacies of the Neo4j UI. Dive deep into nodes, labels, and their properties, learning how to create, update, and manage them effectively. Explore the dynamic world of node relationships, understanding patterns, and the art of managing relationships for optimized database performance.</p> <p>Progress further as you discover the seamless ways to import data, especially from CSV sources, and understand the significance of constraints. The course concludes with an in-depth look at data analysis, covering merging nodes, relationships, and leveraging aggregation functions. By the end of this training, you''ll be well-equipped to harness the full potential of Neo4j Graph Databases, ensuring efficient data management and analysis.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 382 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1416 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Unlock the power of agentic AI by learning to build intelligent automation with Gemini CLI. This hands-on course takes you from foundational setup and configuration through to advanced workflow orchestration, equipping you with the skills to harness Google''s open-source command-line AI tool for real-world productivity. You will master Gemini CLI''s reasoning engine, learn to connect Model Context Protocol (MCP) servers, extend capabilities with custom extensions, and automate critical development tasks such as pull request reviews and code improvements through GitHub Actions.</p> <p>Go beyond the basics and build complete end-to-end AI workflows that deliver measurable results. From generating social media content from conference recordings to creating interactive data dashboards that combine local CSV files with cloud data sources, you will gain practical experience connecting Gemini CLI to local files, GitHub, Canva, Google Workspace, and cloud databases. Whether you are a developer looking to supercharge your coding workflow or a professional seeking to automate complex multi-step processes, this course delivers the practical, framework-spanning expertise that today''s AI-driven industry demands.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 383 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1387 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>This course provides a thorough introduction to Git and GitHub, empowering learners with the knowledge of version control, repository management, and effective collaboration workflows. Start with Git basics and master the essential commands, before exploring GitHub&rsquo;s platform for project management, discussions, and pull requests.</p> <p>Advance your skills with modern development tools like GitHub Actions, Codespaces, and Copilot, while ensuring repository security through code scanning, secret scanning, and dependency management. Whether creating new projects or enhancing automation, this course ensures you&rsquo;re well-prepared for every aspect of GitHub platform management and development.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 385 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 920 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Our Microsoft Azure Enterprise Data Analyst Associate course is meticulously designed for professionals seeking to elevate their data analysis skills. This comprehensive training will empower you with the knowledge and practical skills required to leverage Microsoft Azure for enterprise-level data analytics.</p> <p>Engage with expert-led instruction, hands-on labs, and real-world case studies that will solidify your understanding of Microsoft Azure''s tools and platforms specific to data analysis. Upon course completion, you will be proficient in analyzing and interpreting complex enterprise data, allowing you to make data-driven decisions that drive business success. Stand out in the competitive field of data analysis by becoming a certified Microsoft Azure Enterprise Data Analyst Associate.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 389 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2173 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>DevOps Foundation Exam Prep offers a comprehensive introduction to the world of DevOps. This course begins with an exploration of DevOps principles, including Continuous Integration, Continuous Delivery, and the importance of security and testing. You will dive into essential practices like site reliability engineering, DevSecOps, and the use of Kanban, ensuring you are well-versed in modern DevOps methodologies.</p> <p>In addition, the course covers vital frameworks and toolchains. You will learn about Agile and Lean methods, IT Service Management, and the significance of organizational culture in DevOps environments. The curriculum also includes automation, cloud computing, containers, microservices, and AI/ML applications in DevOps. By the end, you will be equipped with the metrics and leadership skills necessary to implement DevOps effectively within an enterprise setting.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 392 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1393 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Embark on a journey to master web application development using Flask, one of Python''s most powerful micro-frameworks. This hands-on course begins by guiding you through the essentials of setting up Flask as a web API middleware, creating simple web APIs, and testing them using Postman. You will then delve into Flask''s templating framework, learning how to integrate data and variables, implement control structures, and manage static files to create dynamic and responsive web pages.</p> <p>As you advance, you will explore the creation of RESTful APIs, working with JSON data, HTTP methods, and status codes, along with implementing and testing variable rules. The course culminates with deploying your Flask application to Heroku, a leading cloud platform. By the end of this course, you will have the skills to build, test, and deploy professional-grade web applications using Flask.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 393 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1406 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The CompTIA IT Fundamentals (ITF+) Exam Prep course is designed to equip you with essential IT knowledge and skills, providing a solid foundation for your IT career. This course covers a wide range of topics including understanding common computing devices, mastering the use of operating systems, managing and troubleshooting OS issues, and providing effective support. You''ll also learn to use and develop apps, work with various data types, and understand the fundamentals of databases.</p> <p>Delve into the essentials of computer hardware, networking, and security with hands-on training that includes using system components, connecting to networks, secure web browsing, and implementing security best practices. Whether you''re new to IT or looking to enhance your knowledge, this course prepares you for the CompTIA IT Fundamentals (ITF+) certification exam, setting you on the path to IT success.</p> <h2>Exam Voucher</h2> <p>This course include a Autodesk Exam Voucher at Our Pearson Vue Test Center.&nbsp;<span>You can purchase the exam voucher (one of the lowest prices in Singapore) at&nbsp;<a href="https://www.tertiarycourses.com.sg/comptia-certification-exam-vouchers-for-itf-cloud-essential.html" title="CompTIA Certification Exam Vouchers for ITF+, Cloud Essential" target="_blank"><span style="text-decoration: underline;">CompTIA Certification Exam Vouchers for ITF+, Cloud Essential</span></a>.</span></p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 402 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1710 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Our PL-200 Microsoft Power Platform Functional Consultant Exam Prep course is meticulously designed to provide you with the knowledge, skills, and confidence needed to ace your PL-200 exam. This course covers all the essential topics and provides practical tips and strategies to help you succeed.</p> <p>With our expert guidance, you will gain a deep understanding of the Microsoft Power Platform and learn how to effectively use it to your advantage. Our course is structured to ensure that you are well-prepared for the exam and can confidently demonstrate your skills and knowledge. Enroll now and take the first step towards becoming a Microsoft Power Platform Functional Consultant.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1405 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2373 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The VHDL Programming Training for FPGA, meticulously structured for professionals and enthusiasts eager to harness the full potential of FPGA design. This course offers a detailed insight into VHDL syntax and coding styles pivotal to logic design, coupled with hands-on sessions on writing robust VHDL RTL hardware designs. By incorporating good coding practices, learners will comprehend the synthesizable subset of VHDL, shedding light on potential pitfalls and problematic coding areas.</p> <p>Furthermore, participants will explore the dynamic world of standard VHDL packages, including std_logic_1164 and numeric_std, mastering types, overloading, and conversion functions. The training doesn''t stop at the basics; delve into advanced testbench writing using TEXTIO, and craft transaction-based testbenches through subprograms. By the course''s conclusion, attendees will be adept at leveraging VHDL simulation and synthesis tools, ensuring an elevated competency in FPGA design and VHDL programming.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 419 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1176 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>A meticulously crafted Verilog Programming Training for FPGA enthusiasts and professionals, positioning them at the forefront of modern logic design. Participants will gain a profound understanding of VERILOG syntax and the pivotal coding styles that resonate with efficient logic design. The training emphasizes writing VERILOG RTL hardware designs with a keen focus on best coding practices, ensuring robust and optimized outcomes.</p> <p>Navigating deeper, learners will be enlightened on the synthesizable subset of VERILOG, coupled with the know-how of addressing problematic coding issues in hardware. The course curriculum further integrates essential skills like printing messages in testbenches and scripting transaction-based testbenches using subprograms. With hands-on guidance on leveraging VERILOG simulation and synthesis tools, participants will be fully equipped to pioneer innovative FPGA solutions and drive excellence in their respective domains.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 420 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1138 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Embark on a transformative journey with FPGA Designer Training, meticulously tailored for those passionate about FPGA design and optimization. Dive deep into the intricate workings of both ALTERA and Xilinx FPGA architectures, garnering a robust understanding that sets the foundation for successful FPGA projects. Our course walks you through the detailed nuances of the tool flows of these leading FPGA technologies, ensuring a seamless design experience.</p> <p>Venture beyond just architectural insights, embracing the art of writing synthesizable codes, which is the cornerstone of any FPGA project. Harness the power of in-built libraries, understanding their intricate functionalities, and leverage them for efficient FPGA designs. Additionally, the training accentuates the crucial stages of downloading code into FPGA and offers hands-on experience on its debugging features. By the end of this course, be well-equipped with the expertise to tackle any FPGA challenge, ensuring optimal designs and smooth project executions.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 421 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1203 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Embark on a transformative learning journey with our "Solving Problems with Machine Learning" course. Tailored for professionals eager to master AI, this course equips you with the ability to apply machine learning techniques to solve complex challenges in your industry. You''ll uncover the secrets of data-driven decision-making and predictive analytics, ensuring you''re able to identify patterns, make informed predictions, and craft innovative solutions. Each session is designed to build your proficiency in harnessing the power of AI, preparing you to take on problems with confidence and creativity.</p> <p>This course is not just about learning the theory; it''s a springboard into the world of artificial intelligence applications. Through a blend of expert instruction and hands-on practice, you''ll learn to navigate the machine learning landscape, develop AI strategies, and implement solutions that drive results. Whether you''re tackling issues in finance, healthcare, or e-commerce, our training will provide you with the knowledge and tools to make an impact. Get started on Shopee and other platforms in just one day and join the ranks of skilled professionals who are making strides with the power of machine learning.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 425 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1413 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The Kubernetes and Cloud Native Associate (KCNA) Training provides a comprehensive introduction to Kubernetes, container orchestration, and cloud-native technologies. This course covers essential topics such as Kubernetes architecture, API, scheduling, and resource management. You will learn how to leverage container orchestration techniques, runtime environments, security best practices, networking configurations, and service mesh implementations to optimize cloud-native applications.</p> <p>Additionally, the course explores cloud-native observability with Prometheus, telemetry, and cost management strategies. You will gain hands-on experience in cloud-native application delivery using GitOps, CI/CD pipelines, and automation techniques. By the end of the training, you will be well-prepared for the KCNA certification, enhancing your career in DevOps, cloud engineering, and modern application development.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 426 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1097 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Elevate your Machine and Deep Learning knowledge with our meticulously crafted TensorFlow course at Tertiary Courses. Beginning with fundamental TensorFlow 2 operations, participants will be introduced to the expansive world of Neural Networks, with hands-on learning in both Regression and Classification domains. Delve deeper into specialized arenas, understanding the intricacies of Convolutional Neural Networks for Vision and exploring the vast applications of Recurrent Neural Networks for Sequential Data.</p> <p>Our training goes beyond just the foundational elements. Experience the power of Transfer Learning and unlock new horizons with TensorFlow Hub, ensuring you''re not just familiar, but proficient with the wide-ranging functionalities TensorFlow offers. Guided by seasoned experts and enriched with practical sessions, this course is your definitive step towards mastering TensorFlow-driven Deep and Machine Learning.</p> <h2>Certificate</h2> <p>All participants will receive a Certificate of Completion from Tertiary Courses after achieved at least 75% attendance.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 430 AND `store_id` = 1 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1265 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Embark on a journey to become a proficient Microsoft 365 Administrator with our comprehensive MS-102 Exam Preparation Course. This course is meticulously designed for IT professionals aiming to master the intricacies of Microsoft 365 services. Participants will delve into the core aspects of managing Microsoft 365 subscriptions, user identity, access, and roles. The curriculum covers vital topics such as advanced security measures, compliance policies, and deployment of Microsoft 365 workloads. Whether you are seeking to enhance your skills or aiming for the Microsoft 365 Administrator certification, this course provides the knowledge and practical insights to achieve your goals.</p> <p>Our MS-102 Microsoft 365 Administrator Exam Prep Course not only prepares you for the certification exam but also equips you with real-world skills to manage and secure Microsoft 365 environments effectively. Learners will benefit from hands-on experience in implementing modern device services, managing Microsoft 365 governance and compliance, and handling various administrative functions. With expert instructors and a dynamic learning environment, Tertiary Courses offers an unparalleled opportunity to elevate your professional capabilities in the ever-evolving world of cloud services and security management. Join us to unlock your potential and excel in the realm of Microsoft 365 administration.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 432 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 3046 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Master 3D modeling from the ground up in this hands-on 2-day Rhino Masterclass. Rhino (Rhinoceros 3D) is one of the most versatile NURBS modeling tools in the design industry, trusted across architecture, product design, jewellery and industrial design. Starting from the interface and viewport navigation, you will progress through drawing precise 2D geometry, building curves, surfaces and solids, and editing your models with fillets, Booleans, trims and transformations—building a complete modeling workflow step by step.</p> <p>On day two the masterclass moves into the skills that turn models into finished work: measuring and dimensioning, organising complex scenes with layers and blocks, applying materials and textures, and producing polished rendered images with Rhino Render. You will consolidate everything by building your own project from reference images and design guidelines, and learn advanced control-point editing to refine curves and surfaces with precision. By the end of the course, you will be able to confidently model, organise and present professional 3D designs in Rhino.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 433 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1198 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Elevate your data analytics skills with our Elasticsearch Essential Training enhanced with Kibana. This course provides a thorough understanding of the Elastic Stack ELK family, demystifying the intricate world of data indexing, search, and visualization. Kickstart your learning experience with hands-on guidance on installing Elasticsearch and Kibana, ensuring a seamless setup for your data exploration journey.</p> <p>Dive deeper into the robust Elasticsearch Query DSL, acquiring proficiency in crafting powerful data queries. Harness the potential of data filtering and aggregation to extract meaningful insights from your datasets. Finally, transition into data visualization using Kibana, creating compelling dashboards that communicate your data stories effectively. By the culmination of this course, you''ll be poised to leverage Elasticsearch and Kibana to their fullest, driving data-driven decisions across your projects and ventures.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 457 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1466 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Step into the evolving realm of the Internet of Things (IoT) by harnessing the power of the Raspberry Pi coupled with the versatile Node-RED platform. This course offers a holistic overview of IoT, enabling participants to understand its core concepts, nuances, and the massive potential it holds in the digital era. With a keen focus on practical implementation, we guide you through the process of uploading data to ThingSpeak Cloud Computing, a pivotal component in modern IoT ecosystems.</p> <p>Further delving into the world of cloud-based data analytics and visualization, the training provides hands-on experience in deriving meaningful insights from vast data streams. Moreover, with the integration of MQTT, participants will adeptly read data from ThingSpeak, ensuring a robust grasp over real-time data handling. By the end of this comprehensive course, you''ll be well-equipped with the knowledge and skills to design and manage Raspberry Pi-driven IoT projects with precision and efficiency.</p> <p><span style="color: #ff0000;"><strong>Note that the Raspberry kit is used for the training. The course fee does not include the kit.</strong></span></p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 467 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1701 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Master the full power of Tableau with the Tableau Desktop Masterclass. This hands-on masterclass takes you from Tableau fundamentals to advanced analytics &mdash; explore the Tableau interface, work with dimensions and measures, connect to diverse data sources, and build compelling views with data joins, blending and aggregations.</p> <p>Go beyond the basics with data transformation, interactive dashboards and stories, calculated fields and parameters, and advanced analytics including trend lines, forecasting, clustering and Level of Detail (LOD) expressions. Round off with map analytics using map services and Mapbox integration. With hands-on exercises and expert-led content, you will leave able to turn raw data into compelling visual narratives with Tableau Desktop.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 469 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1225 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>CompTIA A+ certified professionals are proven problem solvers. They support today&rsquo;s core technologies from security to networking to virtualization and more. CompTIA A+ is the industry standard for launching IT careers into today&rsquo;s digital world.</p> <p>CompTIA A+ is the only industry recognized credential with performance testing to prove professionals can think on their feet to perform critical IT support tasks. It is trusted by employers around the world to identify the go-to person in end point management &amp; technical support roles. CompTIA A+ appears in more tech support job listings than any other IT credential.</p> <p>The CompTIA A+ Core Series requires candidates to pass two exams: Core 1 (220-1101) and Core 2 (220-1102) covering the following new content, emphasizing the technologies and skills IT pros need to support a hybrid workforce.</p> <p>Increased reliance on SaaS applications for remote work</p> <ul> <li>More on troubleshooting and how to remotely diagnose and correct common software, hardware, or connectivity problems</li> <li>Changing core technologies from cloud virtualization and IoT device security to data management and scripting</li> <li>Multiple operating systems now encountered by technicians on a regular basis, including the major systems, their use cases, and how to keep them running properly</li> <li>Reflects the changing nature of the job role, where many tasks are sent to specialized providers as certified personnel need to assess whether it&rsquo;s best to fix something on site, or to save time and money by sending proprietary technologies directly to vendors</li> </ul>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 471 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2218 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Embark on a comprehensive preparation journey for the SC-900 Microsoft Security, Compliance, and Identity Fundamentals exam. Our course is meticulously designed to cover all key areas of the exam, ensuring that you are well-equipped with the knowledge and skills needed to excel. From understanding Microsoft''s security framework to grasping the nuances of compliance and identity management, this course offers a holistic approach to mastering the fundamentals.</p> <p>Tertiary Courses ensures that every aspirant gains a deep understanding of the subject matter, bolstering their confidence for the SC-900 exam. Our expert-led sessions, combined with practical insights, will empower you to navigate the challenges of the examination effortlessly. By the end of this training, you''ll be primed to secure your Microsoft certification and further your career in the ever-evolving domain of IT security and compliance.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 472 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2255 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Unearth the power and potential of Natural Language Processing with our dedicated Python NLTK Training at Tertiary Courses. In this meticulously crafted course, participants begin their journey with basic text analysis using NLTK, laying a firm foundation for advanced NLP endeavors. The course sheds light on robust techniques for Text Classification and seamlessly integrates with Scikit-Learn classifiers, ensuring a holistic understanding of combining NLP tools for optimal outcomes.</p> <p>Venture further into the world of NLP by grasping the intricacies of Gensim, a powerful library designed for topic modeling and document indexing. Additionally, the course introduces the participants to Word2Vec, an innovative two-layer neural net to process text. This training, with its blend of theory and practice, equips learners to harness the capabilities of NLTK and other associated tools, ensuring they''re well-prepared to tackle real-world NLP challenges with finesse and precision.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 475 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1474 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The Certified Lean Six Sigma Green Belt course provides a solid foundation in the Six Sigma methodology, focusing on the DMAIC (Define, Measure, Analyze, Improve, Control) workflow. Participants will gain in-depth knowledge on project selection, problem-solving techniques, and data-driven process improvement tools. From defining clear project goals to using advanced statistical methods, the course empowers professionals to lead improvement initiatives effectively.</p> <p>The course also covers critical concepts such as root cause analysis, process control strategies, and Six Sigma improvement tools like FMEA, DOE, and Kaizen. By the end of the program, participants will be well-equipped to manage Six Sigma projects, reduce process variations, and achieve higher operational efficiency in their organizations.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 481 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1385 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Dive into the essential realms of information protection and compliance with our SC-400 Microsoft Certified Information Protection and Compliance Administrator Associate Exam Preparation Course. This course offers an in-depth exploration of Microsoft 365 compliance solutions, focusing on data governance, rights management, and regulatory compliance standards. Participants will gain hands-on experience with implementing information protection, data loss prevention, and compliance management solutions across their organizations. Designed to empower professionals to ace the SC-400 certification exam, the curriculum is structured around real-world scenarios and current compliance regulations, ensuring you have the practical knowledge to implement and manage a comprehensive compliance and security strategy effectively.</p> <p>As cybersecurity threats evolve, the demand for skilled compliance administrators has never been higher. This course equips you with the knowledge to navigate the complexities of information protection, data governance, and compliance in Microsoft 365 environments. Through expert instruction and practical exercises, you''ll be prepared to take on the SC-400 exam confidently and embark on a rewarding career in information security and compliance.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 482 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 3086 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Dive into the world of cybersecurity with our ISC2 Information Systems Security Professional (CISSP) Exam Preparation course. Designed for security practitioners, managers, and executives interested in proving their knowledge across a wide array of security practices and principles, this course offers an in-depth review of the knowledge required to effectively design, engineer, and manage the overall security posture of an organization.</p> <p>Our expert-led training not only prepares you for the CISSP exam but also equips you with practical skills for real-world challenges. Covering eight essential domains of information security, the course material is aligned with the (ISC)&sup2; CISSP Common Body of Knowledge (CBK). You''ll gain insights into security and risk management, asset security, security architecture and engineering, communication and network security, identity and access management (IAM), security assessment and testing, security operations, and software development security.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 483 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1612 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Enter the dynamic world of Google Tag Manager (GTM) with our comprehensive Essential Training. This course is meticulously designed for individuals aiming to streamline their website''s data collection and management processes. GTM, being an indispensable tool for digital marketers, offers vast possibilities, and this training sheds light on each one of them, starting with the basics of account and container creation.</p> <p>Learn the art of installing containers seamlessly, manipulating variables for customized data collection, and firing events using precise triggers. The course also delves deep into the realm of custom tags, enhancing your GTM expertise. By the end of this program, participants will be well-equipped with the knowledge and hands-on experience needed to efficiently use Google Tag Manager for their digital initiatives, making their online marketing strategies more data-driven and impactful.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 484 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1369 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Embark on a journey of discovery and mastery with our 5-day Blockchain Specialization course. This comprehensive training is crafted to provide you with an in-depth understanding of blockchain technology, its mechanisms, and its far-reaching applications. The course begins with the fundamentals, explaining the principles of distributed ledger technology, and then moves on to explore the intricacies of blockchain networks, cryptocurrencies like Bitcoin and Ethereum, and the underlying principles of smart contracts. The curriculum is designed to cater to both beginners and those with some prior knowledge, ensuring a complete understanding of blockchain technology.</p> <p>In the advanced stages of the course, you will gain hands-on experience with blockchain security protocols, learn about the emerging trends in blockchain technology, and understand how to apply this knowledge in real-world scenarios. The course highlights include in-depth analysis of case studies, practical exercises in blockchain development, and insights into leveraging blockchain for business innovations. By the end of the course, you will have acquired the skills to implement blockchain solutions effectively and will be well-equipped to navigate the evolving landscape of blockchain technology. This course is an essential stepping stone for anyone looking to make a mark in the field of blockchain, whether for career advancement or personal interest.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 487 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1610 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>This course provides a comprehensive guide to implementing data science and machine learning solutions using Microsoft Fabric. Learn the end-to-end analytics workflow, from data exploration and preprocessing to model training and deployment. Gain hands-on experience with notebooks, Data Wrangler, and MLflow to handle data distribution, missing values, and predictive modeling. Discover how to leverage Microsoft Fabric for seamless data processing, visualization, and machine learning experimentation.</p> <p>Through practical exercises, you will train and track machine learning models, generate batch predictions, and manage AI-driven workflows efficiently. This course is ideal for data scientists, analysts, and AI professionals looking to integrate Microsoft Fabric into their data science pipeline. By the end of the training, you will be equipped to build scalable machine learning solutions, optimize predictive analytics, and enhance decision-making with AI-powered insights.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 488 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1156 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Are you ready to take your PowerPoint presentations to the next level, but don’t know where to begin? The cure for the common PowerPoint often seems more elusive than it is. Incorporating visual storytelling techniques into your slides can set you apart in a very big way. This course will teach you how to create visual storytelling with poweroint</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 498 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 911 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Discover the roadmap to building a prosperous business with our specialized course, "How To Build A Successful Business Through Digital Marketing And E-commerce" at Tertiary Courses. This meticulously curated program dives deep into the multifaceted world of digital marketing and e-commerce, providing comprehensive insights into using platforms like Shopify to create a thriving online store. Learn the intricacies of leveraging SEO to augment your online presence, ensuring your business stands out in the crowded digital landscape. The course is brimming with actionable strategies and practical knowledge, equipping aspiring entrepreneurs with the skills to navigate and conquer the e-commerce world.</p> <p>By embarking on this transformative journey, participants will grasp the fundamentals of enhancing sales through potent social media marketing strategies. The dynamic learning environment fosters an understanding of crafting compelling marketing content and utilizing various online platforms to reach a broader audience, thereby driving business growth and success. This course is a gateway to mastering the synergy between digital marketing and e-commerce, empowering individuals to elevate their businesses and achieve unparalleled success in the competitive market. The amalgamation of theoretical knowledge and hands-on experiences facilitates a profound learning experience, enabling participants to actualize their entrepreneurial visions effectively.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 497 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1641 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Master the art of fine-tuning Large Language Models (LLMs) to build powerful, custom AI solutions tailored to your business needs. This comprehensive course takes you from the foundations of transformer architecture and attention mechanisms through to advanced techniques including Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG), Supervised Fine-Tuning (SFT), Parameter Efficient Fine-Tuning (PEFT), and Low-Rank Adaptation (LoRA). You will gain hands-on experience building RAG systems, working with vector databases, and implementing cutting-edge reinforcement learning strategies such as Group Relative Policy Optimization (GRPO) to supercharge your model''s performance.</p> <p>Take your AI expertise to the next level by learning how to deploy production-ready fine-tuned models using Hugging Face libraries, datasets, and tokenizers. Whether you are looking to create domain-specific AI agents, optimize NLP applications, or unlock the full potential of open-source LLMs, this course equips you with the practical skills and knowledge to fine-tune, evaluate, and deploy models with confidence. Graduate with the ability to transform general-purpose language models into high-performing, task-specific AI powerhouses that deliver real business value.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 502 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1416 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>This AWS Certified DevOps Engineer Training is designed to equip professionals with the advanced skills needed to automate software delivery and infrastructure management on the AWS platform. You will learn to build and implement scalable CI/CD pipelines, integrate automated testing, manage build artifacts, and deploy applications across instance, container, and serverless environments. Participants will also explore infrastructure as code (IaC) and configuration management techniques for automating and securing cloud infrastructure across multi-account AWS environments.</p> <p>The course also delves into designing resilient and scalable cloud architectures, implementing automated monitoring and log analytics, and developing event-driven response mechanisms for troubleshooting and recovery. In addition, you will master AWS identity and access management (IAM), automate security protocols, and ensure compliance at scale. This intensive training not only prepares you for the AWS Certified DevOps Engineer exam but also equips you with real-world skills that are highly demanded in cloud operations, system reliability engineering, and security automation role</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 503 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1711 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Delve into the dynamic world of DevOps with our Google Professional Cloud DevOps Engineer Certification Prep course. Designed for IT professionals and DevOps enthusiasts, this course offers a deep dive into the practices and tools essential for building and maintaining reliable and efficient systems on the Google Cloud Platform (GCP). The curriculum encompasses core DevOps principles, including continuous integration (CI), continuous delivery (CD), and site reliability engineering (SRE). You will gain hands-on experience in managing cloud-based infrastructure and services, mastering the use of GCP for automating the deployment, scaling, and monitoring of cloud solutions.</p> <p>This course is an ideal pathway for those aspiring to become certified Google Cloud DevOps Engineers. Our expert instructors will guide you through the intricacies of implementing DevOps processes in a cloud environment, focusing on optimizing resource utilization and improving operational efficiency. The training includes practical exercises and real-world case studies, ensuring you not only prepare for the certification exam but also acquire skills that are directly applicable in your professional role. Whether you''re aiming to enhance your current skills or transition into a DevOps role, this course will equip you with the knowledge and confidence to excel in the fast-evolving domain of cloud computing. Join us to elevate your career and become a leader in implementing DevOps best practices on Google Cloud</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 504 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2162 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>In the digital age, the need to understand and mitigate cyber threats is paramount. Our Basic Cyber Security Course is meticulously curated to acquaint you with the contemporary challenges posed by cyber adversaries. By delving deep into prevalent threats such as Malware, Phishing, and the intricacies of Network Security, this course offers an indispensable primer for individuals aiming to fortify their knowledge base and shield digital assets.</p> <p>Beyond simply understanding the myriad threats, this course emphasizes effective strategies and measures to counteract them. By mastering the art of protection against cyber threats, participants will emerge equipped with the tools and knowledge to ensure digital environments remain impervious to malicious attacks. Embark on this transformative journey and become a beacon of cyber safety in the interconnected world.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 506 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1416 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p><span>Elevate your proficiency in business analytics by mastering the creation of interactive Excel dashboards. This comprehensive course guides participants from the initial stages of defining requirements and setting up data, to more intricate processes such as importing data, inserting slicers, and diving into the intricacies of VBA code. Emphasizing hands-on learning, participants will delve into practical exercises, ensuring they become adept in tailoring dashboards that resonate with their organizational needs. </span></p> <p><span>Enhance the visual appeal of your dashboards through a nuanced understanding of color, typography, and hierarchy, while ensuring an intuitive user experience. The course also introduces participants to the analytical prowess of Excel through Goal Seek and Solver, thereby cementing their capabilities in data-driven decision making. Whether you''re looking to optimize your existing dashboards or craft one from scratch, this training offers all the tools you need for analytical success.</span></p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 507 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1596 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Dive into the realm of data engineering with our Google Professional Data Engineer Certification Prep course. Tailored for professionals aspiring to excel in the field of data and analytics, this course offers an in-depth understanding of designing, building, and managing data processing systems on the Google Cloud Platform (GCP). You''ll gain hands-on experience in working with big data technologies, learning how to design data processing systems, and ensure their scalability, reliability, and efficiency. The course covers key concepts such as data modeling, warehouse solutions, and data pipeline creation, equipping you with the skills to effectively handle and analyze large datasets.</p> <p>This course not only prepares you for the Google Professional Data Engineer certification exam but also focuses on practical applications of data engineering principles in real-world scenarios. Through expert-led sessions, you''ll explore advanced topics like machine learning model implementation, data security, and resource optimization in cloud environments. Our approach combines theoretical knowledge with practical exercises, ensuring that you develop the competency to design and manage robust data solutions on GCP. Whether you''re a budding data engineer or an experienced professional looking to validate your skills with a certification, this course is your gateway to becoming an expert in cloud-based data engineering. Enroll now to elevate your expertise and take a leap forward in your data engineering career.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 511 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2181 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Explore the realm of Search Engine Optimisation (SEO) for eCommerce stores at Tertiary Courses and become proficient in elevating your store&rsquo;s online presence through proven whitehat techniques. Understand the nuances of Whitehat versus Blackhat SEO and learn how to leverage ethical and effective strategies to optimize your search results. Immerse in the essential on-page and off-page Whitehat SEO techniques that guarantee sustained improvements in your website&rsquo;s visibility. This course emphasizes the application of potent keywords to escalate your rankings, providing insights that are directly applicable to your eCommerce initiatives.</p> <p>Enhance your analytical skills by leveraging Google Analytics to meticulously evaluate the effectiveness of your SEO strategies. By the end of this course, participants will have acquired the proficiency to implement advanced SEO strategies that align with their business objectives, driving more traffic and ensuring higher click-through rates. The course is structured to offer a wealth of practical knowledge and actionable insights, making it a valuable learning experience for individuals keen on mastering SEO for eCommerce stores, whether they are novices or experienced professionals.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 153 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1776 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Embark on a transformative journey into the world of data analytics with our Data Analytics with RapidMiner course at Tertiary Courses. RapidMiner Studio, hailed as a top-tier platform in the data analytics community, facilitates a seamless and robust experience in deciphering complex data structures. Our tailored curriculum promises participants a comprehensive understanding of RapidMiner''s dynamic interface and its potent capabilities.</p> <p>Starting with an immersive introduction to RapidMiner Studio, trainees will navigate through the nuances of meticulous data preparation. The subsequent modules unfurl the mysteries behind creating compelling predictive models, ensuring that participants harness their data to its maximum potential. Culminating in model evaluation, learners will acquire the skills to scrutinize and refine their analytical outputs. Join us and elevate your data analytics acumen to new pinnacles with RapidMiner.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 520 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1115 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Unlock the potential of genomic data with our advanced course on Genomic Data Analysis with R and Bioconductor. This comprehensive program covers essential bioinformatics skills, including gene expression analysis, DNA sequencing, and genomic pipelines. Gain hands-on experience with Bioconductor tools and R programming, enabling you to process, analyze, and interpret complex genomic datasets with precision.</p> <p>Designed for professionals in genetic research and bioinformatics, this course focuses on practical applications, offering insights into data visualization, annotation, and statistical modeling. Elevate your expertise in genomics and make data-driven discoveries that can revolutionize healthcare, agriculture, and beyond.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 522 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1451 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The Project Management Professional (PMP) Exam Prep course is meticulously designed for aspiring project managers aiming to certify their skills with the globally recognized PMP credential. This course covers the latest best practices highlighted in the PMBOK Guide - 6th Edition and prepares participants for the PMP exam through rigorous training, practical examples, and mock exams. By the end of this course, you will have an in-depth understanding of the five process groups and ten knowledge areas needed to manage projects efficiently, ensuring you&rsquo;re well-prepared to take the PMP exam with confidence.</p> <p>Beyond exam preparation, the course emphasizes real-world application, equipping participants with advanced project management tools and techniques to drive project success in any industry. Our expert instructors, who are certified PMP practitioners, provide personalized guidance, sharing insights from their own experiences in managing large and complex projects. Whether you''re looking to improve your project delivery, increase your marketability, or advance your career, this course offers the knowledge and skills you need to achieve your professional goals.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 523 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1717 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The Certified Lean Six Sigma Yellow Belt course provides a comprehensive exploration of Kaizen, Lean, and Six Sigma principles, equipping professionals with the knowledge to contribute meaningfully to process improvement initiatives. Through the Six Sigma DMAIC roadmap, participants will master methodologies for defining project goals, analyzing inefficiencies, and implementing effective solutions. This course emphasizes hands-on learning, covering key tools such as SIPOC diagrams, process mapping, and control charts.</p> <p>Each phase of the DMAIC process is explored in depth, from capturing the Voice of the Customer and developing a project charter to identifying root causes with Fishbone diagrams and the 5 Why analysis. Participants will also learn to prioritize solutions, implement pilot projects, and sustain improvements with control plans. This certification prepares professionals to support and lead quality initiatives, ensuring measurable impact in any organization.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 524 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1561 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Navigating the world of finance can be daunting, especially for those not rooted in its intricacies. Our course on "Finance for Non-Finance Managers" demystifies financial jargon and principles, ensuring participants confidently engage in financial discussions and make informed decisions. From understanding financial statements to budgeting and forecasting, we cover the crucial areas to empower managers in any domain.</p> <p>A strong financial understanding is indispensable in today''s dynamic business environment. This course is meticulously crafted to bridge the gap between financial experts and managers from other verticals. Equip yourself with the knowledge to analyze financial data, comprehend the financial health of an organization, and contribute more effectively to strategic planning and execution.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 525 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1798 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Discover the critical techniques for delivering outstanding customer service, a key element that can significantly increase your business''s success. This comprehensive course delves deep into the proven strategies for enhancing service delivery, ensuring customer loyalty, and fostering positive customer relationships.</p> <p>Dealing with angry and abusive customers can be daunting. Equip yourself with the skills and strategies to deftly handle such situations, ensuring customer satisfaction while maintaining a professional demeanor. Learn to turn challenging interactions into opportunities for growth and improved service, setting your business apart in today''s competitive market.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 529 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1263 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Introducing our Basic Accounting using Xero course: a comprehensive guide designed to simplify your journey into the world of accounting. Begin by grasping the foundational concept of accounting and fluently interpret the three pivotal statements - balance sheets, income statements, and the cash flow statement. The curriculum is meticulously curated to ensure you''re not just theoretically sound but are also able to implement your knowledge efficiently.</p> <p>Dive deeper into the functionalities of Xero - from initial setup to managing invoices and expenses, this course covers it all. Equip yourself to handle everyday accounting affairs, including tax, budgeting, and user management, with utmost ease. Whether you''re an entrepreneur, an accounting aspirant, or simply someone looking to upskill, this course promises proficiency in accounting using the power of Xero. Join us and step confidently into the accounting domain.</p> <h2>Xero Certified Partner</h2> <p>We are Xero Certified Partner and Xero Certified Advisor</p> <p><img alt="Xero Partner" src="https://www.tertiarycourses.com.sg/media/wysiwyg/xero-partner.png" width="200"></p> <h2>PSG Grant for Xero</h2> <ul> <li>Xero has been pre-approved solution of the IMDA SMEs Go Digital program to boost the productivity of SMEs in Singapore with the Productivity Solutions Grant (PSG). Click <a href="https://www.xero.com/sg/partnerships/psg-vendors/" title="Xero PSG" target="_blank"><span style="text-decoration: underline;">here</span></a> for more details</li> </ul>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 538 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2098 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Step into the transformative realm of containerization with our Basic Docker Training. This meticulously designed course empowers attendees with the foundational skills to navigate Docker''s core functionalities. Initiate your learning curve by mastering the installation of Docker, ensuring a smooth, seamless experience for your future endeavors in the world of containers.</p> <p>Venture further to understand the intricacies of Docker Containers and Images. By the end of the program, you''ll be proficient in creating robust, efficient containers using Dockerfile, the blueprint for container creation. This training provides a hands-on approach, complete with real-world examples, ensuring that participants leave equipped with practical expertise to harness Docker''s potential in varied operational environments.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 540 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1316 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Step into the world of advanced cybersecurity with our in-depth course, meticulously designed for individuals looking to enhance their defensive toolkit. This program delves deep into sophisticated techniques and tools, including the prowess of Port Scanning using NMap, thereby equipping you with skills to detect and counteract potential cyber threats at their nascent stages.</p> <p>Further enhancing your cybersecurity arsenal, the course sheds light on both Symmetric and Asymmetric Cryptography, unraveling their intricacies and practical applications. Moreover, with hands-on training on Vulnerabilities Scanning using Nessus, you''ll be primed to identify and address digital weak spots efficiently. Our advanced cybersecurity course not only amplifies your skill set but also prepares you to be the linchpin in any organization''s defense against cyber threats.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 541 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1038 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Step into the world of cybersecurity with our SC-200 Microsoft Security Operations Analyst Exam Preparation course. This comprehensive training is designed to empower aspiring security analysts with the knowledge and skills needed to excel in Microsoft''s rigorous SC-200 exam. Participants will delve into key areas such as threat management, monitoring and response, and data governance, ensuring a deep understanding of Microsoft''s security operations framework. Our course equips you with practical insights and hands-on experience, setting a strong foundation for your career in cybersecurity.</p> <p>Beyond theoretical knowledge, our course emphasizes real-world applications and scenario-based learning. You''ll engage with the latest tools and practices in the field, honing your ability to identify, respond to, and mitigate cybersecurity threats effectively. This course not only prepares you for the SC-200 exam but also enhances your professional acumen, making you a valuable asset in the rapidly evolving domain of security operations. Join us to transform your passion for cybersecurity into a distinguished career, starting with acing the SC-200 Microsoft Security Operations Analyst Exam.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 542 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 3209 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Discover the realm of predictive analytics with our Predictive Analytics with Orange training at Tertiary Courses. Orange, renowned for its user-friendly interface and comprehensive modules, has emerged as a leading tool in the analytics community. This course ensures participants unravel the extensive capabilities of Orange, enabling them to anticipate trends, patterns, and behaviors from their data.</p> <p>Begin with a comprehensive overview of Orange and its landscape. Trainees will delve deep into classification, predictive modeling, and regression analysis techniques that power data-driven decisions. Progressing further, participants will explore advanced modules like clustering and image analytics, ultimately culminating in the powerful realm of dimension reduction. Join us and supercharge your predictive analytics skills, turning data insights into actionable strategies.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 545 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1467 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p><strong>Vibe Coding for Algorithmic Trading and Value Investment</strong> is a hands-on, project-based course designed to empower participants to build intelligent trading and investment systems using a modern rapid-development workflow known as Vibe Coding. In the first part of the course, learners will explore the foundations of algorithmic trading, including strategy design, backtesting techniques, and key performance metrics such as Sharpe ratio and drawdown analysis. Participants will apply Vibe Coding best practices to efficiently prototype, test, and refine trading algorithms, and ultimately deploy a cloud-based web application for strategy testing. By the end of this module, learners will have built their own cloud-hosted algorithmic trading strategy platform.</p> <p>The second part of the course focuses on value investing enhanced by automation and intelligent screening. Participants will learn core principles of value investment, perform company screening, detect financial anomalies, and generate structured summary reports using automated workflows. Leveraging Vibe Coding methodologies, learners will design and deploy a cloud-based value investment platform capable of analyzing financial data and supporting informed investment decisions. This course bridges finance and practical AI-driven development, enabling participants to turn investment ideas into fully functional, scalable applications.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 576 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1864 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Unlock the vast potential of text data with our specialized Text Mining with R course at Tertiary Courses. This training takes participants on a deep dive into the world of text analytics, beginning with the core concept of sentiment analysis, enabling them to interpret and gauge public sentiments effectively. With the utilization of visually appealing word clouds, and the understanding of Ngrams, learners will grasp how to detect and visualize frequent patterns in text data.</p> <p>As participants progress, they''ll be introduced to sophisticated techniques like Topics Modeling and Latent Dirichlet Allocation (LDA) that pave the way for intricate text data categorization and topic identification. What sets this course apart is its comprehensive approach towards harnessing social media data; teaching learners the art and science of extracting and analyzing text from platforms teeming with user insights. Whether you aim to analyze customer sentiments, or draw patterns from vast social media narratives, this course positions you at the forefront of text mining mastery.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 577 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1567 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Embark on a transformative learning journey with the Project 5 Days Power Platform Specialisation course offered by Tertiary Courses. This meticulously crafted program aims to equip learners with the robust skills required to excel in deploying business solutions using the Power Platform. Over the span of five days, attendees will delve into the core functionalities and applications of the Power Platform, gaining hands-on experience that''s pivotal for mastering project management tasks efficiently.</p> <p>The course is a gateway to a wealth of knowledge and practical expertise, ensuring participants are well-versed in utilizing the Power Platform to its fullest potential. The curriculum is designed to be engaging and insightful, fostering an environment conducive for mastering the concepts necessary for career advancement in the project management domain. Tertiary Courses prides itself on delivering a high caliber of professional training, aiding in the seamless transition of skills acquired to the professional realm.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 578 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1203 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The Automating DevOps and IT Workflows with Ansible course empowers IT and DevOps professionals to enhance productivity and system efficiency through automation. Participants will learn to automate repetitive tasks, streamline workflows, and manage infrastructure consistently using Ansible&rsquo;s powerful features. The course covers Ansible playbooks, inventory management, and advanced concepts like role-based automation, system provisioning, and configuration management, which form the backbone of Infrastructure as Code (IaC).</p> <p>Designed for scalability, this course offers in-depth insights into creating automated CI/CD pipelines, implementing continuous deployment, and managing complex IT workflows across multiple environments. By the end of the course, participants will be proficient in Ansible&rsquo;s automation techniques, enabling them to support robust, resilient, and efficient DevOps practices for any organization.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 580 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1113 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Dive into the world of advanced network engineering with our comprehensive course on ''CCNP Enterprise: Implementing Cisco Enterprise Advanced Routing and Services (300-410 ENARSI)''. This course is meticulously designed to equip you with in-depth knowledge and practical skills required to excel in the 300-410 ENARSI exam. You will explore key areas such as Layer 3 technologies, VPN services, infrastructure security, and services, ensuring a complete understanding of Cisco''s advanced routing and network troubleshooting.</p> <p>Our expert instructors, equipped with real-world experience, will guide you through the complexities of enterprise network solutions. The curriculum emphasizes hands-on training, preparing you for real-world challenges while aligning with Cisco''s exam objectives. Whether you''re aiming to advance your career in network engineering or seeking to validate your skills with the CCNP Enterprise certification, this course is your gateway to success in the dynamic field of advanced networking.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 584 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2142 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The SC-300 Microsoft Certified Identity and Access Administrator Associate Exam Preparation Course is meticulously designed to equip IT professionals with the expertise needed to manage, implement, and monitor identity and access environments using Microsoft Azure AD. Through this course, participants will gain in-depth knowledge on security, compliance, and identity management across cloud-based and related Microsoft services. Emphasizing hands-on experience, the course covers crucial topics such as Azure AD Connect, password management, Conditional Access policies, and the security of identities, ensuring candidates are well-prepared to tackle the SC-300 exam. Whether you''re looking to advance your career in cybersecurity or enhance your organization''s security posture, this course provides the foundational skills and knowledge required to excel as a Microsoft Certified Identity and Access Administrator.</p> <p>Leveraging real-world scenarios and expert-led training, students will navigate through configuring, managing, and troubleshooting identity synchronization and protection, while mastering how to implement and manage hybrid identities. By the end of this course, attendees will not only be primed to pass the SC-300 exam but will also possess the confidence to implement comprehensive identity and access management solutions in their organizations, contributing to improved IT security frameworks and compliance standards.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 591 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 3177 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>In today''s digital age, having a professional business website is more crucial than ever. With WordPress, setting up a robust and elegant business website becomes a seamless process. Our course provides an in-depth guide to utilizing the platform''s most powerful tools, ensuring your business shines online. Participants will dive into the new WordPress Block Editor, enhancing the flexibility and design of posts and pages, all while mastering the art of incorporating various media elements.</p> <p>As we delve further, attendees will uncover the secrets behind effective post editing, the transformative power of themes, and the functionalities that plugins can bring. With hands-on examples and real-world applications, by the end of this comprehensive training, participants will be well-equipped to not only set up but also optimize a business website that stands out in the digital landscape, using WordPress to its fullest potential.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 6 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1372 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The Basic Semiconductor Devices Course meticulously designed for professionals seeking an in-depth understanding of the cornerstone of electronics. This course not only covers the foundational aspects like the characteristics of PN Junction Diodes but also branches into the myriad applications of Light Emitting Diodes (LEDs), BJT, and MOSFET.</p> <p>Beyond just theoretical learning, participants will gain a keen insight into the practical side of semiconductor devices, emphasizing real-world applications. The course culminates in an exploration of device fabrication, ensuring a comprehensive grasp over the entire semiconductor device spectrum. Equip yourself with the expertise to navigate the intricate world of semiconductor devices with confidence and proficiency.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 605 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1417 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Unlock the world of digital art with our comprehensive ProCreate course. Whether you''re a beginner looking to explore or an advanced artist aiming to refine your skills, our expertly crafted modules will guide you every step of the way. Learn the ins and outs of ProCreate, from basic tools to advanced techniques, and discover how to bring your creative visions to life with unparalleled precision and flair.</p> <p>Embrace the digital age of artistry and empower your creativity. With hands-on projects, detailed tutorials, and insightful feedback, our ProCreate course ensures a holistic learning experience. Join us and embark on a transformative journey, redefining the boundaries of art and creativity.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 610 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1262 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>It only takes one misconfigured device or missing patch for hackers to infiltrate your network. Fix the flaws in your systems before attackers can find them with Nessus, the network vulnerability scanner popular among cybersecurity analysts, sys admins, and network engineers. Using Nessus, you can scan servers, endpoints, and other network devices and check them against a database of thousands of known vulnerabilities</p> <p>This course will teach you how to setup&nbsp;Nessus for vulnerabilities management.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 614 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 682 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>With basic knowledge of Google Data Studio, you can turn any information into sleek data visualizations full of meaningful insights. But Data Studio offers a special bonus for marketers: easy access to data sets from the entire Google Marketing Platform and social media sites such as Facebook and Twitter.</p> <p>In this course, you will learn how to create your own engaging and interactive dashboards to track marketing campaigns with Google Data Studio.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 622 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 627 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Unlock the potential of Reinforcement Learning (RL) with our meticulously crafted course at Tertiary Courses. Gain a foundational grasp of the intricate concepts of Markov Decision Process (MDP) and Reinforcement Learning (RL), ensuring a robust grounding in this cutting-edge AI technology. Our course also offers hands-on experience, allowing participants to learn and apply RL using the renowned OpenAI Gym and Stable Baselines.</p> <p>Venture deeper into the realms of Q-Learning, DQN, and Policy Gradient, with our interactive coding sessions, ensuring not just theoretical knowledge but practical expertise. By the end of the course, participants will be adept in crafting sophisticated RL solutions using Python, setting them on the path to AI excellence. Embrace the future of AI with our comprehensive Reinforcement Learning training.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 625 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1338 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The MS-4002: Prepare Security and Compliance to Support Microsoft 365 Copilot course equips IT professionals with the essential skills to secure and manage Microsoft 365 Copilot effectively. This course covers key security configurations, data protection strategies, identity and access management, and Microsoft 365 compliance tools. Participants will gain hands-on experience in implementing SharePoint Advanced Management, configuring Microsoft Purview Data Loss Prevention policies, and enforcing sensitivity labels to safeguard enterprise data. Additionally, learners will explore authentication methods, including multifactor and passwordless authentication, to enhance security while ensuring seamless access for users.</p> <p>Through practical exercises and real-world scenarios, this course also delves into Microsoft 365 role-based administration, app deployment strategies, and Copilot extensibility management. IT administrators and security professionals will learn best practices for assigning admin roles, managing permissions, and integrating Microsoft Graph connectors. By the end of the course, participants will be equipped with the knowledge to drive Microsoft 365 Copilot adoption securely while mitigating potential security risks and ensuring compliance across their organization</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 627 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1859 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>In a world where data breaches and cyber threats are increasingly prevalent, building a solid foundation in IT security has never been more critical. Our CompTIA Security+ Exam Prep Training course is designed to equip you with the knowledge and tools necessary to excel in today''s digital landscape. From understanding the principles of network security to mastering risk management, our course curriculum covers a broad spectrum of topics to help you emerge as a skilled professional in the field. Moreover, it brings you one step closer to being a certified expert, boosting your credentials and opening doors to numerous opportunities in the IT sector.</p> <p>Whether you are kickstarting your career or seeking to upgrade your existing skills, this course offers a comprehensive approach to learning. It encompasses an array of modules that delve into the intricacies of IT security, offering a hands-on experience to reinforce your learning. The content is structured in a manner that fosters an easy understanding, ensuring that you are well-prepared to tackle the Security+ exam. Furthermore, our training emphasizes real-world scenarios and current security challenges, enabling you to apply your knowledge effectively in practical situations. Enroll today and set the stage for a rewarding career in IT security.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 628 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1885 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Embark on a transformative journey into the heart of enterprise networking with our Enterprise Local Area Network (LAN) Essentials Training. This course is meticulously designed to provide you with an immersive understanding of advanced LAN functionalities, from the foundational VLAN concepts to intricate Layer 3 switching strategies.</p> <p>Through hands-on modules, delve into advanced VLAN techniques, the mechanics of spanning trees, and the resilience offered by HSRP and VRRP. Gain proficiency in deploying real-life LAN solutions effectively and efficiently. By the end of this course, you''ll possess the skills and expertise to navigate and implement robust enterprise LAN environments confidently.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 629 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 899 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Dive into the world of advanced networking with Building a Scalable Virtual Private Network (VPN) course. This meticulously curated course walks you through the intricacies of various VPN technologies, including IPSEC, GRE, DMVPN, and more. Grasp the art of building robust and scalable VPNs, understanding the synergy between IPSEC and GRE, and tapping into the capabilities of DMVPN and SSL VPN.</p> <p>Whether you''re looking to fortify your organization''s data transfer or seeking to upgrade your networking skills, this course is the perfect fit. Our hands-on modules, led by industry experts, ensure a comprehensive learning experience, arming you with the knowledge to design, implement, and manage scalable VPN infrastructures seamlessly. Join us and be at the forefront of network technology advancements.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 630 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 984 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Dive into the world of Neo4j and get a comprehensive understanding of its fundamentals. From basic graph theory and graph structures to Cypher fundamentals, our course covers every essential aspect. Learn how Neo4j implements index-free-adjacency and understand the intricacies of reading and writing data to Neo4j. Embrace the power of graph data modeling, understanding nodes, relationships, and the significance of graph data models.</p> <p>Expand your knowledge with intermediate topics like Neo4j Database Administration and data importing techniques. Grasp the nuances of Neo4j Graph Data Science, discover the synergy between Neo4j and Python, and prepare effectively for the Neo4j Certified Professional Exam. Enrich your skillset and become a proficient user of Neo4j with Tertiary Courses.</p> <h2>Certification Exam</h2> <p>Once you are prepared for the exam, you can register for the certification&nbsp;<span style="text-decoration: underline;"><a href="https://graphacademy.neo4j.com/courses/neo4j-certification/" title="Neo4j Certification" target="_blank">here</a></span>.&nbsp;We are Authorised Pearson Vue Testing Center. You can take the certification exam at our test center. Note that the course fee does not include the certification exam fee.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 631 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1791 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>This AWS Certified Advanced Networking Specialty (ANS-C01) Exam Prep course is tailored for professionals looking to enhance their skills in designing and managing advanced cloud networking architectures on AWS. The course covers key areas such as hybrid IT connectivity, network security, high availability, automation, and network troubleshooting. You will gain hands-on experience with AWS services like VPC, Direct Connect, Route 53, and Transit Gateway to master network solutions that are scalable, secure, and reliable.</p> <p>Through practical labs and real-world scenarios, this course prepares you to confidently tackle the AWS Certified Advanced Networking Specialty (ANS-C01) exam. Ideal for network engineers, solutions architects, and IT professionals, this training provides the expertise needed to manage complex AWS networking environments and advance your career in cloud networking.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 635 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1952 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>This course provides a deep dive into building and managing model-driven apps using Microsoft Power Apps and Dataverse. Participants will learn how to create structured data models, define relationships, and implement security using Dataverse. The course covers designing model-driven apps, configuring forms, views, and dashboards, and incorporating business process automation for enhanced functionality. Learners will also explore integrating Power Apps with Microsoft 365, SharePoint, and Power Automate to build scalable enterprise solutions.</p> <p>Through hands-on exercises, participants will develop skills in managing solutions, deploying applications, and automating workflows using Power Automate. By the end of the course, learners will be equipped to create, modify, and manage model-driven apps that improve business operations and decision-making. This course is ideal for IT professionals, business analysts, and developers looking to leverage Power Apps and Dataverse for digital transformation.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 636 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2712 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Immerse yourself in the intricate world of Failure Mode and Effects Analysis (FMEA) and be at the forefront of efficient risk management and process optimization. This training session delves into the depths of Process FMEA, unveiling the core elements that are pivotal in recognizing potential failures and their effects on operations. As participants navigate through the curriculum, they gain an unparalleled understanding of these elements and the methodologies to employ them effectively in real-world scenarios.</p> <p>Furthermore, the course places a significant emphasis on the Fishbone diagram analysis, a renowned tool employed for identifying root causes of specific issues. Through expert-led sessions and hands-on exercises, participants will refine their analytical skills, ensuring they can expertly leverage this tool to dissect complex problems and devise strategic solutions. With Tertiary Courses, attendees will walk away with a solid foundation in FMEA principles, ready to drive enhanced efficiency and effectiveness in their professional endeavors.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 638 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1584 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Discover the transformative realm of Ethereum Blockchain with our specialized course tailored for forward-thinking enthusiasts. Participants will be introduced to the core principles underpinning the Ethereum Blockchain, elucidating its groundbreaking capabilities and functionalities. With a robust understanding of these foundational concepts, attendees are well-positioned to appreciate the broader implications and potential applications of Ethereum in modern digital landscapes.</p> <p>Further enhancing this comprehensive learning journey, participants will acquire hands-on experience in coding smart contracts using the Solidity programming language. Through methodical instruction and real-world coding exercises, attendees will master the art of creating, deploying, and managing smart contracts on the Ethereum platform. With Tertiary Courses, elevate your blockchain proficiency and emerge as a sought-after Ethereum Blockchain specialist.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 639 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2007 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Embark on a journey into the world of graph data science with our cutting-edge course on Neo4j Graph Data Science and LLM. This course is designed for professionals and enthusiasts eager to master the intricacies of graph databases and leverage the power of Large Language Models (LLM) in data science. Through a carefully structured curriculum, participants will explore the fundamentals of Neo4j, the leading graph database technology, and its application in modeling, analyzing, and visualizing complex relationships in vast datasets. You''ll learn how to harness the capabilities of Neo4j to uncover deep insights and patterns that traditional data analysis methods might miss.</p> <p>Building on this foundation, the course further delves into the integration of Neo4j with advanced LLM techniques, opening new avenues for natural language processing, recommendation systems, and artificial intelligence applications. Participants will gain hands-on experience working on real-world projects, where they will apply graph data science principles to solve practical problems and enhance AI models with the nuanced understanding that graph databases provide. Whether you''re looking to boost your data science career or implement cutting-edge technologies in your projects, this course will equip you with the skills and knowledge to succeed in the fast-evolving landscape of graph data science and LLM.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 640 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1978 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Embark on an enlightening journey into the rapidly evolving landscape of Software Defined Networking (SDN) with our specialized training. Begin with a robust foundation by diving deep into Linux Docker, gaining a comprehensive understanding of its integration with modern networking. Familiarize yourself with the intricacies of OpenFlow vSwitch and Open Flow Controllers, ensuring a holistic grasp of their role and potential in SDN environments.</p> <p>Progressing further, the course offers an invaluable hands-on experience with Python scripting tailored for network automation. By weaving theory with practical exercises, we ensure you are equipped to design, implement, and manage SDNs with confidence and expertise. This course isn''t just an educational experience; it''s a launchpad for the network professionals of tomorrow.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 660 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1018 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Master the art of building reliable, production-ready LLM applications with Pydantic for structured data validation. This hands-on course teaches you how to move beyond free-form AI text outputs and implement robust validation schemas that ensure every response from large language models is accurate, complete, and ready for downstream processing. Learn to design structured output schemas, parse and validate JSON responses from LLMs, and handle validation errors gracefully — skills essential for anyone building AI-powered systems that need to perform consistently at scale.</p> <p>Dive deep into advanced validation patterns including nested models, enums, unions, and custom validators that give you fine-grained control over LLM outputs. Explore real-world applications such as building a customer support assistant that extracts ticket details, validates customer data, and routes requests using structured output. You will also learn to integrate Pydantic with modern LLM APIs, agent frameworks, function calling, tool calling, and backend services like FastAPI — equipping you with the expertise to design multi-step LLM pipelines where every stage is structured, validated, and production-ready.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 662 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1721 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Unlock the true potential of Google Workspace (formerly known as G Suite) with our Advanced Google Workspace Training. Hosted on the innovative Google Cloud, Workspace encompasses a broad spectrum of intelligent apps such as Sheets, Docs, Slides, Form, Gmail, Calendar, Drive, Hangout, and Meet. These tools not only allow you to create documents, spreadsheets, and presentations from any location but also offer seamless collaboration features. Share and simultaneously work on files with teammates, ensuring synchronization and efficiency.</p> <p>Following the foundational G Suite Essential Training, this advanced course dives deeper into the core features of select Google Workspace apps, particularly Gmail, Google Calendar, Meet, Sites, and Admin. By the end of this training, participants will have gained comprehensive knowledge, empowering them to work smarter and foster a culture of collaboration and productivity in their respective roles.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 663 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1506 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Elevate your credentials with our MB-910 Microsoft Dynamics 365 Fundamentals (CRM) Exam Prep course. This course is finely tailored to provide a detailed understanding of the core concepts and functionalities of Microsoft Dynamics 365 CRM. Through this course, learners will delve into the essential features and applications of Dynamics 365 CRM that make it a robust platform for customer engagement. The curriculum is carefully structured to cover all the key areas required for the MB-910 exam, ensuring a well-rounded preparation. As learners progress, they will explore the various tools and features that enable effective customer relationship management, while also gaining insights into the best practices that drive customer satisfaction and business success.</p> <p>Transitioning from foundational to advanced concepts, this course offers a thorough understanding of how to leverage Microsoft Dynamics 365 CRM to optimize customer interactions and operational efficiency. Learners will also explore real-world scenarios and case studies, enhancing their ability to apply the learned concepts in practical situations. The course also provides a plethora of resources and practice exercises to reinforce learning and prepare learners for the examination thoroughly. By the end of this course, learners will be well-prepared to take on the MB-910 exam, and with the acquired knowledge and skills, they can significantly contribute to their organization''s CRM initiatives, thus advancing their careers in the dynamic field of customer relationship management.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 665 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 3320 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Embrace the next level of containerization with our Advanced Docker Training. This expertly crafted course will immerse you in the world of multi-container setups, ensuring your applications run seamlessly and efficiently. Dive deep into the intricacies of Docker Container Networking, which empowers you to connect multiple containers, optimize communication, and bolster the security of your containerized applications.</p> <p>But that''s just the beginning. Our training culminates in the mastery of Docker Swarm, Docker''s native clustering tool that enables the creation and management of a swarm of Docker nodes. With its inbuilt load balancing, decentralized design, and secured secret management, Docker Swarm is indispensable for anyone serious about Docker. By the end of this training, you''ll have a comprehensive understanding of these advanced Docker techniques, positioning you as a sought-after professional in the realm of container orchestration.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 685 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1509 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Dive into the dynamic world of email marketing with our course, "Create Email Marketing Campaigns that Turn Leads into Customers." This course is specifically designed to equip you with the essential skills to execute and test email marketing campaigns that are in line with your company''s operational plans. You will gain practical knowledge in crafting engaging and effective email content, ensuring that your campaigns not only reach your target audience but also resonate with them. The course emphasizes the importance of aligning your email marketing strategies with broader business objectives, ensuring a cohesive and comprehensive approach to digital marketing.</p> <p>In this course, you will also delve into the analytical side of email marketing. Learn to dissect and analyze campaign performance data to identify areas for improvement. This analysis is crucial for refining your strategies and increasing the effectiveness of future campaigns. Additionally, you will acquire skills in monitoring various email campaign platforms, assessing the execution of your campaigns, and gathering diverse feedback. This holistic approach to learning ensures that you are not only capable of creating compelling email campaigns but also proficient in evaluating their performance and making data-driven decisions. By the end of the course, you will have a thorough understanding of how to turn leads into loyal customers through targeted, well-executed email marketing campaigns.</p> <ul> <li>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 686 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1671 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Boost your typing proficiency with our Advanced ISO Keyboard Speed Typing Course, designed to transform your keyboard efficiency and enhance your productivity. This comprehensive course offers in-depth training on ISO keyboard layouts, advanced typing techniques, and accuracy improvement strategies. Tailored for professionals seeking to maximize their typing speed and efficiency, the course integrates practical exercises, interactive lessons, and expert guidance to ensure measurable improvements in your typing skills.</p> <p>Unveiling our comprehensive Full ISO Keyboard Speed Typing Course, structured with a blend of meticulous visual training and a step-by-step approach. The course is tailored to navigate learners through the art of efficient and accurate typing, ensuring that every keystroke counts.&nbsp;Infuse fun with learning through our assortment of typing games that not only foster skill enhancement but also provide a stimulating learning environment. Each module culminates with typing skill tests, providing participants with actionable feedback, ensuring continuous improvement and mastery in keyboard speed typing.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 687 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1310 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Generative AI for Design Thinking equips participants with the skills to combine human-centred innovation methods with generative AI to solve business challenges more creatively and efficiently. Learners explore how AI tools support every stage of the Design Thinking process, from empathising with users through to prototyping and evaluation.</p> <p>Through practical exercises, participants use AI to analyse user feedback, develop personas, build empathy maps and identify pain points. They apply prompting techniques for ideation, explore AI-assisted rapid prototyping, and learn to gather feedback and refine solutions iteratively while implementing AI responsibly.</p> <p>By the end of the course, participants will be able to embed generative AI into each phase of the design process and use practical metrics to measure whether their design ideas deliver the intended outcomes.</p> <p>Certificate</p> <p>All participants will receive a Certificate of Completion from Tertiary Courses after achieving at least 75% attendance.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 688 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1370 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>This course introduces participants to the practical development and deployment of a digital AI agent workforce using the OpenClaw platform. Participants will learn how to install, configure, and operate OpenClaw to build autonomous agents that can perform tasks, automate workflows, and support digital operations across organizations.</p> <p>The course begins with the setup and configuration of the OpenClaw platform, including the installation of required components, integration of language models, and deployment of a working AI agent environment. Participants will gain a clear understanding of the OpenClaw architecture and how agents operate within the system.</p> <p>Participants will then learn how to design and develop OpenClaw agent skills, create task workflows, and build specialized sub-agents that collaborate to perform complex tasks. The course also covers memory management techniques to improve agent performance and ensure efficient task execution.</p> <p>Finally, participants will explore how to optimize and secure an OpenClaw digital workforce, including implementing security best practices, managing agent permissions, improving context and memory efficiency, and applying token cost optimization strategies to ensure scalable and sustainable AI agent deployment.</p> <p>By the end of the course, participants will be able to deploy, manage, and optimize OpenClaw agents and sub-agents to support real-world automation and digital workforce transformation initiatives</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 691 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2046 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Learning to type correctly early in life is essential. Using our interactive and adaptive response technology, you will be able to check and track your progress which will be recorded. We can help you to enhance your accuracy and improve your speed to work better at the office, school and home. Through class activities and practices, our professional speed typing trainer will be able to boost your abilities in just two evening classes. The class provides basic training under the correct supervision of ISO Keyboarding Skills to guide you step by step to get started on speed typing and improve significantly. This course will adapt to your individual needs and train you to be a professional typist in no time!</p> <p>Advance your typing skills with our Intermediate ISO Keyboard Speed Typing Course, designed to elevate your proficiency and boost your productivity. This course provides thorough training on ISO keyboard layouts, effective typing techniques, and accuracy improvement methods. Perfect for individuals aiming to enhance their typing speed and efficiency, the program includes practical exercises, interactive sessions, and expert guidance to ensure significant progress in your typing capabilities.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 692 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1389 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Venture into the transformative world of additive manufacturing and understand its profound impact on modern businesses. Our course introduces learners to the intricacies of 3D printing, covering both the hardware and software aspects that are pivotal for successful implementation. With hands-on sessions and expert guidance, participants will gain a robust grasp of the technology, ensuring they are equipped to harness its capabilities for their businesses.</p> <p>The learning journey further delves into the nuances of post 3D printing refinement, emphasizing the importance of quality and precision in the final product. This comprehensive understanding ensures that the output not only meets but exceeds industry standards. With Tertiary Courses, attendees are not just learning the technicalities; they''re being equipped to pioneer innovation and set new benchmarks in their respective business domains.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 694 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1435 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Blockchain is essentially a decentralised and distributed database peer-to-peer technology (Web3) that was popularised by the Bitcoin global cryptocurrency platform since 2009. There has been a lot of hype around Blockchain and Web3 technology in recent times. Almost all Fin-Tech heavy weights are pouring investments into various Blockchain projects such as DeFi, GameFi, Metaverse, NFT etc .Governments and regulators are also equally interested in this disruptive technology.</p> <p>The potential applications for Blockchains and Bitcoin-like cryptocurrencies are enormous.&nbsp;This course will teach you the fundamentals on Crypto,, NFT, Metaverse, DeFi, GameFi. It also covers the Crypto Security and how you can protect your Crypto from hacking and fraud.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 696 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 930 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The Apply Scrum Methodology in Agile Environment course is designed to help professionals effectively implement Scrum principles in Agile projects. Participants will explore the fundamentals of Scrum, including Agile foundations, Scrum frameworks, and key roles such as the Scrum Master, Product Owner, and Development Team. The course emphasizes establishing team norms, managing shared resources, and creating collaborative team spaces to ensure smooth project execution.</p> <p>The course also dives deep into Agile and Scrum project management, covering Scrum events such as sprint planning, daily scrums, backlog refinement, sprint reviews, and retrospectives. Learners will gain expertise in tracking and reporting progress using burn-down and burn-up charts. Additionally, participants will explore Scrum artifacts like product backlogs, backlog ordering, product increments, and the definition of done, ensuring they can deliver high-quality outcomes in Agile environments.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 698 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1409 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Step into the next level of accounting proficiency with our Advanced QuickBooks Online Plus Training. Designed for those aiming for mastery, this course delves deep into the complexities of budgeting, streamlining payroll processes, and managing projects seamlessly within QuickBooks. Get insights into bank reconciliation and learn the intricacies of handling fixed assets and their depreciation.</p> <p>The course doesn&rsquo;t just stop at traditional features. Embrace the modern era of accounting by exploring the full potential of QuickBooks Mobile Apps, ensuring you can manage your finances on-the-go. Whether you''re an experienced accountant or an entrepreneur seeking to expand your financial expertise, this training promises a thorough understanding and hands-on practice. Join Tertiary Courses to unlock superior accounting capabilities.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 699 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1004 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Embark on a transformative journey with our Robotic Process Automation course, centered around the power and flexibility of UIPath. This course lays the foundation by offering hands-on experience in UIPath operations, ensuring you grasp the core concepts and techniques integral to automating business processes.</p> <p>Dive deeper into the world of automation by mastering control flow scripting, an essential component to enhance the efficiency and accuracy of robotic tasks. With a balanced mix of theoretical knowledge and practical application, this course aims to equip learners with the skills necessary to navigate the rapidly evolving landscape of Robotic Process Automation.</p> </div>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 700 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1138 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The AB-731 Microsoft Certified AI Transformation Leader course equips business leaders and decision-makers with the knowledge and skills required to recognize AI opportunities, plan AI adoption, and drive innovation with Microsoft 365 Copilot and Microsoft Foundry Tools &mdash; no coding required. Participants will explore the business value of generative AI, prompt engineering, grounding and retrieval-augmented generation, and how to align AI investments with business goals.</p> <p>Learners will gain expertise in mapping business processes to Microsoft 365 Copilot, Copilot Studio, Microsoft Graph and Foundry Tools, championing responsible AI, and building an organization-wide adoption strategy with governance, an AI council and a champions program. Additionally, the course covers Copilot licensing and Foundry subscription models, AI security and cost considerations. By completing this course, participants will be prepared to lead AI transformation and adoption across their teams and organization.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 711 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1354 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Unlock the potential of AI in scriptwriting with our Mastering Screen Writing with Generative AI course. This course offers an in-depth exploration into the foundations of AI-enhanced scriptwriting, including analyzing briefs for script development, utilizing AI tools for research and conceptualization, and tailoring scripts for different platforms. Gain insights into effective audience engagement strategies to create compelling scripts.</p> <p>Delve into the art of storytelling and character development with advanced AI techniques. Learn to craft narratives, develop complex character psychology, and create engaging plots, structures, and themes. Master episodic plot development, dialogue writing, and screenplay enhancement using AI. Understand professional script formatting, terminology, and advanced features of scriptwriting tools to meet industry standards and integrate seamlessly with AI tools</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 714 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1080 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>This course offers a deep dive into the essential principles of CMOS process integration, focusing on semiconductor manufacturing technologies. Participants will explore the detailed processes involved in wafer fabrication, photolithography, and etching, gaining valuable insights into the technical and practical aspects of modern semiconductor production.</p> <p>Ideal for engineers, technicians, and professionals in the semiconductor industry, this course equips learners with the knowledge needed to understand and manage CMOS processes effectively. With a focus on hands-on learning, you will enhance your expertise in key areas such as semiconductor material properties, process flow, and defect reduction strategies.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 716 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 895 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The CompTIA Certified SecurityX Training equips professionals with essential cybersecurity skills to manage risks, implement governance frameworks, and ensure compliance with legal regulations. Participants will gain hands-on knowledge in risk management strategies, security architecture, and cloud infrastructure, including zero-trust implementation and identity access management (IAM). The course also covers software security, operational resilience, and troubleshooting authentication frameworks.</p> <p>This training also focuses on security engineering and operations, where learners will enhance endpoint security, configure network infrastructure, and apply cryptographic concepts. Participants will explore advanced security automation techniques, threat modeling, and real-world incident response strategies. The course provides in-depth insights into threat hunting tools, attack mitigation, and security monitoring, preparing professionals for critical roles in cybersecurity defense.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 718 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1524 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Unlock the full potential of Revit for Structural Design with our WSQ Professional Certification Prep (ACP). This course equips participants with the prowess to execute precise engineering calculations, craft conceptual designs and BoD in Revit, and develop intricate design specifications tailored to project needs. Additionally, you will gain proficiency in devising plans, schematics, and layouts, ensuring your designs adhere to the highest standards.</p> <p>As a participant, you will further hone your skills by supervising the creation of expansive technical drawings using both 2D and 3D methods in Revit. Ensuring accuracy in the BIM model and reviewing mechanical design drawings for compliance becomes second nature. With a keen focus on maintaining mechanical design drawing adherence to critical regulations, you''ll also explore efficient equipment drawing techniques, balancing complexity, cost, and time for optimum results.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 722 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2287 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The rapid growth of the Internet of Things (IoT) has revolutionized industries, enabling the creation of smart, connected solutions. This course provides a hands-on introduction to IoT development, microcontroller coding, and embedded systems. Learn to work with platforms like Arduino and Raspberry Pi to develop intelligent applications that automate tasks and enhance efficiency.</p> <p>Designed for tech enthusiasts, engineers, and innovators, this course covers IoT communication protocols, sensor integration, and real-world use cases. Gain practical skills in programming microcontrollers, setting up IoT networks, and deploying smart solutions for industries like healthcare, manufacturing, and smart cities. Take your IoT expertise to the next level and build the future of connected technology.</p> <p><span style="color: #ff0000;"><strong>Note that the IoT kit is used for the training. The course fee does not include the kit.</strong></span></p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 726 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1477 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Take a deep dive into the critical world of Practical Costing Essentials tailored for non-finance professionals. This comprehensive course ensures participants become adept at identifying cost behaviour patterns, discerning the intricate relationship between fixed and variable costs, and separating mixed costs effectively. They''ll also gain insights into estimating the influence of varying costs, processes, and volumes on profit margins and calculating pivotal metrics like the break-even point.</p> <p>Additionally, attendees will learn the nuanced distinctions between discretionary and committed fixed costs. The course culminates in a thorough exploration of the budgeting process, evaluating its nature, characteristics, strengths, and weaknesses. By leveraging capital budgeting evaluation models, participants will be poised to craft astute expenditure budgets. With Tertiary Courses, you''re not just learning; you''re preparing to make informed financial decisions in the corporate world.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 730 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1169 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Delve into the comprehensive realm of Effective Financial Budget and Control with this meticulously designed course. Begin with a foundational grasp of budget processes, and the art of budget preparation. Equip yourself with the knowledge of basic financial terminology and the skills to source vital information for successful budget drafting. Furthermore, gain the confidence to prepare and obtain approval for your financial plans with ease.</p> <p>Our course doesn''t stop there. Elevate your proficiency with modules that introduce basic ratio analysis, empowering you to make enhanced financial decisions. As a crowning takeaway, each participant will obtain a practical budget template complemented by essential excel modelling tools. With Tertiary Courses, you&rsquo;re not just being taught; you&rsquo;re being prepared to take the reins of your organization''s financial future with certainty and skill.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 731 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1437 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Step into the realm of cutting-edge Business Intelligence with our QlikView Business Intelligence Training course. QlikView, a leading BI tool, empowers businesses to transform raw data into actionable insights, and this training offers a holistic approach to mastering its vast capabilities.</p> <p>Starting with the essentials of creating dynamic data visualizations, you''ll progress to loading data effectively and building captivating interactive dashboards that offer real-time insights. Dive deeper into the heart of QlikView with intricate scripting, data modeling techniques, and learn to craft precise expressions to meet business requirements. Further enhance your BI skills with set analysis, ensuring data interpretation is both thorough and precise. Concluding with an understanding of QlikView''s robust security protocols, you''ll leave with the confidence and knowledge to utilize QlikView in driving data-led business decisions.</p> </div>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 738 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1056 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Dive deep into the world of cloud architecture with our Google Professional Cloud Architect Certification Exam Prep course. This meticulously crafted course is designed to provide you with the essential knowledge and skills required to excel in the Google Professional Cloud Architect Certification Exam. Our expert instructors will guide you through the complexities of the Google Cloud Platform, ensuring you are well-prepared to tackle the challenges of the exam and achieve certification success.</p> <p>Our course covers a comprehensive range of topics, providing you with a thorough understanding of cloud architecture and the Google Cloud Platform. You will gain practical insights and hands-on experience, enhancing your cloud skills and opening up new career opportunities. Enroll now and take the first step towards becoming a certified Google Professional Cloud Architect and elevating your career to new heights</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 740 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1578 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>This Five-Day Semiconductor Specialization Bootcamp is designed for professionals eager to deepen their understanding of CMOS process modules, semiconductor device physics, and advanced IC packaging technologies. Participants will learn about key semiconductor processes such as photolithography, ion implantation, and chemical mechanical polishing (CMP), along with a comprehensive overview of CMOS process flows and performance optimization techniques.</p> <p>The course also delves into the physics behind semiconductor devices like PN junctions, MOS capacitors, and MOSFETs, as well as cutting-edge trends like Chiplet technology, FINFET, GAAFET, and 3D packaging solutions. Ideal for engineers and industry professionals, this bootcamp will equip you with the skills to thrive in the evolving semiconductor landscape.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 746 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 992 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Stay ahead in the quality management domain with our comprehensive ISO 9001:2015 Quality Management System Internal Auditor Course. Delve into the restructured format of ISO 9001 and its implications on the Quality Management Systems being assessed. With our expert guidance, participants will gain profound insights into the revised standard, empowering them to make well-informed decisions when adapting their current Quality Management Systems. The course underscores the practicalities of implementing these revised standards, ensuring you&rsquo;re equipped with knowledge that is both relevant and actionable.</p> <p>In addition to the theoretical framework, our course offers hands-on training on the dynamics of internal auditing. You&rsquo;ll be introduced to the mechanisms that drive effective internal audits, helping to ensure compliance and enhance quality standards within your organization. By the end of the course, participants will have a holistic understanding of ISO 9001:2015, coupled with the practical skills to execute audits and revisions with confidence and proficiency.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 748 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1658 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Learn the essential principles and practices of occupational health and safety with our ISO 45001:2018 Occupational Health &amp; Safety Management System course. This course provides a comprehensive understanding of the international standard for occupational health and safety management systems, equipping you with the necessary knowledge and skills to improve employee safety, reduce workplace risks, and create better, safer working conditions.</p> <p>Our expert instructors will guide you through the requirements of the standard, how to implement an occupational health and safety management system, and how to conduct internal audits to ensure compliance. You will gain practical insights and valuable tips to help you achieve ISO 45001:2018 certification and elevate your organization''s commitment to workplace safety and employee wellbeing. Don''t miss out on this opportunity to enhance your career and make a positive impact on your organization. Sign up for our course today!</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 749 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1156 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>ISO 27001 is one of the world''s most popular standards and this ISO certification is very sought after, as it demonstrates a company can be trusted with information because it has sufficient controls in place to protect it.</p> <p>Google, Apple, Adobe, Oracle and many other tech giants, financial institutions, health services providers, insurance companies, education institutions, manufacturing and service companies, large and small business around the world have decided to implement this standard and to get this certification as a proof of their capability to protect the confidentiality, integrity and availability of the information they process.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 750 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 827 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Dive into the world of energy efficiency with our comprehensive ISO 50001:2018 Energy Management System course. This program is designed to equip participants with the knowledge and skills necessary to develop and implement an effective energy management system in their organizations. Learn how to analyze energy consumption patterns, identify areas for improvement, and apply best practices in energy efficiency. Our expert-led course is perfect for professionals committed to reducing environmental impact and enhancing operational efficiency.</p> <p>The course takes a hands-on approach, providing practical tools and techniques to achieve ISO 50001:2018 certification. Participants will gain insights into crafting robust energy policies, setting achievable energy targets, and monitoring performance to ensure continuous improvement. Whether you''re looking to comply with regulatory requirements, cut energy costs, or drive sustainable business practices, this course offers the blueprint for success in energy management. Enroll now and be a part of the green revolution in business operations.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 751 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1271 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>ESG is the No. 1 topic investors want to discuss with boards of directors. As of 2020, almost 90% of publicly traded companies and 67% of privately-owned companies had embarked on ESG initiatives.. Additionally, 88% of institutional investors believe that companies that prioritize ESG initiatives represent better opportunities for long-term returns than companies that do not.</p> <p>Investors, consumers, and employees are demanding that companies make positive ESG (environmental, social, and governance) impacts and the game has changed. Positively contributing to society and the environment is now a "must have." ESG frameworks have brought transparency, objectivity, and accountability to companies'' environmental, social, and governance impacts.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 752 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1313 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>This comprehensive course is designed to equip individuals and business professionals with essential knowledge and practical skills in understanding and applying Singapore&rsquo;s tax regulations. Participants will gain a strong foundation in both personal and corporate tax systems, identify taxable income, apply relevant tax rates, and maximise exemptions, deductions, and rebates. The course also covers critical IRAS guidelines and statutory regulations that govern the Singapore tax landscape.</p> <p>Learners will be guided through hands-on exercises using accounting software to compute accurate Income Tax and GST. The curriculum also includes integrating tax changes announced in the Budget, ensuring up-to-date compliance with statutory filing requirements such as Form C-S, Form B, and GST F5. This course is ideal for finance professionals, business owners, and administrative staff seeking to improve tax efficiency and ensure regulatory compliance.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 754 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1754 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Embark on an enriching learning pathway with our AZ-104 Azure Administrator Associate Exam Prep course. This carefully designed module is your stepping stone to a fruitful career in cloud computing. By partaking in this course, you will acquire the expertise to manage and operate Microsoft Azure environments efficiently. The curriculum, crafted by industry stalwarts, encompasses core aspects such as Azure identities, governance, and virtual networking, paving the way for a holistic understanding and skill set that is aligned with the industry''s requirements.</p> <p>Beyond just theory, this course accentuates on providing hands-on experience, enabling you to apply the principles learned in real-world scenarios. You will gain an adept understanding of various Azure services, resource management, and security protocols. The course is tailored to nurture professionals who are proficient in implementing, managing, and monitoring Azure solutions. As you navigate through the learning modules, you''ll develop the competencies required to excel in the AZ-104 certification exam, opening doors to lucrative opportunities in the thriving cloud computing domain.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 756 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2889 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Gain the skills to design, build, and deploy sophisticated multi-agent AI systems using the OpenAI Agent Development Kit. This hands-on course takes you from foundational AI agent concepts through advanced orchestration techniques, equipping you with the expertise to create intelligent agents that collaborate, reason, and solve complex tasks autonomously. You will learn to build RAG agents powered by word embeddings and vector databases, orchestrate multiple agents using sequential and parallel workflows, and implement handoff and routing strategies for seamless agent collaboration.</p> <p>Take your AI capabilities further by mastering the Model Context Protocol (MCP) for creating custom tools and leveraging agents as tools within larger systems. The course culminates with practical training on fine-tuning large language models, giving you the ability to customize AI behaviour for domain-specific applications. Whether you are an AI developer, solutions architect, or technology leader, this course delivers the practical knowledge you need to harness the full potential of multi-agent AI systems and drive innovation within your organisation.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 765 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1737 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Prove to potential employers that you&rsquo;re up to the task by becoming an Autodesk Certified Professional. This course prepares you by offering an overview of skills that match what is covered in the Autodesk Certified Professional: AutoCAD for Design and Drafting exam. The lessons are structured to match the exam&rsquo;s objective domains and follow the typical workflow and features of the AutoCAD software, including sections on drawing and organizing objects, drawing with accuracy, advanced editing functions, layouts, printing, and outputs, annotation techniques, and reusable content and drawing management. In the course, you will create drawing objects, manage layers, apply object snaps, and work with the User Coordinate System.</p> <p>You&rsquo;ll edit objects and apply rotation and scale, array techniques, grip editing, offsets, fillet and chamfer, and trim and extend. You will also gain an understanding of exam topics such as layouts and viewports, output formats, and drawing management. Brush up on markup tools, hatch and fill, text, tables, multileaders, dimensioning, and much more.</p> <h2>About Autodesk Certified Professional</h2> <p>The Autodesk Certified Professional: AutoCAD for Design and Drafting exam is the recognized standard for measuring your skills and knowledge in AutoCAD. Certification at this level demonstrates a comprehensive skill set that provides an opportunity for individuals to stand out in a competitive professional environment.</p> <p>This type of experience typically comes from having worked with the software on a regular basis for at least 2 years, equivalent to approximately 400 hours (minimum) - 1200 hours (recommended), of real-world Autodesk software experience</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 767 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2984 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The Autodesk&reg; Certified Professional (ACP) is designed for professionals and students who want to advance beyond the Autodesk Certified User. This credential is for those who possess more advanced skills and can solve complex challenges in workflow and design. ACP is the logical credential for advanced and professional Autodesk software users who possess at least 400 hours of real-world Autodesk software experience. Certification at the Professional level demonstrates a skill set that ensures certified individuals stand out as they pursue career advancement. Becoming an Autodesk Certified Professional can lead to accelerated career development, improved productivity, and enhanced credibility.</p> <p>An Autodesk Certified Professional in Autodesk 3ds Mas showcases their knowledge and skills with 3-D modeling software to build a career as a game, film, or motion-graphic artist.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 768 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2185 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Explore the intricacies of Statistical Process Control (SPC) and step up your understanding of essential components that dictate process control and improvement. Our training begins by elucidating the concept of variability, ensuring that participants comprehend its pivotal role in process control. The immersive curriculum then progresses to unravel SPC charts and the nuances of process capabilities, creating a comprehensive foundation for individuals aiming to excel in quality control and assurance sectors.</p> <p>Furthermore, attendees will be introduced to an array of robust process improvement methods, reinforcing their knowledge and equipping them with the tools to elevate operational processes in their respective domains. With hands-on learning, expert insights, and real-world examples, Tertiary Courses ensures that every participant emerges with the confidence and competence to implement SPC techniques and drive tangible improvements across diverse industries.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 769 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1476 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The Basic Robot Operating System (ROS) for Beginners course at Tertiary Courses is an essential stepping stone for those venturing into the realm of modern robotics. Designed for novices, this course introduces participants to the foundational pillars of ROS, ensuring a solid understanding of ROS Master and Nodes, a pivotal component of the system.</p> <p>As the training progresses, attendees will familiarize themselves with ROS Topics, Publishers, and Subscribers of Messages. They''ll also gain insights into ROS Services, Actions, Bags, TF, and URDF. By the culmination of the course, participants will have acquired a clear and comprehensive grasp of the basics, setting them on the path to more advanced robotic endeavors.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 771 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1207 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The Autodesk® Certified Professional (ACP) is designed for professionals and students who want to advance beyond the Autodesk Certified User. This credential is for those who possess more advanced skills and can solve complex challenges in workflow and design.</p> <p>ACP is the logical credential for advanced and professional Autodesk software users who possess at least 400 hours of real-world Autodesk software experience. Certification at the Professional level demonstrates a skill set that ensures certified individuals stand out as they pursue career advancement. Becoming an Autodesk Certified Professional can lead to accelerated career development, improved productivity, and enhanced credibility.</p> <p>An Autodesk Inventor Certified User certification demonstrates entry-level knowledge that includes creating, modifying, formatting, and sharing 2D sketches, creating parts, viewing, and animating assemblies, creating presentations and drawings, etc</p> <li> <p>This course requires minimum of 6 participants to start a class. </p> </li>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 774 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2194 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Dive into the world of UX/UI design with our comprehensive Figma course at Tertiary Courses. Whether you''re a beginner or looking to refine your skills, our expert-led sessions will guide you through the intricacies of crafting user-friendly and visually stunning interfaces for both web and apps.</p> <p>Harness the power of Figma, the leading design tool preferred by professionals worldwide. With hands-on exercises, practical insights, and feedback, you''ll leave with a clear understanding of how to design impactful user experiences and interfaces that resonate with your target audience.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 775 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1144 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The "Digital Transformation for Small and Medium Enterprises" course illuminates the seismic shifts caused by digital technology in the business landscape. It offers a comprehensive exploration of the transformative and technological forces currently molding the future of enterprises. Through this structured learning path, participants will gain a profound understanding of how these dynamics can be harnessed, steering their businesses towards enduring success.</p> <p>This course meticulously covers the principal components of digital transformation. From discerning the most impactful technological trends to strategizing their application, learners will be equipped with the knowledge and tools essential for propelling their SMEs forward in an increasingly digital world. Position your business at the forefront of change with insights from Tertiary Courses.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 776 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1035 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>This course provides an in-depth understanding of implementing AI models with Microsoft Power Platform AI Builder. Learn how to automate document processing using AI Builder&rsquo;s prepackaged solutions, configure and monitor AI models, and streamline business workflows. Gain hands-on experience in developing custom AI models, integrating them into Power Apps and Power Automate, and enhancing efficiency with AI-powered automation.</p> <p>By the end of this course, you will have the skills to build and deploy AI-driven solutions for text recognition, document processing, and predictive analytics. Whether you are a business analyst, developer, or IT professional, this training will equip you with the knowledge to leverage AI Builder for intelligent decision-making, process optimization, and digital transformation in your organization.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 778 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1463 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Our LangChain courses offer a deep dive into the intriguing world of Large Language Models (LLMs), empowering learners to develop robust AI applications that can understand, interpret, and generate human-like text. Whether you''re a seasoned AI practitioner or a newcomer to the field, our comprehensive courses are designed to equip you with the advanced skills needed to harness the full potential of LLMs.</p> <p>The curriculum focuses on understanding the fundamental mechanics of LLMs, exploring their wide-ranging applications, and learning how to effectively implement them in a variety of contexts. From mastering the nuances of NLP to fine-tuning LLMs for specific tasks, learners will be exposed to a wealth of knowledge that includes both theory and practical aspects. By the end of our LangChain courses, you will be proficient in building AI applications that can meaningfully interact with LLMs, creating more value in your projects and offerings.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 782 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1599 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>This course provides an in-depth understanding of the ISO 50001:2018 Energy Management System, a pivotal standard for organizations aiming to enhance their energy efficiency. Beginning with an overview of the system, the course introduces participants to the core components of ISO 50001, including the context of organization, leadership, energy regulations, and policy. It lays the foundation for understanding how an energy management system can be a powerful tool in complying with legal requirements and improving energy performance.</p> <p>The course further delves into the practical aspects of planning, support, and operation within the framework of ISO 50001. Participants will learn about quality tools used in the system, how to conduct risk and opportunity assessments, and the importance of monitoring and measuring resources. The final module focuses on performance evaluation and continual improvement, crucial for maintaining and enhancing the energy management system. This includes understanding internal audits, management reviews, non-conformity and corrective actions, and the documentation required for continual improvement. By the end of this course, learners will be equipped to develop energy management objectives and scopes, analyze energy audit results, and compare system energy efficiency against benchmarks, all within the structure of the ISO 50001 energy management system.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 785 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1573 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Elevate your CAD skills with the AutoCAD LT Essential Training at Tertiary Courses. This course, curated for design enthusiasts and professionals, unravels the myriad functionalities and tools of AutoCAD LT, ensuring a comprehensive understanding of its capabilities. Delve into the creation and precise editing of 2D geometry, making your designs stand out with unmatched accuracy.</p> <p>But that''s just the beginning. Master the art of annotating your drawings with text, dimensions, leaders, and comprehensive tables. Get hands-on experience in customizing the ribbon and tool palettes to suit your unique design workflow. Seamlessly attach, import, and leverage data from PDF files, DGN files, and even integrate Bing Maps to bring a touch of real-world accuracy to your designs. By the end of this training, participants will be adept at harnessing the full potential of AutoCAD LT for their design projects.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 786 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1337 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The CompTIA Project+ Exam Prep course is meticulously designed to provide you with the foundational and advanced knowledge required to pass the CompTIA Project+ certification exam. This course covers a wide array of essential project management topics, beginning with the basics of project management and the development of a robust business case. You will learn to identify and compare different project methodologies, including Agile and Waterfall, enabling you to choose the best framework for your projects.</p> <p>The course also delves into critical aspects such as risk management, resource allocation, and project scheduling. You''ll gain practical skills in creating project plans, managing project execution, and effectively resolving issues and changes. Additionally, this course emphasizes the importance of communication, providing you with tools to lead effective meetings and manage stakeholder expectations. By the end of this course, you&rsquo;ll be equipped with the skills necessary to successfully complete the CompTIA Project+ exam and excel in your project management career.</p> <h2>Exam Voucher</h2> <p><span style="color: #ff0000;"></span></p> <p>This course include a Autodesk Exam Voucher at Our Pearson Vue Test Center.&nbsp;<span>You can purchase the exam voucher (one of the lowest prices in Singapore)&nbsp;</span><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><a href="https://www.tertiarycourses.com.sg/comptia-certification-exam-vouchers-for-network-linux-cloud-server-project.html" title="CompTIA Certification Exam Vouchers for Network+, Linux+, Cloud+, Server+, Project+" target="_blank">CompTIA Certification Exam Vouchers for Network+, Linux+, Cloud+, Server+, Project+</a></span>.</p> <p><span style="color: #ff0000;"></span></p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 790 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2079 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The Pearson Vue Certified IT Specialist Artificial Intelligence Training is designed for professionals looking to build expertise in AI implementation, model training, and AI-driven problem-solving. This comprehensive course covers AI problem definition, data collection and processing, AI algorithm selection, and real-world model deployment. Participants will learn to assess data quality, engage in feature engineering, train AI models, evaluate performance, and ensure regulatory compliance. Through hands-on exercises, learners will gain practical insights into AI transparency, validation, and ethical considerations.</p> <p>The course also delves into AI application integration, deployment strategies, and ongoing monitoring for optimal AI performance. Participants will develop the skills to manage AI solutions post-deployment, assess business impact, and implement continuous improvements. By the end of this program, learners will be well-prepared for the Pearson Vue IT Specialist AI certification, equipping them with the expertise needed to implement AI solutions effectively in real-world scenarios.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 798 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2230 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Dive into the world of cloud computing with our AZ-204 Microsoft Azure Developer Associate course. This comprehensive course is meticulously designed to provide you with the practical skills and knowledge needed to excel as a Microsoft Azure Developer. You will learn how to develop, test, and maintain cloud solutions, including services, security, storage, and more, ensuring you are well-equipped to handle the challenges of the ever-evolving tech landscape.</p> <p>Our course is structured to provide a seamless learning experience, with expert instructors guiding you every step of the way. By the end of the course, you will have a solid understanding of Microsoft Azure and be prepared to take the AZ-204 certification exam, opening doors to new career opportunities and advancements. Enroll now and take the first step towards becoming a certified Microsoft Azure Developer Associate.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 799 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2600 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Delve into the revolutionary world of urban farming with our Basic Hydroponics Course. Embark on a comprehensive guided tour at Kok Farm Hydroponics Farm, where you''ll gain invaluable insights into the intricate processes behind successful hydroponics farming. From understanding plant nutrient essentials to hands-on practice with a static hydroponics kit, this course promises a holistic learning experience.</p> <p>Whether you''re aiming to cultivate hydroponic leafy crops, design a bespoke hydroponic system, or diagnose common plant problems, we''ve got you covered. Delve deeper into hydroponics urban farming systems, including aquaponics and indoor plant factory farming, ensuring you have the tools to provide the optimal growing environment for your plants.</p> <p>Experience the heart of hydroponic farming firsthand with a curated tour of Kok Farm Hydroponics Farm. This immersive journey provides participants a unique opportunity to witness modern hydroponic practices in action, amidst the lush, thriving greens. Learn directly from seasoned farmers as they share invaluable insights on cultivation techniques, plant care, and the science of hydroponics. Walking through the farm, you''ll gain a deeper appreciation of how urban farming marries technology and nature, producing crops that are not only sustainable but also of superior quality.</p> <h2>Min Class Size: 15 pax</h2> <h2>Farm Tour @ Kok Fah Technology Farm &amp; Practice with Hydroponics Kit</h2>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 8 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1980 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>This hands-on course is designed for professionals and developers keen to harness the power of Agentic AI using Langflow and Model Context Protocol (MCP). You&rsquo;ll start by exploring the fundamentals of Agentic AI and Large Language Models (LLMs), including real-world use cases. Learn to build, customize, and deploy LLM-powered chatbots without coding, and get practical with Langflow installation and interface navigation. Through guided exercises, participants will create and deploy simple agentic workflows, preparing the foundation for advanced AI automation.</p> <p>As the course progresses, you''ll dive into building Retrieval Augmented Generation (RAG) workflows, multi-agent task flows, and Streamlit-based AI apps. Gain a comprehensive understanding of tokenization, embeddings, vector stores, and AI agent reasoning frameworks. The training concludes with the Model Context Protocol (MCP), where you''ll learn to build and deploy MCP servers and clients using Langflow. Whether you''re creating customer service bots, travel planners, or AI assistants, this course equips you with the tools to launch intelligent, agentic AI applications efficiently.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 804 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1926 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Dive into the world of Text Mining with our intensive training on the versatile tool, Orange, at Tertiary Courses. This program is meticulously designed to introduce participants to the foundational techniques of Text Preprocessing, setting the stage for more advanced modules in the curriculum. Gain insights into the methodologies behind Text Clustering, and understand the nuanced ways to classify textual data effectively.</p> <p>Progress further to explore Text Classification, a pivotal component in making sense of vast textual data sets, followed by an in-depth understanding of Topic Modeling, which aids in discerning the underlying topics within large text corpora. This comprehensive course provides hands-on experience with Orange, ensuring participants are well-equipped to tackle real-world text mining challenges with proficiency and confidence.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 808 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1031 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The Certified Kubernetes Application Developer (CKAD) Training equips developers with the skills needed to design, build, and deploy cloud-native applications on Kubernetes. This course covers essential Kubernetes concepts, including multi-container pod design, workload resources, persistent storage, and deployment strategies like blue/green and canary releases. You will learn how to use Helm and Kustomize for package management, perform rolling updates, and manage API deprecations effectively.</p> <p>Additionally, the course dives into application observability, security, and networking in Kubernetes. You will explore debugging techniques, health probes, logging, authentication, role-based access control (RBAC), and resource limits. Hands-on practice with Ingress rules, NetworkPolicies, ConfigMaps, and Secrets ensures a deep understanding of real-world Kubernetes application development. This training prepares you for the CKAD certification, advancing your career in DevOps, cloud engineering, and software development.</p> <h2></h2>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 810 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1215 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Artificial intelligence does not transform an organisation by being bolted onto the jobs it already has. Real gains come from assessing work at the task level and redesigning it deliberately &mdash; deciding what an AI agent should do alone, what people should do with AI, and what must stay entirely human. This one-day course gives HR leaders, business managers and transformation teams a practical method for doing exactly that.</p> <p>Drawing on The Conference Board&rsquo;s Framework for Agentic AI and Work Redesign, you will learn to start from the outcome you want and work backward, decompose pivotal roles into tasks and decisions, and allocate each one across the three modes of work. You will then build the governance, data quality and human-in-the-loop checkpoints that agentic AI requires, measure capability yield rather than headcount, and decide in advance where the productivity gains will go. You will leave with a completed job assessment matrix and a redesigned job profile for a role in your own organisation.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 811 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1431 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Dive into the world of intelligent chatbot creation with our comprehensive course on Microsoft Copilot Studio. This course offers a deep dive into the cutting-edge technology of AI chatbots, focusing on using Microsoft Copilot Studio for developing sophisticated, responsive chatbot applications. You''ll learn the intricacies of natural language processing, machine learning algorithms, and how to integrate these chatbots into various digital platforms to enhance user experience and engagement.</p> <p>Our hands-on approach will guide you through the process of designing, building, and deploying chatbots that can understand and interpret human language, make decisions, and provide valuable interactions. The course also covers best practices for optimizing chatbot performance, ensuring security and privacy, and measuring the effectiveness of your chatbot strategies. By the end of the course, you will have the necessary skills to create intelligent chatbots that can revolutionize customer service, e-commerce, and digital marketing efforts.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 814 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1658 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Advance your IT career with the Pearson Vue Certified IT Specialist - Networking course. This program is tailored to equip professionals with comprehensive knowledge of networking concepts, including protocols, network design, troubleshooting, and infrastructure management. Gain hands-on expertise to master networking essentials and prepare for globally recognized certification.</p> <p>This certification course covers critical areas such as network security, wireless technology, and system interoperability. Whether you''re starting your journey in networking or enhancing your existing skills, this course ensures you''re prepared to meet the demands of modern IT networking roles.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 815 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1149 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>In an era where digital threats are increasingly prevalent, the "Safeguarding Against Online and Phone Scams" course serves as an essential guide to understanding and combating these risks. This course dives deep into the mechanics of various online and phone scams, offering comprehensive insights into the latest scamming techniques and tactics used by fraudsters. Participants will learn how to identify phishing emails, fraudulent phone calls, and other deceptive practices that threaten personal security and privacy. The curriculum is designed to be interactive and engaging, incorporating real-life examples and case studies to illustrate the sophisticated methods used by scammers. This approach ensures that participants can easily apply the knowledge to their daily digital interactions.</p> <p>The second part of the course focuses on practical prevention strategies and response measures. Attendees will be equipped with critical skills such as secure online behavior, effective use of privacy settings, and steps to take when confronted with a potential scam. The course also covers the psychological aspects of scams, helping participants understand why and how individuals fall victim to these schemes, thereby enhancing their ability to prevent such occurrences. By the end of this course, participants will not only be able to protect themselves from online and phone scams but also contribute to safeguarding others in their community or organization. Whether for personal security or professional development, this course is a valuable investment in today&rsquo;s digitally-driven world.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 825 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2236 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Master the art of building intelligent multi-agent applications with Google''s Gemini ADK in this comprehensive, hands-on course. You will start by understanding single agent foundations &mdash; including agent lifecycle, model configuration, structured input/output, and session handling &mdash; before progressing to advanced topics such as function calling, tool execution, external API integration, and vector database-powered memory systems. This course equips you with the practical skills to design, build, and deploy AI agents that can reason, remember, and take action autonomously.</p> <p>Take your AI development expertise to the next level by learning how to architect sophisticated multi-agent systems using supervisor, hierarchical, and pipeline patterns. You will explore agent-to-agent communication, shared memory, workflow orchestration, and the Model Context Protocol (MCP) for structured context passing and tool discovery. With dedicated modules on production-grade design &mdash; covering routing strategies, observability, security guardrails, and deployment at scale &mdash; you will graduate ready to build robust, enterprise-quality multi-agent applications powered by Gemini ADK.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 829 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1689 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Embark on a transformative journey with the Qlik Sense Business Analytics Training at Tertiary Courses. Qlik Sense, a front-runner in the business analytics sphere, offers a dynamic platform for data-driven decision-making. This course has been meticulously designed to ensure participants grasp the nuances of the tool, enabling them to extract actionable insights from their data.</p> <p>Commencing with an in-depth look at the Qlik Sense Interface, trainees will be adeptly guided on connecting to diverse data sources, ensuring a robust foundation. From there, the course delves into the intricacies of data modelling, preparation, and creating compelling visualizations. By mastering Qlik Sense expressions and the potent set analysis feature, participants will be equipped to transform raw data into visual stories, making strategic decisions with precision. Join us and harness the power of Qlik Sense for superior business analytics.</p> </div>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 830 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1042 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The WSQ ISO 14001:2015 Internal Auditor Training equips professionals with the knowledge and skills to conduct internal audits based on ISO 14001:2015 standards and the International Professional Practices Framework (IPPF). Participants will gain insights into Environmental Management System (EMS) auditing, organizational risk identification, and the application of ISO 14001:2015 principles to business operations. The course provides a strong foundation in internal audit methodologies, stakeholder engagement, and compliance with environmental standards.</p> <p>Through hands-on training, learners will explore key audit phases, conduct risk assessments, and develop effective audit reports. They will also learn to write corrective action requests and support preliminary risk assessments using industry best practices. This course is ideal for professionals involved in environmental compliance, quality assurance, and risk management, ensuring they are well-prepared to assess and improve their organization''s EMS performance.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 835 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1480 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Embark on a journey to mastery with our Advanced RPA Training focused on UIPath. This course, curated for professionals and enthusiasts alike, delves into intricate aspects of RPA including data scraping, orchestrator operations, and more, ensuring a comprehensive grasp on the subject.</p> <p>Our curriculum accentuates on the key highlights: from efficient data scraping and recording methods to the seamless integration of UIPath Orchestrator. Further, participants will understand the nuances of error handling and the fascinating realm of cognitive activities. By the conclusion, attendees will possess a robust set of skills, poised to lead in the evolving landscape of Robotic Process Automation.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 839 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1223 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Our DP-100 Azure Data Scientist Associate Exam Prep course is meticulously crafted to provide you with a comprehensive understanding of the key concepts and skills necessary to succeed as a data scientist in the Azure ecosystem. By enrolling in this course, you will delve deep into the world of data science, learning how to process, analyze, and interpret complex data sets using Azure''s powerful tools and services.</p> <p>Throughout the course, you will engage with real-world scenarios and case studies that will challenge you to apply your knowledge in practical settings. You will master the art of utilizing Azure Machine Learning, Azure Databricks, and other Azure services to build, train, and deploy machine learning models that deliver actionable insights. By the end of this course, you will be well-equipped to confidently take the DP-100 exam and step into the role of a Microsoft Certified Azure Data Scientist Associate, ready to make a significant impact in the field of data science.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 840 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2719 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Delve into the advanced realm of Keras with Tertiary Courses and witness a transformative learning experience that promises to elevate your proficiency in neural networks. This intensive training is curated to address challenges posed by smaller datasets, guiding learners to harness potent techniques that optimize and refine models for stellar outcomes. Experience the power of the Functional API, a pivotal tool in Keras, tailored for constructing intricate, multi-output models with superior flexibility.</p> <p>In addition to hands-on coding sessions, the program encapsulates the aesthetic realm of neural networks through feature map visualization. This segment offers insights into the internal workings of convolutional layers, aiding in model interpretation and fostering a deeper understanding of activations. By the culmination of this training, participants will not only be adept at crafting sophisticated models using Keras but will also possess the acumen to visualize and interpret their nuances, thereby bridging theory with tangible results.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 842 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1232 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Step into the immersive realm of Data Visualisation with Python Training. Python, renowned for its versatility, has firmly established itself as a stalwart in the data visualization domain. Our meticulously crafted course is designed to take participants from the foundational principles of crafting basic plots using Matplotlib to the refined techniques and aesthetics offered by Seaborn, encapsulating the best of Python''s visualization prowess.</p> <p>Venture into the world of geospatial visualization, harnessing the potential of Bokeh to represent complex spatial narratives. With the world becoming more data-centric, possessing the expertise to visualize and interpret this data is pivotal. This course, through a blend of theoretical insights and practical applications, aims to empower participants with the skills to weave compelling visual stories, ensuring they stand out in today''s data-driven landscape.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 851 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1088 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The CompTIA Cloud+ Exam Prep course offers a comprehensive approach to mastering the essential skills needed to pass the CompTIA Cloud+ certification exam. This course covers a wide range of topics, beginning with fundamental cloud concepts and advancing through the planning and designing of a cloud environment. You will learn to administer cloud resources, manage cloud storage, and secure cloud networks, equipping you with the practical skills required to handle real-world cloud challenges.</p> <p>Additionally, the course delves into advanced topics such as cloud automation, orchestration, and high availability. You''ll gain expertise in managing cloud migrations, troubleshooting deployments, and ensuring optimal cloud performance. The focus on cloud security is robust, ensuring you are prepared to safeguard cloud environments effectively. This course is ideal for IT professionals aiming to validate their cloud expertise and advance their careers in cloud computing. With in-depth instruction and hands-on practice, you''ll be well-prepared to pass the CompTIA Cloud+ exam and excel in cloud management.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 855 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1890 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Unlock the power of Microsoft 365 Copilot by mastering the art of crafting effective AI prompts. This comprehensive course will guide you through leveraging AI-driven assistance to automate tasks, enhance document creation, analyze data, and improve collaboration across Microsoft 365 applications. Learn how Copilot integrates with Word, Excel, PowerPoint, Outlook, and Teams to streamline workflows, summarize content, and generate actionable insights with precision.</p> <p>Through hands-on exercises, real-world scenarios, and best practices, you will gain expertise in prompt optimization, AI-driven content creation, and data transformation. Whether you want to draft compelling documents, simplify complex information, or enhance productivity with AI-powered assistance, this course provides the essential skills to maximize Microsoft 365 Copilot&rsquo;s capabilities for business success.</p> <h2>Microsoft Official Learner Partner&nbsp;</h2> <p>We are official Microsoft Learning Partner.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 856 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1559 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Wix has user-friendly drag-and-drop tools and over 500+ ready-made templates help you build your website without either having specialist skills or hiring a web developer. Wix accelerates the web development process and gives you the creative freedom to build the website you desire.</p> <p>Wix is an ideal website builder for small and medium ecommerce businesses.&nbsp;This course will teach you the essential of Wix to get you started to build you own website.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 858 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 918 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The AB-730 Microsoft Certified AI Business Professional course equips business users and professionals with the knowledge and skills required to use generative AI productivity tools such as Microsoft 365 Copilot and agents like Researcher and Analyst to improve daily work and make better decisions &mdash; without building AI apps or writing code. Participants will explore generative AI fundamentals, how Copilot keeps information private and secure, and how to apply responsible AI and data protection practices.</p> <p>Learners will gain expertise in creating effective prompts, saving, scheduling and sharing prompts, managing conversations, and building and configuring Microsoft 365 Copilot agents. Additionally, the course covers drafting business documents, generating management summaries, moving insights between Microsoft 365 apps, and using Copilot for meetings and collaboration with Copilot Pages. By completing this course, participants will be prepared to work more productively and confidently with AI in everyday business contexts.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 864 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1392 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Embark on a journey to master the intricacies of API development and testing with our comprehensive Postman Essential Training. This course is meticulously designed to provide you with a robust understanding of Postman, a pivotal tool in modern API development. Dive into the world of efficient API testing, learning how to create, manage, and execute HTTP requests seamlessly. Our expert-led training emphasizes practical skills, ensuring you can immediately apply your knowledge in real-world scenarios.</p> <p>In this course, you''ll explore advanced features of Postman, including automated testing, environment setup, and data management. Whether you''re a software developer, a QA professional, or an IT enthusiast, this training will enhance your proficiency in API debugging and automation, preparing you for the challenges of contemporary software development. Get ready to transform your API development skills with Postman Essential Training, tailored for those eager to excel in the fast-paced world of technology.</p> <p><span style="font-size: 1.5em;">Certificate</span></p> <p>All participants will receive a Certificate of Completion from Tertiary Courses after achieved at least 75% attendance.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 866 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1382 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Dive into the dynamic world of deep learning and discover the power of Keras for image classification. This course unveils the essential techniques and tools to unlock your potential in AI-driven computer vision projects. From the foundational concepts of neural networks to practical implementations, we cover it all.</p> <p>Whether you''re an aspiring data scientist, a machine learning enthusiast, or a professional looking to upscale, this course is your gateway to mastering image classification using Keras. Through hands-on examples, industry-grade projects, and expert guidance, you''ll be equipped to tackle real-world challenges with confidence. Join us on this transformative journey.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 873 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1256 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Embark on a journey to become a Google Professional Cloud Security Engineer with our comprehensive certification prep course. This course is meticulously designed for IT professionals aiming to deepen their expertise in cloud security on the Google Cloud Platform (GCP). You''ll gain in-depth knowledge of GCP''s core services, security best practices, and the latest strategies in securing cloud environments. Our curriculum covers critical aspects of cloud security, including identity and access management, data protection, and network security, providing you with the skills needed to design and implement secure infrastructure on GCP.</p> <p>Our expert instructors, equipped with real-world experience, will guide you through interactive sessions, practical exercises, and up-to-date course materials. The course is structured to not only prepare you for the Google Professional Cloud Security Engineer certification exam but also to enhance your practical skills for immediate application in your current or future roles. Whether you''re an IT security specialist, a cloud engineer, or an aspiring security professional, this course is your stepping stone to achieving certification and excelling in the realm of cloud security. Enroll now to secure your spot and advance your career in this rapidly evolving field.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 876 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1975 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Unlock the power of conversational AI with this hands-on course on Building Live Voice Agents with Google''s Agent Development Kit (ADK). Starting from foundational concepts, you will set up the ADK environment, configure the Gemini model, and build your first voice agent capable of real-time interactions with Google Search integration. Through practical exercises, you will master the tool-calling flow, debug agent responses, and test live voice interactions using the ADK Web UI &mdash; giving you the confidence to create intelligent, responsive voice agents from scratch.</p> <p>Take your skills further by implementing persistent memory, structured outputs, custom tools, and safety guardrails to build robust, production-grade voice systems. You will explore advanced multi-agent coordination by constructing a podcast agent that generates multi-speaker scripts and converts them to audio using Gemini text-to-speech. The course culminates with deploying your agents on Vertex AI, equipping you with the expertise to implement security, monitoring, and scalable practices essential for real-world AI voice applications.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 881 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1318 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Embark on a journey into the intriguing domain of <strong>Quantum Computing</strong> with our comprehensive course designed specifically for beginners. This course breaks down complex quantum concepts into digestible chunks, ensuring a smooth learning curve for those new to the field. Acquire fundamental knowledge about quantum systems, quantum mechanics, and quantum algorithms, providing a strong foundation for further study and application.</p> <p>With our course, you''ll develop key computational skills essential for understanding and working within the Quantum Computing field. Our expert tutors guide you every step of the way, enabling you to gain a robust understanding of the subject. Whether you''re a student, a professional looking to switch careers, or simply a tech enthusiast, this course offers a practical, engaging, and accessible introduction to the exciting world of Quantum Computing.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 882 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1410 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Selenium is a suite of tools specifically for automating web browsers. Selenium provides a playback tool for authoring functional tests without the need to learn a test scripting language. It also provides a test domain-specific language (Selenese) to write tests in a number of popular programming languages, including C#, Groovy, Java, Perl, PHP, Python, Ruby and Scala. The tests can then run against most modern web browsers. Selenium deploys on Windows, Linux, and macOS platforms</p> <p>This course will teach you how to get started on&nbsp;Selenium and&nbsp;Selenium Web Drrver.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 888 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 762 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Embarking on the journey to become a certified Azure Security Engineer is a step towards gaining in-depth knowledge and credibility in the realm of cloud security. Our AZ-500 Exam Preparation Guide is meticulously crafted to offer you an enriching learning experience. Designed by experts, this course helps in acquainting you with the critical concepts and hands-on skills that are quintessential in becoming an Azure Security Engineer. Through this course, we aim to foster a learning environment where you can prepare at your own pace and secure a promising career in Azure security.</p> <p>Taking the AZ-500 Azure Security Engineer Associate Exam is a significant milestone in validating your proficiency in managing security and identity solutions in Microsoft Azure. Our course provides a structured approach to mastering the skills required to excel in the AZ-500 exam. You will gain access to various modules that cover a broad spectrum of topics, including managing identity and access, implementing platform protection, managing security operations, and securing data and applications. Immerse yourself in a learning journey that not only prepares you for the examination but also lays a robust foundation for a thriving career in the field.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 893 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2977 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Dive into the world of IT service management with our comprehensive course on ISO/IEC 20000-1:2018 Service Management System. This course is meticulously designed to equip professionals with in-depth knowledge and practical skills for implementing, managing, and enhancing service management systems in compliance with the ISO/IEC 20000-1:2018 standards. Gain a competitive edge in the IT industry by mastering the key principles of service management, understanding the requirements of ISO/IEC 20000-1:2018, and learning how to apply these standards effectively in your organization. Whether you''re looking to improve your service quality, achieve ISO compliance, or elevate your professional profile, this course offers the essential tools and insights for success in IT service management.</p> <p>Building on a blend of theoretical knowledge and practical application, the course covers crucial aspects of the ISO/IEC 20000-1:2018 standards, including the planning, design, transition, delivery, and improvement of IT services. Participants will engage in real-world scenarios and case studies, fostering a deeper understanding of how to integrate ISO standards into everyday IT operations seamlessly. By the end of the course, you''ll not only be proficient in the principles and practices of IT service management but also be prepared to lead your organization towards ISO/IEC 20000-1:2018 certification, ensuring a high level of efficiency and quality in IT services. Join us at Tertiary Courses and step into a realm of professional excellence in IT service management.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 895 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1745 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>In this dynamic course, participants will dive into the world of Generative AI, specifically tailored for creative design using Adobe Photoshop and Firefly. The curriculum is designed to equip learners with cutting-edge skills in integrating AI technologies into graphic design workflows. You''ll explore how Generative AI can transform your creative process, enabling the generation of unique and complex designs that would be challenging or time-consuming to create manually.</p> <p>The course not only focuses on the technical aspects of using Generative AI in Photoshop and Firefly but also emphasizes the artistic side of leveraging AI to enhance creativity. Participants will gain hands-on experience in applying AI-powered tools for image manipulation, pattern generation, and artistic effects. Whether you are a professional designer looking to incorporate AI into your work, or an enthusiast eager to explore the intersection of technology and art, this course will provide you with the knowledge and skills to push the boundaries of digital design.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 897 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1573 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Delve into the intricacies of eLearning design with a comprehensive course centered on iSpring Suite, the game-changer in dynamic digital learning content. Gain an in-depth understanding of foundational eLearning concepts and principles, ensuring every piece of content you craft is not just engaging, but also pedagogically sound. Familiarize yourself with the robust suite of tools that iSpring offers, alongside additional tools that will elevate your eLearning creation process.</p> <p>This course stands out by emphasizing SCORM compliance, ensuring that every piece of content is seamlessly integrated into any Learning Management System (LMS). More than just tool mastery, we provide insights into weaving interactivity into your courses. This interactivity, grounded in robust pedagogical approaches, guarantees an enhanced and engaging learning experience for all learners.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 902 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1073 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Unlock the potential of Microsoft Power Automate with the PL-7002 course, designed to help professionals streamline business processes and automate workflows. Learn to create and manage automated flows, from simple recurring tasks to complex approval processes. Gain hands-on experience in troubleshooting flows, integrating Power Automate with Microsoft 365, SharePoint, Dynamics 365, and SQL databases, and managing user-driven automation.</p> <p>This course also explores advanced automation techniques, including business process flows with conditions, real-time data-driven automation, and Power Automate&rsquo;s deep integration across multiple data sources. By the end of this training, you will be equipped with the skills to enhance productivity, optimize business operations, and drive digital transformation using Power Automate&rsquo;s powerful automation tools.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 903 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1483 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Embark on a transformative journey with our Effective Leadership Training designed for aspiring and seasoned leaders alike. Dive deep into fostering self-awareness, developing emotional intelligence, and understanding the critical role of integrity and honesty in leadership. Grasp the significance of resilience, adaptability, and vision in driving innovation and navigating challenges with finesse.</p> <p>Sharpen your communication strategies to build enduring relationships and deftly resolve conflicts. Equip yourself with astute decision-making skills that cater to both risks and opportunities. Discover the art of delegation, leveraging the unique strengths of your team, and inspiring unmatched motivation and engagement among your members, all aimed at positioning you as an outstanding leader in today''s dynamic corporate landscape.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 904 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1012 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Set the foundation for your Flutter development journey with our Basic Flutter Training. In this course, participants will delve into the intricacies of Dart, a powerful and expressive programming language tailored for Flutter app development. Master the fundamentals, from setting up the Flutter SDK for streamlined app creation to crafting intuitive user interfaces through effective widget implementation.</p> <p>Designed to provide a robust introduction, this course paves the way for aspiring Flutter developers to grasp the core concepts that drive this dynamic framework. Under the guidance of our industry experts, you''ll acquire practical skills and insights, positioning you for further exploration and innovation in the Flutter space. With Tertiary Courses, take your first confident steps in the Flutter ecosystem and elevate your mobile app development prowess.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 905 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1056 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Unlock the transformative potential of Google Classroom with this meticulous LMS training course. Educators, students, and e-learning enthusiasts alike will gain a comprehensive understanding of managing Classroom roles, be it as a teacher orchestrating lessons and grading, or as a student navigating assignments and feedback. A holistic grasp of these functionalities ensures optimized classroom management, promoting productive virtual learning environments.</p> <p>Moreover, the course emphasizes the powerful integration of Google Classroom with Google Meet Video Conferencing. This seamless amalgamation ensures real-time, interactive learning sessions, replicating the dynamics of a physical classroom in the digital realm. Whether you''re conducting lectures, collaborative group discussions, or one-on-one feedback sessions, the capability to intertwine these Google tools amplifies the educational experience manifold.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 906 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1118 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The Internet of Things (IoT) is transforming industries by enabling smarter decision-making, automation, and real-time insights. This course provides a comprehensive understanding of IoT concepts, architectures, and business applications. Learn how to implement IoT solutions, integrate them with existing systems, and leverage data analytics for improved efficiency and innovation.</p> <p>Designed for professionals and business leaders, this course covers IoT use cases across various industries, security considerations, and the latest advancements. Gain hands-on experience with IoT platforms and devices, and develop a strategic approach to adopting IoT in your organization. Stay ahead in the digital landscape by mastering IoT for business success</p> <p><span style="color: #ff0000;"><strong>Note that the IoT kit is used for the training. The course fee does not include the kit.</strong></span></p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 911 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1450 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>This Certified Lean Six Sigma Black Belt (CLSSBB) course provides in-depth training on the Six Sigma methodology, focusing on quality control, process improvement, and data-driven decision-making. Participants will gain a thorough understanding of the DMAIC (Define, Measure, Analyze, Improve, Control) framework, learning to identify, evaluate, and lead Six Sigma projects that drive organizational success. The course includes comprehensive modules on setting SMART goals, conducting Voice of the Customer (VOC) analysis, and developing detailed project charters.</p> <p>Throughout the course, participants will master essential tools such as root cause analysis, statistical process control, process mapping, and error-proofing strategies like FMEA and Kaizen. By the end of the program, participants will be equipped with skills in cost-benefit analysis, control planning, and implementing sustainable process improvements, positioning them as valuable assets for continuous improvement and operational excell</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 913 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1427 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Immerse yourself in our comprehensive PL-400 Microsoft Power Platform Developer Exam Prep. This course is meticulously designed to offer aspirants an in-depth understanding of the Power Platform''s diverse functionalities. From PowerApps development and Power Automate workflows to insights from Power BI and integration of Power Virtual Agents, we cover every aspect essential for the PL-400 exam.</p> <p>By leveraging real-world scenarios and hands-on exercises, participants will gain practical insights, tips, and tricks to tackle the exam challenges effectively. Beyond mere theoretical knowledge, our course ensures that each individual is primed with the confidence and expertise needed to excel in the Microsoft Power Platform Developer certification exam.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 915 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2482 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>This CompTIA CySA+ Exam Prep course is designed to provide IT professionals with a deep dive into the world of cybersecurity analysis. The course is structured to cover all the critical areas needed to pass the CompTIA CySA+ certification exam, a globally recognized credential in the cybersecurity industry. Participants will engage in an interactive learning environment that emphasizes the practical aspects of threat management, vulnerability management, and incident response. The course is rich with real-world scenarios and hands-on activities to ensure a thorough understanding of the key concepts.</p> <p>Our curriculum goes beyond theoretical knowledge, focusing on the application of cybersecurity practices in real-life situations. This course is particularly beneficial for those seeking to enhance their skills in network security and compliance, aligning with industry best practices. Participants will leave with the confidence to implement robust security solutions and the knowledge to effectively respond to and mitigate cybersecurity threats, an essential skill set in today''s rapidly evolving digital landscape.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 916 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1783 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Dive into the expansive world of NoSQL databases with our meticulously designed training program. The course embarks on a journey to unravel the nuances that differentiate NoSQL from its traditional SQL counterpart, offering insights into the advantages and adaptabilities of each. As you progress, delve into the intricacies of document-based NoSQL systems, known for their flexibility, and column-based systems, revered for scalability.</p> <p>Furthermore, our curriculum emphasizes hands-on expertise in crafting efficient NoSQL queries, empowering learners to interact seamlessly with vast, dynamic datasets. Whether you''re a data enthusiast keen on updating your toolkit or a professional steering towards modern data management solutions, this course provides an avenue to excel. Equip yourself with NoSQL skills, and stand out in the evolving landscape of database technology.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 917 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1053 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Discover the revolutionary capabilities of MongoDB, a trailblazer in the NoSQL database domain, through our expertly tailored course. Begin by understanding the fundamental differences between traditional SQL and NoSQL databases, shedding light on the inherent strengths and flexibilities of MongoDB. Grasp the mechanics behind document-based NoSQL - a hallmark of MongoDB, and contrast it with column-based storage solutions.</p> <p>Beyond theory, the course is meticulously crafted to offer hands-on experience in formulating efficient NoSQL queries tailored for MongoDB, ensuring practical knowledge acquisition. This training not only serves as a gateway to understanding the nuances of MongoDB but also empowers you to harness its potential for data-driven solutions. Be at the forefront of database technology evolution by embedding MongoDB''s dynamic techniques into your professional repertoire.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 918 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1425 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The Tableau Certified Data Analyst Exam Prep course is meticulously designed to equip aspiring data professionals with the expertise needed to excel in the Tableau Certified Data Analyst exam. This intensive program delves into essential Tableau functionalities, including connecting to diverse data sources, data preparation, crafting interactive visualizations, and developing dynamic dashboards. Through a blend of theoretical knowledge and practical application, participants will gain the confidence to effectively analyze and interpret data, leveraging Tableau''s powerful tools.</p> <p>Recognizing the unique challenges faced by small businesses, this course offers actionable strategies tailored to optimize data analysis and visualization within limited budgets and resources. Stay updated with the latest industry practices and enhance your ability to make data-driven decisions that can propel business growth.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 919 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1091 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Delve into the essentials of cybersecurity with a course designed to equip you with practical and theoretical knowledge. Explore fundamental security principles, including threat management, encryption, and access control. Understand basic network security concepts, secure wireless networks, and mitigate vulnerabilities in TCP/IP protocols and infrastructures.</p> <p>Advance your skills with modules on endpoint security, vulnerability assessment, and incident handling. Learn to analyze system logs, implement risk management practices, and develop disaster recovery plans. Master digital forensics and incident response for a robust approach to tackling cyber threats. This course prepares you to excel in dynamic IT environments..</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 920 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 906 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Revit for Architectural Design Professional Certification Prep is a comprehensive course designed to equip learners with the knowledge and skills required to excel in the architectural design industry using Autodesk Revit. This course covers essential topics such as modeling, documentation, collaboration, coordination, project standards, and information analysis, all in the context of Revit.</p> <p>Throughout this course, participants will learn how to leverage design research, manage work processes, resolve unforeseen problems, and guide design creation processes to generate breakthrough solutions. Learners will also explore the impact of design and technological trends on user needs and behavior, understand technical and process constraints, and become proficient in prevalent industry design processes, methodologies, and tools.</p> <p>Upon completion of the course, learners will be well-prepared to devise practical and feasible design processes, consult others for advice on best practices, and articulate design options to achieve buy-in from stakeholders. This course is ideal for architects, designers, engineers, and other professionals seeking to enhance their Revit expertise and attain the Autodesk Revit for Architectural Design Professional Certification.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 921 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2701 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>This comprehensive CompTIA Data+ Exam Prep course covers the full spectrum of data analytics, providing you with the knowledge and skills needed to excel in the exam and your career. The course is structured around key topics including data concepts and environments, where you&rsquo;ll learn to identify basic concepts, understand data systems, and compare data structures. Delve into data mining with hands-on practice in data integration, cleansing, and manipulation techniques, crucial for optimizing and analyzing data effectively.</p> <p>Further, you&rsquo;ll explore advanced data analysis methods, applying descriptive statistics and key analysis techniques to derive meaningful insights. The course also emphasizes the importance of data visualization, equipping you with the skills to design reports and dashboards that communicate business requirements clearly. Finally, gain a strong foundation in data governance, quality control, and master data management, ensuring that you can manage data with integrity and compliance. This course is ideal for professionals aiming to validate their expertise and advance their careers in data analytics</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 923 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1735 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Embark on an enriching journey into the world of Machine Learning with R at Tertiary Courses. This all-encompassing course is designed to take participants from the foundational concepts of machine learning through to the intricacies of neural networks. With a balance of both supervised and unsupervised learning models, the curriculum ensures a robust understanding, prepping learners for real-world challenges.</p> <p>In addition to theoretical knowledge, the course focuses on pragmatic skills. Participants will hone their proficiency in identifying the most appropriate machine learning methods tailored to specific problems. Leveraging the power of R for hands-on data analysis, students will derive actionable insights, fostering their ability to draw astute inferences. With the seamless blend of theory and application, learners are set on a path to become adept at data-driven decision-making using R.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 925 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1672 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The AI-103 Microsoft Certified Azure AI Apps and Agents Developer Associate course equips learners with the knowledge and skills required to build, manage and deploy AI apps and agents on Azure using Microsoft Foundry. Participants will explore planning and managing Azure AI solutions, choosing the right models and Foundry services, and implementing generative AI and agentic solutions with retrieval-augmented generation, multi-agent orchestration and responsible AI.</p> <p>Learners will gain hands-on expertise implementing computer vision, text analysis and information extraction solutions &mdash; from image and video generation and multimodal understanding to sentiment analysis, speech, translation, and OCR-based document extraction with Azure Content Understanding. Additionally, the course covers securing, monitoring and operationalizing AI systems with observability, guardrails and CI/CD. By completing this course, participants will be prepared to develop and operate production-grade AI apps and agents on Azure.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 926 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1372 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Discover the power of social commerce with our comprehensive XiaoHongShu for Business course. This program is meticulously designed for entrepreneurs, marketers, and business professionals aiming to expand their digital footprint and drive sales through one of the fastest-growing social media platforms. Participants will delve into effective strategies for building a strong brand presence, engaging with a broader customer base, and utilizing XiaoHongShu''s unique ecosystem to boost online visibility and business growth.</p> <p>In this course, you will gain hands-on experience in creating compelling content, understanding user analytics, and harnessing the platform''s marketing tools to tailor your approach to the dynamic social commerce environment. We focus on practical skills and real-world applications, ensuring that you leave with the knowledge and confidence to transform your business''s online strategy and capitalize on the burgeoning opportunities in social commerce. Join us to unlock the full potential of XiaoHongShu and elevate your business to new heights.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 927 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1723 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The 8D Approach to Problem Solving course offers participants a comprehensive insight into the renowned 8D methodology, emphasizing its structured steps and implementation tools. Through this transformative learning experience, attendees will not only be able to describe the methodology but will also be empowered to actively participate in an 8D team, leveraging the tools necessary for an effective problem-solving process.</p> <p>Additionally, the course accentuates the importance of refining communication and documentation related to the identified problem. With hands-on exercises and real-world applications, learners will be equipped to seamlessly apply the 8D technique to their daily work challenges. With Tertiary Courses, take a leap towards becoming a proficient problem solver, capable of driving impactful solutions in any professional environment.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 928 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1035 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Embark on a rewarding journey of mastering networking essentials with our CompTIA Network+ Certification Prep course. This course is meticulously designed to provide an in-depth understanding of modern networking trends, configurations, and management practices. By delving into the core principles of networking, learners will explore various network devices, topologies, and protocols essential for establishing reliable and efficient network infrastructures. The curriculum is tailored to highlight the significance of understanding and implementing the right networking solutions in achieving organizational goals while ensuring network security and efficiency.</p> <p>Transitioning to advanced networking concepts, this course further explores network troubleshooting, performance optimization, and security best practices. Learners will engage in practical scenarios to diagnose and resolve common network issues, ensuring a hands-on learning experience. The course also sheds light on the importance of continuous learning and staying updated with the evolving networking technologies to excel in the fast-paced IT networking domain. By the end of this course, learners will not only be well-prepared for the CompTIA Network+ certification exam but also possess a solid foundation of networking knowledge and skills, ready to contribute significantly to their organization''s networking solutions and to their own professional growth in the networking field.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 938 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1970 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Embark on a transformative journey into the realm of Design and Process Failure Mode Effect Analysis (DPFMEA) with our expertly curated course. Participants will be thoroughly introduced to the foundational concepts and applications of FMEA, both in design and process contexts. Our curriculum is tailored to enable learners to discern potential failure modes, pinpoint causes associated with designs or processes, and strategically identify interventions to eliminate or mitigate the likelihood of these failures manifesting.</p> <p>Beyond just theory, the course is designed to empower participants with the tools and techniques to meticulously document the FMEA process. This hands-on approach ensures a holistic understanding of potential risks and the means to address them proactively. With real-world case studies and interactive sessions, attendees will leave equipped with actionable insights and a robust framework to spearhead quality assurance initiatives in their respective domains.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 947 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1475 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Dive deep into the world of advanced decision-making with our course on Optimisation &amp; Statistical Decision Analysis. Designed for both business professionals and individuals, this comprehensive training will guide participants in analyzing complex problem situations and adeptly structuring them. Harnessing the power of a Decision model, learners will be equipped to represent these problem situations, laying a strong foundation for precise solution methodologies.</p> <p>Progressing further, participants will master the art of solving models using cutting-edge Statistical Methods and the versatile Decision Tree model. An emphasis on the Utility Function ensures that one can seamlessly incorporate risk appetite into their decision-making process, guaranteeing well-rounded and informed decisions. The course also delves into the complexities of multicriteria decision problems, providing learners with a robust skill set to tackle diverse challenges in optimization and decision-making arenas.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 951 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1175 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Master the core principles and techniques of Data Quality Management in this comprehensive course. This program introduces key concepts like data quality dimensions, potential threats to data integrity, and the impact of poor data quality on business decision-making. Learn to develop a robust Data Quality Management framework that ensures data reliability, accuracy, and consistency. Participants will explore essential concepts such as data quality rules, profiling, parsing, and cleansing, as well as methods for data inspection, monitoring, and enhancement.</p> <p>The course also emphasizes best practices and strategies for maximizing data quality. Learners will gain hands-on experience in data governance, role assignment, and the use of advanced tools and techniques for improving data accuracy and integrity. By mastering these design strategies, participants will be equipped to implement effective quality management systems in their organizations, fostering better data-driven decision-making and ensuring operational excellence</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 963 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1467 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Venture into the multifaceted realm of Autodesk Fusion 360 with our holistic training program, tailored to arm you with expertise in cutting-edge CAD techniques. Fusion 360, renowned for its cloud-enabled capabilities, stands at the forefront of modern design and simulation. This course elucidates the core features of Fusion 360, offering insight into its versatile environments, and the art of extruding, modeling, and sculpting in 3D.</p> <p>From converting intricate models for Fusion 360 to surface modeling and generating detailed meshes, this training covers every pivotal aspect. Dive deep into turning sketches into tangible surfaces, creating efficient joints, inspecting models for perfection, and the nuances of 3D printing. Furthermore, participants will also explore patching models and leveraging Fusion 360''s robust simulation tools. By the culmination of this course, students will possess the acumen to seamlessly navigate and optimize Autodesk Fusion 360 for their design endeavors.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 972 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1701 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>In the ever-evolving landscape of networking, the Cisco Certified Network Associate (CCNA) stands as a hallmark of foundational proficiency. Our CCNA Exam Preparation course is tailored to ensure that aspiring network professionals grasp the intricate details of networking, setting them on the path to certification success. We demystify the complexities of networking, making it accessible and understandable for all.</p> <p>From routing and switching to network security and automation, our course encompasses every domain of the CCNA syllabus. With a blend of theoretical concepts and hands-on labs, learners will gain practical experience, ensuring they''re well-equipped to tackle real-world challenges post-certification. Whether you''re kickstarting your networking career or aiming to solidify your foundational knowledge, our CCNA Exam Prep is your trusted companion on this journey.<br />High Resolution USB Camera</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 975 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1882 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Unveil the captivating world of Non-Fungible Tokens (NFTs) with our detailed course tailored for both enthusiasts and artists. We begin by demystifying what NFT truly stands for, followed by a step-by-step guide on setting up your very own Ethereum wallet &ndash; a crucial step for anyone venturing into the digital art marketplace. Additionally, the course places a keen emphasis on producing captivating digital artworks that stand out, ensuring your creations not only possess aesthetic appeal but also substantial market value.</p> <p>The curriculum''s zenith is the hands-on demonstration of crafting an NFT on Rarible, one of the premier platforms for such endeavors. By the end of this comprehensive journey, participants will be adept at converting their digital masterpieces into sought-after NFTs, ready to be showcased and sold to eager collectors worldwide. With Tertiary Courses, transcend the traditional art landscape and embrace the digital future of collectibles.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 977 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1547 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The DevOps Essential Training program offers a comprehensive dive into the paradigm-shifting world of DevOps. Participants will embark on a journey that meticulously unpacks the core values and principles central to this revolutionary IT practice. As they delve deeper, learners will gain insights into choosing the right DevOps tools tailored to their specific needs, ensuring optimal outcomes for their projects.</p> <p>Mastering DevOps isn''t solely about understanding its principles or selecting tools; it''s also about fostering a culture that embraces collaboration, feedback, and continual improvement. This course illuminates the nuances of cultivating such a positive DevOps culture. Furthermore, participants will gain hands-on expertise in designing a seamless continuous delivery pipeline and constructing a robust continuous integration system, equipping them with the skill set to lead in the evolving landscape of IT and software development.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 981 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1491 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Explore the transformative world of Apache Kafka through our in-depth Essential Training. This course meticulously unravels the underpinnings of Apache Kafka, offering insights into its fundamental theory and robust architecture. Navigate the intricacies of setting up and running Kafka seamlessly across diverse operating systems, including Mac, Linux, and Windows.</p> <p>Further, immerse yourself in the practical dimensions of Kafka, mastering its command-line interface, and harnessing the power of its varied APIs. With dedicated modules on Kafka Connect, Streams, and Schema Registry, this course ensures you emerge as a proficient Kafka practitioner, well-equipped to handle real-world challenges and implementations.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 990 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 895 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Dive into the world of Agentic Process Automation by mastering the orchestration of Large Language Models (LLMs) and building advanced AI-driven applications. This course covers the essentials of LLM AI orchestration, from running local LLMs to building and debugging LLM apps, and offers a deep dive into Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) with techniques like text embedding, vector databases, and similarity searches. You''ll also learn to create robust RAG systems that enhance AI capabilities.</p> <p>Further, explore multi-agent AI workflows by implementing the ReAct agent framework, equipping agents with tools and skills, and setting up multi-agent systems using leading platforms like LangGraph, CrewAI, and AutoGen. Ideal for professionals looking to innovate with AI technologies and build complex automation systems.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 991 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1333 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Dive into the expansive universe of MEP (Mechanical, Electrical, and Plumbing) design with Autodesk Revit, one of the industry''s most revered design tools. This course, specially curated for professionals keen on amplifying their design acumen, offers a deep exploration into the myriad of electrical, mechanical, plumbing, and fire protection features embedded in Revit.</p> <p>Beyond the core MEP modules, the training encompasses practical techniques to seamlessly integrate Revit into existing workflows, ensuring design continuity and efficiency. Gain insights into creating intricate views, importing intricate details, curating comprehensive sheets, and effectively controlling revisions. A special segment on MEP fabrication parts will further empower participants with the know-how to transform their conceptual designs into tangible, ready-for-implementation plans. By the end of this course, participants will be adept at utilizing Autodesk Revit to bring their MEP visions to life with unmatched precision.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 992 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1764 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Step into the realm of advanced structural design with our Autodesk Revit Structural Training. Tailored for professionals aiming to harness the full potential of Revit for their structural projects, this course provides a deep dive into key features and tools that drive efficient and comprehensive design. Whether you''re looking to link architectural nuances, craft detailed view templates, or reinforce structures with rebar, this course illuminates the path to Revit proficiency.</p> <p>Learn to expertly create levels, design robust foundations, and bring retaining walls to life. The course intricately covers the techniques behind adding steel columns, designing brace frames, and establishing stairs and ramps. With a strong emphasis on detailing, annotating, and creating precise schedules, students will also become adept at plotting and sharing their intricate files seamlessly. By the end of this training, participants will be equipped to tackle complex structural projects with Autodesk Revit, ensuring efficiency, precision, and mastery in every design.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 993 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1813 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Embark on an intensive journey into the world of infrastructure design with the Autodesk Civil 3D Essential Training. This meticulously structured course is tailored to equip participants with the comprehensive knowledge and techniques essential for exploiting the full capabilities of Autodesk Civil 3D. As infrastructure projects become increasingly intricate, mastering tools like Civil 3D has evolved into a vital asset for every civil engineer and design professional.</p> <p>Our training modules span from understanding the intricacies of using point groups and description keys to advanced features such as creating and analyzing surfaces. Participants will delve deep into parcels creation, gain proficiency in working with alignments and profiles, and harness the power of feature lines and grading objects. The course also emphasizes creating view frames and sheets, ensuring participants leave with a holistic understanding of Autodesk Civil 3D''s diverse functionalities. By the course''s culmination, attendees will stand poised to elevate their infrastructure projects to unparalleled heights of precision and efficiency.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 994 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1921 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Step into the world of specialized CAD for electrical designs with our intensive AutoCAD Electrical Training. Designed for both novices and seasoned professionals, this course offers a deep dive into the features and tools unique to AutoCAD Electrical. Learn the art of effortlessly navigating the interface, crafting precise electrical drawings, and managing wires with expert precision.</p> <p>Expand your proficiency by mastering 3-phase ladders, working seamlessly with saved circuits, and utilizing the Circuit Clipboard and Circuit Builder for optimized design flows. The course also emphasizes skills such as editing panel drawings, employing PLC symbols, creating custom symbols, and effectively using the drawing update tools. By the conclusion of this training, participants will be armed with the skills and expertise to produce top-tier electrical designs using AutoCAD Electrical, ensuring their designs meet industry standards and exceed expectations.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 995 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1993 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Immerse yourself in the world of precision design with our comprehensive AutoCAD Mechanical Training. Crafted meticulously, this course serves as a roadmap to navigating and leveraging the potential of the AutoCAD Mechanical 2020 interface. From understanding layers and object properties to the creation of vital geometry, learners will experience firsthand the magic of AutoCAD''s tools and functionalities.</p> <p>Delve deep into the world of mechanical design as you explore techniques like manipulating geometry, inserting parts via part generators, and creating detailed drawing sheets. Learn to annotate parts, place dimensions with accuracy, and generate essential documentation such as bill of materials and parts lists. The course also highlights the importance of design factor calculations and the efficient reuse of existing drawing data. By its conclusion, participants will not only be familiar with AutoCAD Mechanical''s features but also be equipped to craft a standard template for streamlined future projects.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 996 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1818 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Dive into the profound capabilities of Machine Learning on the Google Cloud Platform with Tertiary Courses. Our in-depth curriculum sheds light on the myriad of hosting options available, be it Serverless, container-based, or via virtual machines, ensuring that you''re equipped to make informed decisions tailored to your specific needs. Grasp the essence of enabling GCP''s ML AIs and hone your skills in preparing data through Cloud Dataflow and Dataprep, pivotal for any robust ML pipeline.</p> <p>As we advance, delve into the intriguing world of modeling predictions for diverse media including images, video, text-to-speech, and cloud translation. Our hands-on approach ensures you''re adept at employing AutoML for streamlined ML tasks. We further delve into intricate machine learning and deep learning modules, wrapping up with a comprehensive understanding of modern ML architectures. This course is an indispensable asset for those enthusiastic about harnessing the full potential of machine learning on GCP.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 997 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1672 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The Microsoft 365 Copilot User Enablement Specialist course is designed to help organizations successfully adopt and integrate Copilot into their workflows. This course covers the fundamentals of Copilot for Microsoft 365, exploring its AI-driven capabilities, automation tools, and business applications. Participants will learn how to optimize and extend Copilot&rsquo;s features to enhance collaboration, efficiency, and data-driven decision-making.</p> <p>Beyond technical skills, this course provides strategies for driving user enablement and adoption across teams. Learn how to onboard employees, develop effective training programs, and measure the impact of Copilot in your organization. Gain insights into best practices for maximizing productivity, ensuring a smooth Copilot rollout, and optimizing AI-powered assistance for long-term business success.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 998 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1421 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Dive into the world of UI/UX design with our specialized Adobe XD Training. As the realm of digital design continuously evolves, it becomes crucial for professionals to stay updated with the latest tools and techniques. Adobe XD, a pioneer in the UI/UX design landscape, offers designers an integrated platform to craft, animate, and bring their visions to life. This course is meticulously curated to ensure participants gain a deep understanding of XD''s multifaceted features, making it an essential toolkit for any designer''s repertoire.</p> <p>Our training commences by introducing attendees to the intuitive XD interface, emphasizing seamless navigation techniques. Participants will explore the integration of prominent design tools like Photoshop, Illustrator, and Sketch with XD, amplifying their design capabilities. By harnessing the Repeat Grid feature, designers can effortlessly replicate elements, saving invaluable time. The course further delves into the realm of animations, teaching users how to add dynamic elements to their designs. Additionally, the innovative voice interactions feature of XD will be explored, paving the way for futuristic design solutions. The training culminates by guiding participants through the exporting process, ensuring designs are ready for any platform or medium. By the end of the sessions, participants will be well-versed in using Adobe XD, elevating their UI/UX design game manifold.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 999 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2022 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Mastering the basics in AI can help you jump-start your career and get ready to dive deeper into the other technical opportunities Azure offers. Artificial intelligence (AI) opens doors into possibilities that might have seemed like science fiction only yesterday. Using AI, you can build solutions, improve your apps and advance technology in many fields, including healthcare, financial management, and environmental protection, to name just a few.</p> <p>This course completely covers the AI-900 exam from start to finish.&nbsp;The Azure AI Fundamental AI-900 exam covers the following topics:</p> <ul> <li>LO1: Describe AI workloads and considerations (15-20%)</li> <li>LO2:&nbsp;Describe fundamental principles of machine learning on Azure (30-35%)</li> <li>LO3:&nbsp;Describe features of computer vision workloads on Azure (15-20%)</li> <li>LO4:&nbsp;Describe features of Natural Language Processing (NLP) workloads on Azure (15-20%)</li> <li>LO5:&nbsp;Describe features of conversational AI workloads on Azure (15-20%)</li> </ul> <p>This course goes over each requirement of the exam in detail and prepare you for the AI-900 exam.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1378 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2297 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Take your design and drafting skills to the next level with our comprehensive AutoCAD Professional Certification Preparation Course. This program, designed for aspiring and current design professionals, provides in-depth training on the powerful tools and functionalities of AutoCAD, one of the leading computer-aided design (CAD) software in the industry.</p> <p>From creating precise 2D drawings to intricate 3D models, you''ll learn everything you need to pass the AutoCAD certification exam and accelerate your career in design and drafting. Our course combines theoretical knowledge with practical exercises to ensure a thorough understanding of AutoCAD''s capabilities. With up to 70% WSQ funding subsidy available, you can invest in your professional development while enjoying significant savings. Enroll today and pave your path towards becoming an AutoCAD certified professional</p> <h2>Exam Voucher</h2> <p>This course include a Autodesk Exam Voucher at Our Pearson Vue Test Center.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1432 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1818 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>In this Microsoft Azure Cloud Fundamentals (AZ-900) course, participants will acquire key insights and knowledge necessary for mastering the fundamentals of Azure cloud computing. This course specifically caters to the requirements of the AZ-900 exam, providing a well-rounded preparation to ensure success. The learning outcomes include assessing cloud solutions and specifications for Azure cloud computing, developing an implementation plan, and formulating review processes to resolve implementation issues.</p> <p>Through practical applications and interactive lessons, students will develop a comprehensive understanding of Azure cloud solutions and gain the ability to implement and review Azure cloud computing in real-world scenarios. This course ensures that participants are well-equipped with the necessary skills and knowledge to excel in the AZ-900 exam, thereby opening up new opportunities for career advancement and professional growth in the field of cloud computing.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1383 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2089 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Embark on a journey into the world of cloud data management with our Microsoft Azure Data Fundamentals course. This course is designed to equip you with the knowledge and skills required to manage data effectively on the Microsoft Azure platform. You''ll explore the core concepts of Azure data services, diving deep into Azure databases, big data, and analytics solutions</p> <p>In our course, you''ll get hands-on experience using Microsoft Azure''s advanced data services, enabling you to implement practical solutions to real-world problems. We provide a comprehensive understanding of data processing and data analytics using Microsoft Azure. Don''t miss this opportunity to advance your career in the rapidly growing field of cloud data management</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 380 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1903 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Unlock your potential in the world of data science with Microsoft Azure Data Scientist Associate (DP-100) course. This course provides a comprehensive overview of how to design and implement data science solutions on the powerful Azure platform. Whether you are a beginner or an experienced professional, this course will help you gain a deeper understanding of Azure''s tools and techniques, enabling you to solve complex business problems with innovative solutions.</p> <p>This course focuses on practical applications, enabling you to handle real-world scenarios effectively. You will learn how to manage data science projects, interpret data patterns, run complex data mining models, and communicate the results effectively. By the end of the course, you''ll be equipped with the skills necessary to pass the DP-100 exam and become a certified professional, enhancing your career prospects in the exciting field of data science.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1435 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2078 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>This WSQ Create Intelligent Power Apps and Power Automate Workflows with Copilot equips learners with the skills to develop AI-powered applications and workflows using Microsoft Power Platform. Participants will explore how Copilot enhances Power Apps and Power Automate to streamline integrations and automate business processes. The course covers feasibility scanning, connecting disparate systems, and ensuring seamless data flow through API integrations. Learners will build, customize, and optimize canvas and model-driven apps while leveraging Dataverse for data management.</p> <p>Through hands-on exercises, participants will create approval flows, manage user information, and troubleshoot technical issues across Power Platform applications. The course also delves into configuring forms, dashboards, and managing solutions efficiently. By the end, learners will be proficient in building intelligent, automated workflows and applications using Power Apps, Power Automate, and Dataverse with Copilot AI.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1444 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2163 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>This WSQ Microsoft Certified Azure AI Engineer Associate (AI-102) Training provides learners with the expertise to design, build, and deploy AI-powered applications using Microsoft Azure AI Services. This course covers key areas, including computer vision, natural language processing, AI-powered search, document intelligence, and generative AI with Azure OpenAI. Participants will learn how to create, secure, and optimize AI services, enabling seamless integration into business applications. The curriculum also emphasizes responsible AI usage, content safety, and model monitoring to ensure ethical AI deployment.</p> <p>Through practical hands-on exercises, learners will develop intelligent applications that leverage Azure AI Vision for image analysis, Azure AI Language for NLP tasks, and Azure AI Search for knowledge mining. Participants will also work with Azure AI Document Intelligence for data extraction and explore generative AI applications using Azure OpenAI Service. By the end of this course, learners will be well-equipped to pass the Microsoft AI-102 certification and apply Azure AI solutions to real-world business challenges.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1442 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2296 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The Revit for Mechanical Design Professional Certification Prep course is an in-depth, comprehensive program designed to equip learners with the essential knowledge and skills required to become proficient Revit users in the field of mechanical design. This course focuses on the application of Autodesk Revit, a leading Building Information Modeling (BIM) software, to create detailed, accurate, and efficient mechanical systems for building projects.</p> <p>Over the duration of the course, students will gain hands-on experience with Revit tools, techniques, and best practices, enabling them to confidently pursue the Autodesk Certified Professional: Revit for Mechanical Design certification. Our experienced instructors will guide learners through real-world projects, ensuring they are well-prepared for the certification exam and a successful career in mechanical design.</p> <h2>Exam Voucher</h2> <p>This course include a Autodesk Exam Voucher at Our Pearson Vue Test Center.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1431 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1811 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>This course is designed to prepare students for the Microsoft Power BI Data Analyst (PL-300) certification exam. The course covers all the topics that are necessary to become a proficient Power BI data analyst, including data modeling, visualization, report creation, and dashboard design.</p> <p>The course begins with an introduction to Power BI and its various components. Students will learn about data sources, data modeling, and creating visuals in Power BI. The course also covers the process of creating reports, including adding visuals and formatting options.</p> <p>In addition to report creation, the course will cover advanced visualization techniques, including drill-throughs, bookmarks, and custom visuals. Students will also learn how to design dashboards and create KPIs using Power BI.</p> <p>Throughout the course, students will have access to hands-on labs and practical exercises to reinforce their learning. The labs will be based on real-world scenarios, allowing students to apply their knowledge to actual data analysis situations.</p> <p>By the end of the course, students will be prepared to take the Microsoft Power BI Data Analyst (PL-300) certification exam. The exam validates the skills needed to design and develop data models, reports, and dashboards in Power BI.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1418 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2451 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Revit for Architectural Design Professional Certification Prep is a comprehensive course designed to equip learners with the knowledge and skills required to excel in the architectural design industry using Autodesk Revit. This course covers essential topics such as modeling, documentation, collaboration, coordination, project standards, and information analysis, all in the context of Revit.</p> <p>Throughout this course, participants will learn how to leverage design research, manage work processes, resolve unforeseen problems, and guide design creation processes to generate breakthrough solutions. Learners will also explore the impact of design and technological trends on user needs and behavior, understand technical and process constraints, and become proficient in prevalent industry design processes, methodologies, and tools.</p> <p>Upon completion of the course, learners will be well-prepared to devise practical and feasible design processes, consult others for advice on best practices, and articulate design options to achieve buy-in from stakeholders. This course is ideal for architects, designers, engineers, and other professionals seeking to enhance their Revit expertise and attain the Autodesk Revit for Architectural Design Professional Certification.</p> <h2>Exam Voucher</h2> <p>This course include a Autodesk Exam Voucher at Our Pearson Vue Test Center.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1428 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2213 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The Cisco Certified Network Associate (CCNA) course offers an in-depth dive into the world of networking, providing participants with the knowledge and skills needed to design, configure, and manage both wired and wireless network connections. Whether you''re new to the field or looking to enhance your professional portfolio, this course ensures a solid grounding in core networking concepts, aligning with industry best practices and standards.</p> <p>Beyond just theoretical understanding, our CCNA training emphasizes hands-on experience and real-world application. Participants will tackle a range of networking challenges, from IP addressing and routing to network security and automation, all under the guidance of experienced instructors with deep industry insights. By the end of the course, you''ll be well-prepared to ace the CCNA certification exam and set a strong foundation for a thriving career in networking.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1450 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1385 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Dive into the world of advanced structural design with our WSQ - Revit for Structural Design Professional Certification Prep course. This comprehensive program is designed to equip you with the skills to perform intricate engineering calculations and develop conceptual designs using Revit. You will learn to create detailed design specifications tailored to engineering systems and manage material requisitions for diverse projects. The course emphasizes practical skills in developing and supervising technical drawings, both 2D and 3D, ensuring you are proficient in using Revit for mechanical design.</p> <p>The curriculum advances to cover critical aspects of mechanical design drawing in Revit. You will gain expertise in reviewing drawings for regulatory compliance, understanding guidelines and conventions, and ensuring project requirements are met. Emphasis is also placed on evaluating the adherence of mechanical design drawings to regulations, developing efficient drawing methods, and optimizing equipment design considering cost and time. This course is a gateway to mastering Revit for structural design, making you an asset in the engineering and architectural industries.</p> <h2>Exam Voucher</h2> <p>This course include a Autodesk Exam Voucher at Our Pearson Vue Test Center.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 721 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2126 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Embark on a transformative journey that prepares you to excel in the highly demanded field of cloud computing. Our Microsoft Azure Administrator Associate Exam Prep course is meticulously crafted to facilitate a seamless learning experience. Encompassing a detailed study plan, it hones your skills in managing and maintaining Azure environments, using Azure PowerShell, implementing storage solutions, and much more. With expert insights and practical applications, it fosters a robust understanding, paving the way for a successful career in the Microsoft Azure domain.</p> <p>The learning outcomes of this course are designed to empower participants with the knowledge and abilities to effectively tackle real-world challenges. Through a blend of theoretical knowledge and hands-on experience, learners will master the intricacies of Azure administration. As you progress through the course, you will gain competency in various Azure services and features, enhancing your readiness for the certification exam. Leveraging the available WSQ funding subsidy, this course stands as an affordable pathway to elevate your career prospects and credibility in the IT sector.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1453 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2316 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Embark on a transformative journey with our Microsoft Power Platform Developer Certification Prep course. Explore the ins and outs of Power Platform, from creating powerful apps with PowerApps, automating workflows with Power Automate, to designing virtual agents with Power Virtual Agents.</p> <p>With a blend of theoretical understanding and hands-on exercises, this course ensures that participants are well-equipped to take on the certification exam with confidence. Grasp the core concepts, techniques, and best practices used by top developers in the industry. Enhance your skills and elevate your career prospects in the dynamic world of Microsoft Power Platform development.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1456 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1844 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Immerse yourself in the transformative power of Kubernetes with our WSQ Certified Kubernetes Administrator (CKA) Exam Prep course. This course is meticulously designed to imbue learners with a strong foundational knowledge and practical skills necessary for developing a Kubernetes architectural proof of concept. The journey through this course will enable learners to identify the technical and practical requirements in a Kubernetes setup and subsequently develop a solution architecture within Kubernetes. As learners delve deeper, they will also prepare a technical blueprint for a Kubernetes-based solution focusing on crucial aspects like security and storage, ensuring a comprehensive understanding of deploying and managing applications within a Kubernetes environment.</p> <p>Transitioning to real-world application, this course emphasizes on demonstrating a Kubernetes solution for a specific business problem, thereby allowing learners to apply their acquired knowledge in practical scenarios. Additionally, the course covers the implementation of regular monitoring of the Kubernetes system and performing necessary troubleshooting, which are essential skills for maintaining a robust and efficient Kubernetes environment. Through a blend of theoretical learning and practical exercises, learners will not only be well-prepared for the Certified Kubernetes Administrator exam but also be empowered with the ability to leverage Kubernetes for solving complex business problems and significantly contribute to their organization''s technological advancements.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1463 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2053 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Embark on a transformative journey with our Microsoft Power Platform Fundamentals Exam Prep Course. This course is meticulously designed to equip you with the knowledge and skills needed to identify opportunities and assess Power Platform for connecting various devices, databases, software, and applications. You will learn how to utilize Power Platform to seamlessly integrate data, functions, and support API-level integration, ensuring a smooth and efficient workflow.</p> <p>Our expert instructors will guide you through the process of performing tests and verifying the functioning of Power Platform applications. You will also learn how to highlight and address technical, compatibility, or performance issues following the integration of Power Platform. With our support, you will be well-prepared to tackle the Microsoft Power Platform Fundamentals Exam, opening doors to new opportunities and career growth in the ever-evolving field of technology.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1309 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2116 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>WSQ Hands On Power Automate Desktop RPA for Work Process Automation equips learners with practical skills to identify automation opportunities across devices, applications, and databases. Through hands-on training, participants will gain experience in using Power Automate Desktop to design, test, and implement robotic process automation workflows. Learners will understand how to evaluate feasibility, troubleshoot integration issues, and optimize automation using real-time data and APIs.</p> <p>The course covers core topics including automation fundamentals, integrating advanced logic, leveraging different technologies within Power Automate, and building secure custom connectors. By the end of the course, learners will be equipped to enhance digital transformation in their workplace by automating repetitive tasks, increasing efficiency, and resolving technical compatibility issues in automation systems.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1229 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2091 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Embark on a transformative journey towards becoming a Google Professional Machine Learning Engineer. Our comprehensive preparation course is meticulously designed to cover all the critical facets of machine learning, ensuring you gain the expertise needed to pass the certification exam confidently. By engaging with this course, you will dive deep into the development of scalable machine learning models, understanding complex data pipelines, and deploying robust ML projects using Google Cloud technologies. This certification signifies to employers that you possess the acumen to leverage machine learning in a way that drives powerful, innovative solutions.</p> <p>This advanced training program goes beyond the fundamentals, providing insights into machine learning algorithms, model optimization, and problem-solving techniques crucial for real-world applications. You will learn how to approach machine learning engineering with an ethical and socially responsible lens while mastering the skills to build, test, and deploy AI systems that are scalable and reliable. Our curriculum is crafted to ensure that upon completion, you will not only be prepared for the Google Professional Machine Learning Engineer exam but also equipped to propel your career forward in the thriving field of AI and machine learning.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1209 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1815 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Dynamics 365 Fundamentals (CRM) Certification Prep Course. This meticulously designed course aims at equipping learners with the necessary knowledge and skills to develop effective strategies for implementing Microsoft Dynamics 365 CRM capabilities. The course goes beyond mere theoretical concepts, enabling learners to utilize the tools proficiently to disseminate information. Furthermore, it introduces frameworks to define customer journeys for marketing on Microsoft Dynamics 365 CRM, aiding in crafting personalized customer interactions that drive engagement and conversions.</p> <p>Transitioning to a more advanced understanding, the course delves into managing strategies to optimize the deployment and performance of Microsoft Dynamics 365 CRM, ensuring an efficient and responsive CRM environment. Learners will also gain the expertise to draw actionable insights from Microsoft Dynamics 365 CRM to evaluate team&rsquo;s performance, fostering a culture of continuous improvement. Additionally, reviewing research outcomes and recommending investments for Microsoft Dynamics 365 CRM will be covered, empowering learners to make informed decisions that contribute to the CRM system''s continuous enhancement. The knowledge acquired from this course will not only prepare learners for the certification exam but also set a solid foundation for a rewarding career in managing customer relations and marketing strategies using Microsoft Dynamics 365 CRM.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1461 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2638 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Embark on the journey to becoming a Google Associate Cloud Engineer with our comprehensive certification prep course. Gain an in-depth understanding of core cloud services, their application, and how to manage Google Cloud Platform technology efficiently. This course is designed to equip you with the knowledge and skills to design, develop, manage, and administer application infrastructure and data solutions on Google Cloud.</p> <p>Delve into the essential elements of GCP, including IAM, networking, auto-scaling, and load balancing to ensure you''re prepared for the exam and beyond. Our expert-led training will help you understand how to set up a cloud solution environment, plan and configure a cloud solution, as well as deploy and implement a cloud solution, ensuring a complete grasp of the platform''s capabilities. With this course, you''ll be well on your way to attaining your Google Associate Cloud Engineer certification, advancing your career, and embracing the cloud computing revolution.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 723 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1501 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>This Microsoft Certified Fabric Data Engineer Associate (DP-700) Training equips participants with the practical knowledge and skills to design, implement, and manage modern data solutions using Microsoft Fabric. Learners will identify optimal data sources and processing methods based on business requirements and learn to orchestrate data movement, implement real-time intelligence, and use Apache Spark for data transformations. The course emphasizes practical application of lakehouses and Delta Lake tables, as well as maintaining data accuracy and business alignment through robust transformation techniques.</p> <p>Participants will gain hands-on experience in managing data environments, including secure access control, activity monitoring, and CI/CD implementation within Microsoft Fabric. Through various real-world scenarios, learners will process multiple data streams, maintain data integrity, and construct optimized data warehouse systems. This course is ideal for professionals seeking to boost their data engineering capabilities and prepare for the DP-700 certification..</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 624 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2237 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The Microsoft Certified Endpoint Administrator Associate course offers an in-depth exploration into the administration and security of Microsoft Endpoint environments. Participants will start by exploring the fundamentals of endpoint management, including device enrollment and configuration profiles for users and devices. The course covers a wide range of essential topics, such as managing Microsoft Entra identities, device authentication, and the deployment and update of applications through Intune and Configuration Manager.</p> <p>Advanced modules focus on enhancing endpoint security through the management of Microsoft Defender for Endpoint, implementing device compliance policies, and protecting organizational access with modern authentication methods like Windows Hello and multi-factor authentication. Learners will gain practical experience in troubleshooting security issues, coordinating access control rights, and investigating unauthorized access incidents. The course also delves into deploying devices using both on-premises and cloud-based tools, including Windows Autopilot and Azure Virtual Desktop, preparing participants to administer complex security programs and effectively analyze system updates'' impacts on Microsoft Endpoint administration. By the end of this course, attendees will be equipped with the knowledge and skills to perform comprehensive Microsoft Endpoint system administration and secure enterprise environments against emerging security threats.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 219 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2635 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>This comprehensive course on Designing and Implementing Microsoft DevOps Solutions equips participants with the expertise to develop a Microsoft DevOps architectural proof of concept, identify technical requirements, and architect a solution within Microsoft DevOps frameworks. Through a blend of theoretical knowledge and practical exercises, learners will delve into the creation of a technical blueprint focusing on security and storage solutions, and demonstrate the application of Microsoft DevOps solutions to real-world business problems. The curriculum covers a wide range of topics, including the fundamentals of DevOps, choosing the right project, agile development practices, Azure DevOps, GitHub, continuous integration and deployment with Azure Pipelines and GitHub Actions, infrastructure as code, and strategies for dependency management. Additionally, the course emphasizes the importance of implementing regular monitoring and troubleshooting of the Microsoft DevOps system to ensure optimal performance.</p> <p>Building upon a foundation of agile methodologies and DevOps tools selection, the course further explores advanced areas such as developing for enterprise DevOps, managing infrastructure as code using Azure, and designing a release strategy. Learners will gain hands-on experience with Azure Resource Manager templates, Azure CLI, Azure Automation, and GitHub Packages, alongside an understanding of implementing continuous feedback mechanisms and validating code bases for compliance. By the end of this course, participants will be well-prepared to design and implement efficient, secure, and scalable Microsoft DevOps solutions, aligning technical capabilities with business objectives for enhanced productivity and competitiveness.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 650 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2865 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The ISC2 Information Systems Security Professional (CISSP) Exam Prep course is meticulously designed for professionals seeking to deepen their knowledge and skills in information security. The course begins with a focus on Security and Risk Management, emphasizing professional ethics, security concepts, the legal environment, and secure design principles. Participants will gain a clear understanding of the key aspects of Asset Security, including managing information assets and data security life cycles.</p> <p>Moving into the intricacies of Security Architecture and Engineering, the course covers vulnerabilities assessment, cryptographic systems, and the essentials of cryptanalysis. Communication and Network Security is another critical topic, providing insight into the OSI and TCP/IP models and their application in secure network design. Identity and Access Management (IAM) is thoroughly explored, highlighting the importance of managing identities, access controls, and authentication systems.</p> <p>Additionally, the course emphasizes Security Assessment and Testing, enabling learners to design effective security assessment strategies and analyze organizational security performance. Security Operations is a key module that includes incident management, logging, and monitoring activities, as well as implementing backup and recovery strategies. The final topic, Software Development Security, delves into the vulnerabilities inherent in software systems, malware and ransomware threats, and the implementation of security controls in software development ecosystems. This course ensures that participants are well-prepared for the CISSP exam, equipping them with the knowledge to develop action plans, evaluate technologies, introduce security controls, and address lapses in organizational security standards.</p> <h2>Exam Voucher</h2> <p>This course include a Autodesk Exam Voucher at Our Pearson Vue Test Center.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 788 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2340 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>This Cisco Certified Network Professional (CCNP) course for the ENCOR exam is meticulously designed for networking professionals seeking to elevate their skills in network configuration and management. The first part of the course focuses on translating organizational networking needs into technical configurations. Participants will learn to select appropriate network components, understanding their functions and interdependencies. This segment emphasizes on identifying key network components for configuration, and mastering techniques in server and device implementation aligned with technical requirements.</p> <p>The latter part of the course delves into the practical implementation of servers and devices, following organizational network blueprints to enhance network performance and reliability. Learners will gain expertise in managing network access in compliance with organizational guidelines, ensuring secure and efficient user connectivity. Additionally, the course covers the selection and deployment of network management tools to optimize network performance and user experience. Participants will also develop skills in conducting regular network reporting and administration, using assessment tools to ensure network stability and alignment with organizational objectives.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1605 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1760 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>The Microsoft Identity and Access Administrator (SC-300) course equips participants with the expertise to implement and manage security, compliance, and identity solutions across Microsoft-based environments. This course covers a broad range of topics including the foundational identity concepts in Microsoft Entra ID, hybrid identity solutions, and multifactor authentication. Participants will learn to configure and manage Microsoft Entra roles, handle external identities, and deploy Conditional Access policies effectively.</p> <p>The curriculum delves into advanced identity protection with Microsoft Entra Identity Protection, and integration of enterprise apps for Single Sign-On (SSO). By understanding the strategic frameworks and data protection policies, learners will be prepared to enhance their organization''s security measures against emerging risks and threats. The course also addresses the management of privileged access and the implementation of entitlement management, ensuring comprehensive coverage of Microsoft&rsquo;s identity and access capabilities.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1607 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2541 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>WSQ Administering Microsoft Azure SQL Solutions (DP-300) provides comprehensive training on maintaining, securing, and optimizing SQL databases on Azure. Participants will develop efficient data processes, design secure environments, and implement robust data integration procedures tailored to business requirements.</p> <p>The course covers a wide range of topics, including deploying SQL Server in Azure, migrating SQL workloads, configuring database security, monitoring performance, and automating database tasks. Additionally, it emphasizes high availability and disaster recovery strategies, ensuring participants are well-equipped to handle various database scenarios in Azure environments.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1608 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 1846 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>Immerse yourself in the transformative power of Kubernetes with our WSQ Certified Kubernetes Administrator (CKA) Exam Prep course. This course is meticulously designed to imbue learners with a strong foundational knowledge and practical skills necessary for developing a Kubernetes architectural proof of concept. The journey through this course will enable learners to identify the technical and practical requirements in a Kubernetes setup and subsequently develop a solution architecture within Kubernetes. As learners delve deeper, they will also prepare a technical blueprint for a Kubernetes-based solution focusing on crucial aspects like security and storage, ensuring a comprehensive understanding of deploying and managing applications within a Kubernetes environment.</p> <p>Transitioning to real-world application, this course emphasizes on demonstrating a Kubernetes solution for a specific business problem, thereby allowing learners to apply their acquired knowledge in practical scenarios. Additionally, the course covers the implementation of regular monitoring of the Kubernetes system and performing necessary troubleshooting, which are essential skills for maintaining a robust and efficient Kubernetes environment. Through a blend of theoretical learning and practical exercises, learners will not only be well-prepared for the Certified Kubernetes Administrator exam but also be empowered with the ability to leverage Kubernetes for solving complex business problems and significantly contribute to their organization''s technological advancements.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1855 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2053 AND @is_sg = 1;
UPDATE `catalog_product_entity_text` SET `value` = '<p>In the era of advanced artificial intelligence, the ability to develop and fine-tune Generative AI (GenAI) models is critical for building high-performance, domain-specific solutions. This course, Generative AI Model Development and Fine Tuning, equips learners with the practical skills and technical knowledge to design, optimize, and evaluate modern AI models using cloud-based tools and frameworks.</p> <p>Learners will begin by exploring techniques for data ingestion and transformation, including the use of synthetic data to enhance model performance and address data limitations. The course then focuses on building efficient data pipelines and feature engineering workflows, applying optimization strategies to improve model training and scalability.</p> <p>Participants will gain hands-on experience in fine-tuning pre-trained multi-modal models, leveraging advanced training approaches, loss functions, and parameter optimization techniques to adapt models for specific use cases. Emphasis is placed on improving model accuracy, efficiency, and robustness in real-world deployment scenarios.</p> <p>In addition, the course addresses critical considerations in modern AI development, including bias detection, explainability, and alignment with performance benchmarks. Learners will evaluate AI solutions to ensure they are reliable, ethical, and aligned with organizational and regulatory expectations.</p> <p>By the end of the course, learners will be able to design end-to-end GenAI workflows&mdash;from data preparation to model fine-tuning and evaluation&mdash;enabling them to develop scalable, responsible, and high-performing AI solutions for a wide range of applications.</p> <p>This course is suitable for data professionals, AI practitioners, and developers seeking to deepen their expertise in Generative AI model development, optimization, and fine-tuning techniques.</p>' WHERE `attribute_id` = @sd_attr AND `entity_id` = 1861 AND `store_id` = 0 AND CHAR_LENGTH(`value`) = 2800 AND @is_sg = 1;

